(1357720, 171543, 36604, '<td valign="top">The massive saturation of red into all elements of this shot hurts it significantly, and it doesn''t help that the odd color and sudden drop in intensity draw the eyes somewhat to the trees, which seem out of focus.  This is probably from focusing on the lights, and then using too low an aperture.  If this was tripod-based and there was no wind, you might have tried shooting at f/11 or even f/22 to see if you could get the entire scene.  I think you were going for drama with all the red, but it doesn''t really work for me.</td>', 'The massive saturation of red into all elements of this shot hurts it significantly, and it doesn''t help that the odd color and sudden drop in intensity draw the eyes somewhat to the trees, which seem out of focus.  This is probably from focusing on the lights, and then using too low an aperture.  If this was tripod-based and there was no wind, you might have tried shooting at f/11 or even f/22 to see if you could get the entire scene.  I think you were going for drama with all the red, but it doesn''t really work for me.', '2005-05-04 02:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1357721, 171661, 35316, '<td valign="top">good pic.  looks like the steeple is cropped a bit tight.  And I wonder about getting rid of the church all together.  competes a bit with the central statue in my opinion, but wonderful shot, great reflection and nice exposure.  great work.</td>', 'good pic.  looks like the steeple is cropped a bit tight.  And I wonder about getting rid of the church all together.  competes a bit with the central statue in my opinion, but wonderful shot, great reflection and nice exposure.  great work.', '2005-05-04 02:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
