(1357728, 173346, 36604, '<td valign="top">The second night traffic scene so far, and I''m only half a dozen pictures in.  The lighting on this is good, though due to the sheer number of lights, the flaring effect on all of them adds up to quite a distraction.  The lit building in the background is a nice touch, but overall the scene strikes me as very ordinary.  I may just be very jaded to this sort of effect.</td>', 'The second night traffic scene so far, and I''m only half a dozen pictures in.  The lighting on this is good, though due to the sheer number of lights, the flaring effect on all of them adds up to quite a distraction.  The lit building in the background is a nice touch, but overall the scene strikes me as very ordinary.  I may just be very jaded to this sort of effect.', '2005-05-04 02:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1357729, 173077, 30861, '<td valign="top">I''m sure it was taken late at night, but it''s so "lit" that I get no "sense" of night, which is what I take the challenge to be about. A nice shot of this loving couple, however.</td>', 'I''m sure it was taken late at night, but it''s so "lit" that I get no "sense" of night, which is what I take the challenge to be about. A nice shot of this loving couple, however.', '2005-05-04 02:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
