(1357787, 172697, 30861, '<td valign="top">the challenge REQUIRES "late night" and this would seem to be a sunset/dawn. Even if it IS the moon, which I doubt, then by color-shifting it you made it a sunset shot. It''s a nice shot but doesn''t fit this challenge IMO</td>', 'the challenge REQUIRES "late night" and this would seem to be a sunset/dawn. Even if it IS the moon, which I doubt, then by color-shifting it you made it a sunset shot. It''s a nice shot but doesn''t fit this challenge IMO', '2005-05-04 02:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1357789, 173726, 37320, '<td valign="top">Judging from the color of the shot glass, Id say you just ordered a redbull and vodka and someone just requested the DJ play sandstorm.  If I guessed wrong, hey no big deal, but if I guessed right... I am photointerpetic genius.</td>', 'Judging from the color of the shot glass, Id say you just ordered a redbull and vodka and someone just requested the DJ play sandstorm.  If I guessed wrong, hey no big deal, but if I guessed right... I am photointerpetic genius.', '2005-05-04 02:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1357790, 172697, 35709, '<td valign="top">This is not late at night!</td>', 'This is not late at night!', '2005-05-04 02:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1357791, 173159, 36604, '<td valign="top">Well, the basic idea isn''t necessarily bad, and I much prefer stopped traffic to the somewhat overdone long-exposure shots I''ve been seeing (particularly because you seem to have grabbed a wide array of colors in the various lights on the cars), but the focus seems very poor, the colors are off, noise is visible, and the rotation, which *almost* works with the cars alone, throws the scene off because the lamp posts are also angled.<br/></td>', 'Well, the basic idea isn''t necessarily bad, and I much prefer stopped traffic to the somewhat overdone long-exposure shots I''ve been seeing (particularly because you seem to have grabbed a wide array of colors in the various lights on the cars), but the focus seems very poor, the colors are off, noise is visible, and the rotation, which *almost* works with the cars alone, throws the scene off because the lamp posts are also angled.', '2005-05-04 02:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1357792, 172322, 35764, '<td valign="top">I love the ethereal glow that the lilly''s have, as well as the composition.</td>', 'I love the ethereal glow that the lilly''s have, as well as the composition.', '2005-05-04 02:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1357793, 172423, 30861, '<td valign="top">needs to be outside for this challenge. nice shot though</td>', 'needs to be outside for this challenge. nice shot though', '2005-05-04 02:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1357794, 172431, 37320, '<td valign="top">Good picture but there''s just something... missing.  I cant put my finger on it, but itll come to me later.</td>', 'Good picture but there''s just something... missing.  I cant put my finger on it, but itll come to me later.', '2005-05-04 02:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1357796, 173859, 36604, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting.  Minor nit: I wish I could see some stars.  That might be impossible with so much albedo from the city.</td>', 'Very nice lighting.  Minor nit: I wish I could see some stars.  That might be impossible with so much albedo from the city.', '2005-05-04 02:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1357799, 173451, 30861, '<td valign="top">outside? required by challenge...</td>', 'outside? required by challenge...', '2005-05-04 02:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1357800, 172564, 36604, '<td valign="top">Hm.  I like the basic concept of the water stretching out the lights, and there is some variation in color which is interesting, but the final result is for some reason a little harsh on my eyes.</td>', 'Hm.  I like the basic concept of the water stretching out the lights, and there is some variation in color which is interesting, but the final result is for some reason a little harsh on my eyes.', '2005-05-04 02:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1357801, 173343, 30861, '<td valign="top">The challenge requires "late at night" which this is not</td>', 'The challenge requires "late at night" which this is not', '2005-05-04 02:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1357802, 173887, 33182, '<td valign="top">Nothing about the picture itself, but what the heck is that? -8-</td>', 'Nothing about the picture itself, but what the heck is that? -8-', '2005-05-04 02:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1357804, 172521, 30861, '<td valign="top">How id twilight "late night"?</td>', 'How id twilight "late night"?', '2005-05-04 02:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1357805, 173558, 36604, '<td valign="top">Another person using a starflare lens filter?  With one or two lights that are the focus or main support for an image that''s okay, but with so many lights...  well, it just looks artificial.  Colors on the water are nice.  Buildings seem fuzzy, particularly the lit text at the top that the brain wants to think should be readable, and aren''t.</td>', 'Another person using a starflare lens filter?  With one or two lights that are the focus or main support for an image that''s okay, but with so many lights...  well, it just looks artificial.  Colors on the water are nice.  Buildings seem fuzzy, particularly the lit text at the top that the brain wants to think should be readable, and aren''t.', '2005-05-04 02:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1357807, 173908, 37320, '<td valign="top">You know that one level, in Mario, (not the new one but like the old school one) where you''re on the pirate ship at night and you have to outrun the moving screen and dodge cannonballs and such.  This picture is kind of like that, minus of course the cartoon dudes.  Long story short, good lighting.</td>', 'You know that one level, in Mario, (not the new one but like the old school one) where you''re on the pirate ship at night and you have to outrun the moving screen and dodge cannonballs and such.  This picture is kind of like that, minus of course the cartoon dudes.  Long story short, good lighting.', '2005-05-04 02:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1357808, 172519, 35764, '<td valign="top">great photo, awesome composition.  May be picky and just my interpretation of "late night", but how late was the shot - interested because of the pink glow on the horizon.  Still a great shot.</td>', 'great photo, awesome composition.  May be picky and just my interpretation of "late night", but how late was the shot - interested because of the pink glow on the horizon.  Still a great shot.', '2005-05-04 02:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1357809, 173430, 35764, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot</td>', 'Interesting shot', '2005-05-04 02:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1357810, 173105, 11960, '<td valign="top">areal shot of NYC... did you get arrested? =]</td>', 'areal shot of NYC... did you get arrested? =]', '2005-05-04 02:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1357811, 172423, 33182, '<td valign="top">The challenge said to take apicture "outside", other than that the picture seems a little soft on the focus.</td>', 'The challenge said to take apicture "outside", other than that the picture seems a little soft on the focus.', '2005-05-04 02:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1357812, 173916, 36604, '<td valign="top">You''re probably going to get hammered for submitting a small image.  That doesn''t actually bother me, so I''m not docking points.  I do like the silhouettes and the balance, but I there is just enough of the outer frame visible to make me wish it were better lit so I could see more of the details, which also seem interesting.</td>', 'You''re probably going to get hammered for submitting a small image.  That doesn''t actually bother me, so I''m not docking points.  I do like the silhouettes and the balance, but I there is just enough of the outer frame visible to make me wish it were better lit so I could see more of the details, which also seem interesting.', '2005-05-04 02:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1357813, 171705, 33182, '<td valign="top">way too small.</td>', 'way too small.', '2005-05-04 02:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1357814, 173127, 37320, '<td valign="top">You must be proud of that accord.  Throw in a silhoutte of a suitcase or a caged animal or something like that, and you''ve got a story.</td>', 'You must be proud of that accord.  Throw in a silhoutte of a suitcase or a caged animal or something like that, and you''ve got a story.', '2005-05-04 02:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1357815, 173105, 37320, '<td valign="top">Hey, I can see my house!</td>', 'Hey, I can see my house!', '2005-05-04 02:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1357816, 172385, 35764, '<td valign="top">cool photo, worked really well.  I''m not sure if it is the flash in the passengers wing mirror, but if you had angled it out a bit more that bright flash of light wouldn''t have been there.</td>', 'cool photo, worked really well.  I''m not sure if it is the flash in the passengers wing mirror, but if you had angled it out a bit more that bright flash of light wouldn''t have been there.', '2005-05-04 02:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1357817, 173745, 25355, '<td valign="top">Good try - for the brown ribbon.  Bad try at an old old joke.</td>', 'Good try - for the brown ribbon.  Bad try at an old old joke.', '2005-05-04 02:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1357818, 173817, 36604, '<td valign="top">Cute action shot.  I wish you''d chosen a bare stretch of fence, however, as that car and the glare on the corner reflector are very distracting.</td>', 'Cute action shot.  I wish you''d chosen a bare stretch of fence, however, as that car and the glare on the corner reflector are very distracting.', '2005-05-04 02:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1357819, 173581, 35764, '<td valign="top">very tranquil</td>', 'very tranquil', '2005-05-04 02:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
