(1357825, 172827, 36604, '<td valign="top">Having a few stars in the sky (is that Orion''s Belt I see?) is nice, and the colors on the roof are very nice, but somehow the cabins look plastic and toylike (did you perhaps overdo noise reduction?) and the light light glaring off the edge of the main building is harsh.</td>', 'Having a few stars in the sky (is that Orion''s Belt I see?) is nice, and the colors on the roof are very nice, but somehow the cabins look plastic and toylike (did you perhaps overdo noise reduction?) and the light light glaring off the edge of the main building is harsh.', '2005-05-04 02:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1357826, 173384, 36604, '<td valign="top">Nice colors in all of the reflections.</td>', 'Nice colors in all of the reflections.', '2005-05-04 02:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1357827, 173916, 35709, '<td valign="top">I really liked the thumbnail and then was disappointed to see that your image is so small and lacking detail.</td>', 'I really liked the thumbnail and then was disappointed to see that your image is so small and lacking detail.', '2005-05-04 02:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1357828, 172483, 37320, '<td valign="top">"Where clouds really come from"  This photographer takes you on a expose'' that no journalist has dared to before!  *This saturday at 8 ..only on Fox News!*</td>', '"Where clouds really come from"  This photographer takes you on a expose'' that no journalist has dared to before!  *This saturday at 8 ..only on Fox News!*', '2005-05-04 02:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1357831, 173764, 35764, '<td valign="top">very interesting shot.  I love the depth of field and the focus on the raindrops.  go shoot it again for the outside looking in challenge, it''ll be great there as well :)</td>', 'very interesting shot.  I love the depth of field and the focus on the raindrops.  go shoot it again for the outside looking in challenge, it''ll be great there as well :)', '2005-05-04 02:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
