(1357839, 173874, 37320, '<td valign="top">Good vectors, framing, aperature, sepia toning, rendering and all that other stuff my Photo teacher taught while I was doodling.</td>', 'Good vectors, framing, aperature, sepia toning, rendering and all that other stuff my Photo teacher taught while I was doodling.', '2005-05-04 02:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
