(1357842, 173552, 36604, '<td valign="top">I like the basic concept.  It tells a story, of sorts.  Nits: the glare from the top sign is very distracting.  Tthere might not be much you can do with it, but you might have tried applying a color filter to it before converting to black and white to see if you could dim it or at least enhance the contrast on the lettering.</td>', 'I like the basic concept.  It tells a story, of sorts.  Nits: the glare from the top sign is very distracting.  Tthere might not be much you can do with it, but you might have tried applying a color filter to it before converting to black and white to see if you could dim it or at least enhance the contrast on the lettering.', '2005-05-04 02:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
