(1357877, 173582, 36604, '<td valign="top">In honor of John of Iverkething? At the northerly latitudes where this originates, even the lewd aspects are unlikely to approach full nudity -- it''s just too damn cold.  No points deducted for that, however.<br/> <br/>I wish the shadows were slightly lighter, since I can see the arms of a figure in the center, but can''t really make out the rest.  I do like the face being lost into shadow on the right, and the smoke in the background.</td>', 'In honor of John of Iverkething? At the northerly latitudes where this originates, even the lewd aspects are unlikely to approach full nudity -- it''s just too damn cold.  No points deducted for that, however. I wish the shadows were slightly lighter, since I can see the arms of a figure in the center, but can''t really make out the rest.  I do like the face being lost into shadow on the right, and the smoke in the background.', '2005-05-04 02:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
