(1357974, 173913, 35530, '<td valign="top">A few things I would have tried differently with this shot. First, focus is off. Then, a more difused light should have been used so you don''t get that wash-out look that is lacking in details. Also would have tried to get an off-center shot or cropped so th frog wasn''t in the center.</td>', 'A few things I would have tried differently with this shot. First, focus is off. Then, a more difused light should have been used so you don''t get that wash-out look that is lacking in details. Also would have tried to get an off-center shot or cropped so th frog wasn''t in the center.', '2005-05-04 03:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
