(1358087, 172855, 35316, '<td valign="top">Good effort.  I like the use of reflection in your photo. I wonder if you moved the shot to the left, and got rid of the the houses and street lamp whether it might be a stronger photo.  Was there a reason for including these houses?  They do add perspective, but perhaps the strength of the church''s architecture on it''s own might be enough (along with the well captured reflection).  Nice pic.</td>', 'Good effort.  I like the use of reflection in your photo. I wonder if you moved the shot to the left, and got rid of the the houses and street lamp whether it might be a stronger photo.  Was there a reason for including these houses?  They do add perspective, but perhaps the strength of the church''s architecture on it''s own might be enough (along with the well captured reflection).  Nice pic.', '2005-05-04 03:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
