(1358369, 172423, 30018, '<td valign="top">Congratulations.  You have a winner here.  I''m sure of it.  This is the stand out image of the entire group.  I think a lot of people don''t realize that "late night" happens inside as well as out.  This is a wonderful image, with a lot of interest, and  a lot of wonder light.  Thank you for staying inside.  &lt;10&gt;</td>', 'Congratulations.  You have a winner here.  I''m sure of it.  This is the stand out image of the entire group.  I think a lot of people don''t realize that "late night" happens inside as well as out.  This is a wonderful image, with a lot of interest, and  a lot of wonder light.  Thank you for staying inside.  <10>', '2005-05-04 06:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358370, 173888, 32108, '<td valign="top">good job on the colours</td>', 'good job on the colours', '2005-05-04 06:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358371, 172385, 34247, '<td valign="top">Nice photo evocative of speed, freedom, etc. The foreground lighting, imho, is too much and the harsh shadow on the dashboard in front of the blonde-haired person is a distraction. The rear and sideview mirror reflections are plusses, particularly the rightside mirror''s burst of light. With better foreground lighting, I''d rate this 8 or higher, but as it is, it''s a 7 in my mind.</td>', 'Nice photo evocative of speed, freedom, etc. The foreground lighting, imho, is too much and the harsh shadow on the dashboard in front of the blonde-haired person is a distraction. The rear and sideview mirror reflections are plusses, particularly the rightside mirror''s burst of light. With better foreground lighting, I''d rate this 8 or higher, but as it is, it''s a 7 in my mind.', '2005-05-04 06:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358372, 173796, 27439, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, but i don''t think the blue light to the left works...</td>', 'Nice picture, but i don''t think the blue light to the left works...', '2005-05-04 06:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
