(1358404, 173477, 30018, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting shot, with a very interesting angle.  The fog gives this picture the eeire feeling that one gets in places like this.  Viewing through the fence gives this image an extra layer of dimension, that simply adds to the whole composition.  Very nicely done.  &lt;9&gt;</td>', 'This is a very interesting shot, with a very interesting angle.  The fog gives this picture the eeire feeling that one gets in places like this.  Viewing through the fence gives this image an extra layer of dimension, that simply adds to the whole composition.  Very nicely done.  <9>', '2005-05-04 06:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358405, 173045, 32161, '<td valign="top">looks really good, too small to tell though.</td>', 'looks really good, too small to tell though.', '2005-05-04 06:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
