(1358407, 173564, 34247, '<td valign="top">This photo resonates quite well with me. The light reflection works to create a third pathway to the horizon and the color tones are nice. Small distractions include the road sign on the left bottom, near the center, and the clump of leaves seen under the right bridge. 7</td>', 'This photo resonates quite well with me. The light reflection works to create a third pathway to the horizon and the color tones are nice. Small distractions include the road sign on the left bottom, near the center, and the clump of leaves seen under the right bridge. 7', '2005-05-04 06:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358408, 173745, 26450, '<td valign="top">wow</td>', 'wow', '2005-05-04 06:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358409, 173510, 23611, '<td valign="top">Abstract....6.....</td>', 'Abstract....6.....', '2005-05-04 06:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358410, 172546, 23611, '<td valign="top">Well lit. nice</td>', 'Well lit. nice', '2005-05-04 06:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358411, 172564, 30018, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, with the long reflections in the water.  I''m not sure I would have split the image in such even parts.  I think it might have been a little more interesting if either the water or the sky were heavier than the other. &lt;6&gt;</td>', 'I like this shot, with the long reflections in the water.  I''m not sure I would have split the image in such even parts.  I think it might have been a little more interesting if either the water or the sky were heavier than the other. <6>', '2005-05-04 06:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358412, 173397, 35764, '<td valign="top">doesn''t appear to be taken outside</td>', 'doesn''t appear to be taken outside', '2005-05-04 06:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358413, 173558, 30018, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured so many wonderful colors in this image, and then repeating them off the surface of th water, which makes them seem to glow, really warms my heart when I view this image.  Nicely composed, and the perfect exposure.  Very nice &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'You''ve captured so many wonderful colors in this image, and then repeating them off the surface of th water, which makes them seem to glow, really warms my heart when I view this image.  Nicely composed, and the perfect exposure.  Very nice <8>', '2005-05-04 06:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358414, 173155, 26450, '<td valign="top">wow nice job............................. i love it G</td>', 'wow nice job............................. i love it G', '2005-05-04 06:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358415, 173820, 23611, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2005-05-04 06:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358416, 173645, 34247, '<td valign="top">Like the color contrasts between the red (postal/paper?) box, the blue chairs inside the waiting station and the luminous light inside that station itself. The sappling is a distraction, as well as the patch of grass on the right bottom corner. It''s not within the photographer''s control, but I feel that the dirty glass of the station also detracts from the potential impact of the composition, which is generally a very nice product. Perhaps take a windex next time? haha. 7</td>', 'Like the color contrasts between the red (postal/paper?) box, the blue chairs inside the waiting station and the luminous light inside that station itself. The sappling is a distraction, as well as the patch of grass on the right bottom corner. It''s not within the photographer''s control, but I feel that the dirty glass of the station also detracts from the potential impact of the composition, which is generally a very nice product. Perhaps take a windex next time? haha. 7', '2005-05-04 06:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358417, 171904, 35161, '<td valign="top">Wonderful fountain...maybe the right upper side is a bit distracting...<br/>Nice capture! :)</td>', 'Wonderful fountain...maybe the right upper side is a bit distracting...Nice capture! :)', '2005-05-04 06:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358419, 173638, 36378, '<td valign="top">Pretty girls don''t always get high scores.  This image, looks like one of those pictures taken in the store with a phony background.  The lighting on the model is nice, but it looks like the forground is placed in front of a flat painted background.</td>', 'Pretty girls don''t always get high scores.  This image, looks like one of those pictures taken in the store with a phony background.  The lighting on the model is nice, but it looks like the forground is placed in front of a flat painted background.', '2005-05-04 06:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358420, 173226, 36378, '<td valign="top">Rather boring, I''m afraid.</td>', 'Rather boring, I''m afraid.', '2005-05-04 06:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
