(1358647, 173257, 8643, '<td valign="top">Attractive image, well composed, pity the bridge light is so harsh but that can''t be helped.  Good shadow detail.</td>', 'Attractive image, well composed, pity the bridge light is so harsh but that can''t be helped.  Good shadow detail.', '2005-05-04 08:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
