(1358652, 173346, 23611, '<td valign="top">Looks great in B&amp;W.  I know this is a basic editing challenge but I just wonder what a splash of colour would do for the image. Maybe just the rear lights of the cars in colour. Red on B&amp;W. Remember the little girl with the red coat in Schindlers list. Just an opinion.........9..........</td>', 'Looks great in B&W.  I know this is a basic editing challenge but I just wonder what a splash of colour would do for the image. Maybe just the rear lights of the cars in colour. Red on B&W. Remember the little girl with the red coat in Schindlers list. Just an opinion.........9..........', '2005-05-04 08:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1358653, 172316, 8643, '<td valign="top">Good city nightscape - perhaps a tiny bit less forground?</td>', 'Good city nightscape - perhaps a tiny bit less forground?', '2005-05-04 08:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
