(1359073, 172872, 29154, '<td valign="top">Superb ! I think the thin white border must not be inside the photo . It looks OK at the top and on the left side, but too distracting on the bottom and on the right side.</td>', 'Superb ! I think the thin white border must not be inside the photo . It looks OK at the top and on the left side, but too distracting on the bottom and on the right side.', '2005-05-04 10:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
