(1359383, 173384, 35804, '<td valign="top">This is one of the best...LOVE all the stainless steel...a modern take on "Nighthawks" my favorite painting. The highlights/lowlights on the metal are fantastic, this picture has such wonderful energy and light...are real standout in a sea of skylines.</td>', 'This is one of the best...LOVE all the stainless steel...a modern take on "Nighthawks" my favorite painting. The highlights/lowlights on the metal are fantastic, this picture has such wonderful energy and light...are real standout in a sea of skylines.', '2005-05-04 11:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359386, 173859, 35382, '<td valign="top">I really like how the water is blurred &amp; everything else is very focus.  good job</td>', 'I really like how the water is blurred & everything else is very focus.  good job', '2005-05-04 11:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359390, 172423, 34814, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit noisy.</td>', 'Seems a bit noisy.', '2005-05-04 11:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359395, 173903, 35709, '<td valign="top">Great image--best I have seen so far.</td>', 'Great image--best I have seen so far.', '2005-05-04 11:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359396, 173774, 34814, '<td valign="top">Really noisy</td>', 'Really noisy', '2005-05-04 11:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359399, 173044, 35382, '<td valign="top">makes you confused, do  I go, do I stip?</td>', 'makes you confused, do  I go, do I stip?', '2005-05-04 11:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359400, 173852, 35804, '<td valign="top">This is fantastic! ( I''m doing a happy dance now) This picture is a real standout, the compostion is perfect, the crop, balance etc., etc. I could go on and on...some like it hot, and this is sizzling!</td>', 'This is fantastic! ( I''m doing a happy dance now) This picture is a real standout, the compostion is perfect, the crop, balance etc., etc. I could go on and on...some like it hot, and this is sizzling!', '2005-05-04 11:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359401, 173465, 35382, '<td valign="top">very nice.</td>', 'very nice.', '2005-05-04 11:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359402, 172325, 35804, '<td valign="top">GENO"S!!!!!!! I miss cheessteaks soooooo much! Great colors, this just makes me happy...thanks for bringing back some yummy memories!</td>', 'GENO"S!!!!!!! I miss cheessteaks soooooo much! Great colors, this just makes me happy...thanks for bringing back some yummy memories!', '2005-05-04 11:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359407, 173745, 18389, '<td valign="top">Unique idea, but I don''t think this qualifies as a photograph.</td>', 'Unique idea, but I don''t think this qualifies as a photograph.', '2005-05-04 12:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359413, 173564, 29256, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and composition. The parallel lines really draw the eye into the photo. IMO I would have tried a faster shutter speed to eliminate some of the glow from the lights.</td>', 'Nice shot and composition. The parallel lines really draw the eye into the photo. IMO I would have tried a faster shutter speed to eliminate some of the glow from the lights.', '2005-05-04 12:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359415, 171682, 30817, '<td valign="top">To project the late night mood, this would have worked better with understated light than it does with the glare appearing here.</td>', 'To project the late night mood, this would have worked better with understated light than it does with the glare appearing here.', '2005-05-04 12:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359417, 173456, 30817, '<td valign="top">Appears to be more early evening.</td>', 'Appears to be more early evening.', '2005-05-04 12:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359419, 173594, 29256, '<td valign="top">Nice flash use. Subject matter just not grabbing me. IMO shooting up in the tree more would have been better.</td>', 'Nice flash use. Subject matter just not grabbing me. IMO shooting up in the tree more would have been better.', '2005-05-04 12:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359420, 173320, 35804, '<td valign="top">I really love this picture, the only thing I might have changed was the crop, I might have left a little more room up top, things seem a little cramped...the hearse would be prominant no matter what, sometimes things don''t need to be so "obvious", at least not for me, and I tend to go against the grain with that type of thing. I even like the "unsharpness"...life is so much more than a pretty picture. That being said, again I really love this picture, one of my favorites.</td>', 'I really love this picture, the only thing I might have changed was the crop, I might have left a little more room up top, things seem a little cramped...the hearse would be prominant no matter what, sometimes things don''t need to be so "obvious", at least not for me, and I tend to go against the grain with that type of thing. I even like the "unsharpness"...life is so much more than a pretty picture. That being said, again I really love this picture, one of my favorites.', '2005-05-04 12:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359421, 171705, 29537, '<td valign="top">nice composition, but too small</td>', 'nice composition, but too small', '2005-05-04 12:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359422, 172462, 29256, '<td valign="top">WOW that is a big fire.</td>', 'WOW that is a big fire.', '2005-05-04 12:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359423, 173471, 30817, '<td valign="top">Nice shot except for a couple blown pixels you should have cloned out. the smoke/steam is great!</td>', 'Nice shot except for a couple blown pixels you should have cloned out. the smoke/steam is great!', '2005-05-04 12:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359424, 173656, 29256, '<td valign="top">Very grainy due to enlargement? Looks like the iron bar is on fire.</td>', 'Very grainy due to enlargement? Looks like the iron bar is on fire.', '2005-05-04 12:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359425, 172473, 29256, '<td valign="top">PRE- late night sailing</td>', 'PRE- late night sailing', '2005-05-04 12:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359426, 172406, 30817, '<td valign="top">This looks lat.  He looks exhausted.</td>', 'This looks lat.  He looks exhausted.', '2005-05-04 12:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359430, 173721, 29256, '<td valign="top">Really like the way you used the tree on the right to filter the light. Nice foggy mood portrayed.</td>', 'Really like the way you used the tree on the right to filter the light. Nice foggy mood portrayed.', '2005-05-04 12:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359432, 173090, 30214, '<td valign="top">is this a 330?... I did not know the light speed was 80mph :)<br/>nice shot, but would be even better if a silouette of the driver was visible on the left</td>', 'is this a 330?... I did not know the light speed was 80mph :)nice shot, but would be even better if a silouette of the driver was visible on the left', '2005-05-04 12:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359433, 171945, 29256, '<td valign="top">real sharpe and bright colors. IMO cropping the street light out on the left would have been perfect</td>', 'real sharpe and bright colors. IMO cropping the street light out on the left would have been perfect', '2005-05-04 12:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359436, 173511, 30214, '<td valign="top">the lamps are a bit too bright, they over power the composition</td>', 'the lamps are a bit too bright, they over power the composition', '2005-05-04 12:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359440, 173155, 30214, '<td valign="top">nice shot, would prefer a ldarker sky to get a feel of late night</td>', 'nice shot, would prefer a ldarker sky to get a feel of late night', '2005-05-04 12:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359444, 173815, 29256, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. IMHO my eyes wander too far right down the foot path. I would have cropped that off.</td>', 'Nice capture. IMHO my eyes wander too far right down the foot path. I would have cropped that off.', '2005-05-04 12:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359445, 172318, 30817, '<td valign="top">Looks too bright to convey late at night.</td>', 'Looks too bright to convey late at night.', '2005-05-04 12:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359447, 173501, 35804, '<td valign="top">This is so refreshing in a vast sea of pretty skylines. The composition is perfect, the light quality is great..a nice "cold" feeling to it....emotinally and tone wise...the bright red makes this just right. A+!</td>', 'This is so refreshing in a vast sea of pretty skylines. The composition is perfect, the light quality is great..a nice "cold" feeling to it....emotinally and tone wise...the bright red makes this just right. A+!', '2005-05-04 12:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359448, 173890, 35804, '<td valign="top">I''m lovin'' this possessed looking piggy! This is a really great picture, love the tight tonal range and the "darkness".</td>', 'I''m lovin'' this possessed looking piggy! This is a really great picture, love the tight tonal range and the "darkness".', '2005-05-04 12:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359449, 173641, 34659, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - a little blurry as you move toward bottom right. (6)</td>', 'Nice shot - a little blurry as you move toward bottom right. (6)', '2005-05-04 12:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359453, 173921, 29256, '<td valign="top">Top 2 thirds of the shot is great. Neat shadows, texture and color. I would loose the lights from the house by cropping for the challenge and blacken them out for printing.</td>', 'Top 2 thirds of the shot is great. Neat shadows, texture and color. I would loose the lights from the house by cropping for the challenge and blacken them out for printing.', '2005-05-04 12:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359454, 173819, 30817, '<td valign="top">You do see that this is out of focus, right?</td>', 'You do see that this is out of focus, right?', '2005-05-04 12:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359458, 173216, 20168, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and colors!  The lower right corner has a rail or bar which seems out of place.  But in a basic editing challenge what''s to be done?  All the best to you.</td>', 'Great lighting and colors!  The lower right corner has a rail or bar which seems out of place.  But in a basic editing challenge what''s to be done?  All the best to you.', '2005-05-04 12:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359460, 173781, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not bad at all, Icelandic landscape never hurts an image anyway.  Is this isafjordur?  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Not bad at all, Icelandic landscape never hurts an image anyway.  Is this isafjordur?  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-05-04 12:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359463, 173869, 29256, '<td valign="top">Just an overall lovely pic. to look at. Too bad the challenge restricts size. My only issue is the overly bright light from the building. Shorter exposure may have worked but then again you may have lost color depth.</td>', 'Just an overall lovely pic. to look at. Too bad the challenge restricts size. My only issue is the overly bright light from the building. Shorter exposure may have worked but then again you may have lost color depth.', '2005-05-04 12:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359464, 173786, 35720, '<td valign="top">Very atmospheric and good night shot. I like the colours and the lighting. Well done! 8</td>', 'Very atmospheric and good night shot. I like the colours and the lighting. Well done! 8', '2005-05-04 12:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359465, 171545, 20168, '<td valign="top">Good focus.  Doesn''t seem that "late" at night, closer to twilight.  Good composition.</td>', 'Good focus.  Doesn''t seem that "late" at night, closer to twilight.  Good composition.', '2005-05-04 12:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359467, 173611, 30817, '<td valign="top">You understand this is out of focus, correct?</td>', 'You understand this is out of focus, correct?', '2005-05-04 12:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359471, 173815, 19734, '<td valign="top">good choice leaving the shutter open so long, really makes everything pop, great job.</td>', 'good choice leaving the shutter open so long, really makes everything pop, great job.', '2005-05-04 12:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359473, 173798, 20168, '<td valign="top">Creative use of light movement for these streetlamps to give the shot a sense of movement.</td>', 'Creative use of light movement for these streetlamps to give the shot a sense of movement.', '2005-05-04 12:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359475, 172139, 19734, '<td valign="top">amazing picture, i love everything about it, 10</td>', 'amazing picture, i love everything about it, 10', '2005-05-04 12:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359476, 173430, 20168, '<td valign="top">Lovely geometric interplay, three levels of patterns.  Nicely composed.</td>', 'Lovely geometric interplay, three levels of patterns.  Nicely composed.', '2005-05-04 12:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359479, 173913, 30817, '<td valign="top">Did you notice this shot is out of focus?</td>', 'Did you notice this shot is out of focus?', '2005-05-04 12:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359480, 171900, 19734, '<td valign="top">nice capture</td>', 'nice capture', '2005-05-04 12:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359481, 172378, 35709, '<td valign="top">I always knew that we, geeks, came from another planet :-) Thanks for providing the proof.</td>', 'I always knew that we, geeks, came from another planet :-) Thanks for providing the proof.', '2005-05-04 12:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359482, 173730, 20168, '<td valign="top">Cool find, but the birds are overexposed by the flash IMO.</td>', 'Cool find, but the birds are overexposed by the flash IMO.', '2005-05-04 12:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359485, 172546, 29256, '<td valign="top">Very stricking photo. Only thing that throws me is the angle of the camera. Everything is perpindicular and the horizon is level. IMHO the bricks not being straight bothers me some.</td>', 'Very stricking photo. Only thing that throws me is the angle of the camera. Everything is perpindicular and the horizon is level. IMHO the bricks not being straight bothers me some.', '2005-05-04 12:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359487, 171678, 19734, '<td valign="top">the colors seem a little muted, but there isnt much you could have done i dont think. really cool idea, i like how it came out.</td>', 'the colors seem a little muted, but there isnt much you could have done i dont think. really cool idea, i like how it came out.', '2005-05-04 12:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359489, 172352, 20168, '<td valign="top">One step further to the right would have freed up the funnel slide from the tree. Otherwise, good composition and lighting.  Great idea for this challenge.</td>', 'One step further to the right would have freed up the funnel slide from the tree. Otherwise, good composition and lighting.  Great idea for this challenge.', '2005-05-04 12:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359492, 173371, 19734, '<td valign="top">great character in the picture. going right to my favorites</td>', 'great character in the picture. going right to my favorites', '2005-05-04 12:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359493, 172863, 30817, '<td valign="top">Hard for any star shot to impress a viewer these days.  Hubble shots have ruined it for us ground dwellers.</td>', 'Hard for any star shot to impress a viewer these days.  Hubble shots have ruined it for us ground dwellers.', '2005-05-04 12:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359494, 172483, 20168, '<td valign="top">Good movement of steamvents and lighting, showing latenight work in this factory.  Good composition.</td>', 'Good movement of steamvents and lighting, showing latenight work in this factory.  Good composition.', '2005-05-04 12:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359495, 173786, 29256, '<td valign="top">Shame there was not someone shiloette or a shadow. Nothing to really grab the eye.</td>', 'Shame there was not someone shiloette or a shadow. Nothing to really grab the eye.', '2005-05-04 12:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359497, 172477, 30817, '<td valign="top">The statue appears to be relieving himself.  Bad choice of angles.</td>', 'The statue appears to be relieving himself.  Bad choice of angles.', '2005-05-04 12:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359499, 173384, 19734, '<td valign="top">i like the subject a lot. the top and bottom though have very little detail and probably could be cropped.</td>', 'i like the subject a lot. the top and bottom though have very little detail and probably could be cropped.', '2005-05-04 12:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359502, 173490, 30817, '<td valign="top">Would have conveyed late at night better if the lighting was more understated.</td>', 'Would have conveyed late at night better if the lighting was more understated.', '2005-05-04 12:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359503, 173869, 19734, '<td valign="top">amazing colors!</td>', 'amazing colors!', '2005-05-04 12:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359504, 173895, 20168, '<td valign="top">I like the slight off perpendicular tilt of this photo, but some will find it objectionable.  What my eye wants to see is the cross in light/dark contrast at the top of the steeple.  Great concept!  Blessings!</td>', 'I like the slight off perpendicular tilt of this photo, but some will find it objectionable.  What my eye wants to see is the cross in light/dark contrast at the top of the steeple.  Great concept!  Blessings!', '2005-05-04 12:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359505, 173346, 29256, '<td valign="top">Glad to see something ike this in B&amp;W. Works well.</td>', 'Glad to see something ike this in B&W. Works well.', '2005-05-04 12:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359509, 173732, 30817, '<td valign="top">Sure is spooky out there late at night.....</td>', 'Sure is spooky out there late at night.....', '2005-05-04 12:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359511, 173820, 20168, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  Lighting on the "goldengate" is really cool.  I like the lines reflected in the water across the bay.</td>', 'Great composition.  Lighting on the "goldengate" is really cool.  I like the lines reflected in the water across the bay.', '2005-05-04 12:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359513, 172385, 29148, '<td valign="top">Great idea, and execution.</td>', 'Great idea, and execution.', '2005-05-04 12:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359514, 172841, 19734, '<td valign="top">the sides dont have much character, and cropping it would make it seem unbalanced. i like how the road is light though, nice job</td>', 'the sides dont have much character, and cropping it would make it seem unbalanced. i like how the road is light though, nice job', '2005-05-04 12:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359515, 173442, 32513, '<td valign="top">The best thing you can do for night time pictures is avoid direct flash like the plauge! It will only go so far, and in the night this is very obvious, just look at the farthest reaches of the photo...pitch black. It would be wiser to use a slower shuttter speed and a tripod. You can also turn up your ISO if you don''t mind noise in the image, noise can be quite artistic if used thoughtfully. The direct flash on this photo kills it. It just looks like a snapshot taken from a reality TV show...but hey, don''t get down about it, at least you''re smart enough to realize that light was needed, somehting reality TV folks just don''t get....</td>', 'The best thing you can do for night time pictures is avoid direct flash like the plauge! It will only go so far, and in the night this is very obvious, just look at the farthest reaches of the photo...pitch black. It would be wiser to use a slower shuttter speed and a tripod. You can also turn up your ISO if you don''t mind noise in the image, noise can be quite artistic if used thoughtfully. The direct flash on this photo kills it. It just looks like a snapshot taken from a reality TV show...but hey, don''t get down about it, at least you''re smart enough to realize that light was needed, somehting reality TV folks just don''t get....', '2005-05-04 12:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359517, 173477, 30817, '<td valign="top">It might not be a generally well received shot, but I like that you tried to convey a feeling, a mood of late at night.  One of the most creative efforts I have seen thus far.</td>', 'It might not be a generally well received shot, but I like that you tried to convey a feeling, a mood of late at night.  One of the most creative efforts I have seen thus far.', '2005-05-04 12:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359518, 171665, 20168, '<td valign="top">Help us to see that this is "late night".  This same color/light could be sunset, sunrise.  Good composition.</td>', 'Help us to see that this is "late night".  This same color/light could be sunset, sunrise.  Good composition.', '2005-05-04 12:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359519, 173750, 19734, '<td valign="top">thats a big armadillo! love the colors, good job</td>', 'thats a big armadillo! love the colors, good job', '2005-05-04 12:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359522, 173490, 20168, '<td valign="top">Beautiful glassy marina scene, with excellent focus.  All the best to you.</td>', 'Beautiful glassy marina scene, with excellent focus.  All the best to you.', '2005-05-04 12:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359523, 172352, 32513, '<td valign="top">This almost looks like daylight.</td>', 'This almost looks like daylight.', '2005-05-04 12:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359524, 173730, 30817, '<td valign="top">Did this seem out of focus to you when you submitted it?</td>', 'Did this seem out of focus to you when you submitted it?', '2005-05-04 12:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359525, 173916, 29148, '<td valign="top">I imagine you will receive quite a number of too small comments. I didn''t lower your score for that, but a bigger picture is easier to see.</td>', 'I imagine you will receive quite a number of too small comments. I didn''t lower your score for that, but a bigger picture is easier to see.', '2005-05-04 12:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359526, 172178, 22748, '<td valign="top">Looks like a car ad from a magazine! Nice camera angle, nice sky, nice and sharp subject.</td>', 'Looks like a car ad from a magazine! Nice camera angle, nice sky, nice and sharp subject.', '2005-05-04 12:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359527, 172486, 20168, '<td valign="top">Glassy conditions work well for this photo.  The big black chunk in the lower third of the frame weighs this light/soft photo down too much IMO.  All the best.</td>', 'Glassy conditions work well for this photo.  The big black chunk in the lower third of the frame weighs this light/soft photo down too much IMO.  All the best.', '2005-05-04 12:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359530, 173373, 29148, '<td valign="top">Good technically, doesn''t say too much to me (same problem I had with my choice of shots)</td>', 'Good technically, doesn''t say too much to me (same problem I had with my choice of shots)', '2005-05-04 12:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359531, 173136, 29148, '<td valign="top">Novel, I like it.</td>', 'Novel, I like it.', '2005-05-04 12:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359532, 173512, 20168, '<td valign="top">Lovely capture of stars and clarity of design on this roofline.  I like the composition.</td>', 'Lovely capture of stars and clarity of design on this roofline.  I like the composition.', '2005-05-04 12:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
