(1359706, 173284, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is so beautiful and amazing!   I just love the vivid colors and the reflections on the water.   Everything is so sharp and clear too!   I just love it!  10</td>', 'This is so beautiful and amazing!   I just love the vivid colors and the reflections on the water.   Everything is so sharp and clear too!   I just love it!  10', '2005-05-04 13:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
