(1359710, 172742, 31211, '<td valign="top">Simple and clear shot. Love the warm color of the shed. The background is very nice too. Above all, your image has great quality and colors which,  in my opinion, make it stand out. Nice one.</td>', 'Simple and clear shot. Love the warm color of the shed. The background is very nice too. Above all, your image has great quality and colors which,  in my opinion, make it stand out. Nice one.', '2005-05-04 13:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
