(1359725, 173887, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is so pretty!    That reflection is just amazing!    I wonder what the Egg is.   It''s awesome looking at night for sure!!!!</td>', 'This is so pretty!    That reflection is just amazing!    I wonder what the Egg is.   It''s awesome looking at night for sure!!!!', '2005-05-04 13:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
