(1359739, 172714, 29148, '<td valign="top">Pretty colors, nice setting. Might be improved by cropping some on the top and left. I downloaded it and cropped it a little. Not sure I like my cropped version better though.</td>', 'Pretty colors, nice setting. Might be improved by cropping some on the top and left. I downloaded it and cropped it a little. Not sure I like my cropped version better though.', '2005-05-04 13:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359741, 172316, 31637, '<td valign="top">very nice...perfectly timed exposure</td>', 'very nice...perfectly timed exposure', '2005-05-04 13:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359743, 172872, 24454, '<td valign="top">Your title cracks me up!   Here I was all mesmerized by the gorgeous capture you got of this starlit fantasy. . . .then I read the title, and got bolted by a reality check  :)  But it doesn''t take away one bit from this being just a BEAUTIFUL night shot.   The stars are so perfect and sharp.   I just LOVE IT!!</td>', 'Your title cracks me up!   Here I was all mesmerized by the gorgeous capture you got of this starlit fantasy. . . .then I read the title, and got bolted by a reality check  :)  But it doesn''t take away one bit from this being just a BEAUTIFUL night shot.   The stars are so perfect and sharp.   I just LOVE IT!!', '2005-05-04 13:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359744, 172519, 31211, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Compositionally very good - love the perspective. Colors seem to be just right. I like the ocntrast between the black and the blue, on the ground and sky. Nice job.</td>', 'Nice shot. Compositionally very good - love the perspective. Colors seem to be just right. I like the ocntrast between the black and the blue, on the ground and sky. Nice job.', '2005-05-04 13:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359745, 173451, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ooooooops.    It was supposed to be outside.    I''m so sorry -- you must be hearing that a lot.     Cute photo tho!</td>', 'Ooooooops.    It was supposed to be outside.    I''m so sorry -- you must be hearing that a lot.     Cute photo tho!', '2005-05-04 13:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359746, 173742, 29148, '<td valign="top">Lots of different colors to hold your interest. Might make a good jigsaw puzzle.</td>', 'Lots of different colors to hold your interest. Might make a good jigsaw puzzle.', '2005-05-04 13:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359750, 173256, 24454, '<td valign="top">GORGEOUS city at night for sure!!!!    And you have done an excellent job of capturing it!   Congratulations.   It''s just beautiful!</td>', 'GORGEOUS city at night for sure!!!!    And you have done an excellent job of capturing it!   Congratulations.   It''s just beautiful!', '2005-05-04 13:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359751, 172697, 34633, '<td valign="top">mmh...mice sunset, but how is it late night?</td>', 'mmh...mice sunset, but how is it late night?', '2005-05-04 13:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359752, 173494, 29148, '<td valign="top">The red color cast seems too overbearing.</td>', 'The red color cast seems too overbearing.', '2005-05-04 13:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359754, 173356, 31211, '<td valign="top">Great picture. Love the bluish tonality, against the deep true black sky. Good white balance choice (i wish I had done the same in mine) and nice composition. Good job.</td>', 'Great picture. Love the bluish tonality, against the deep true black sky. Good white balance choice (i wish I had done the same in mine) and nice composition. Good job.', '2005-05-04 13:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359756, 172809, 34633, '<td valign="top">funky, i like the angle and the short shutter speed</td>', 'funky, i like the angle and the short shutter speed', '2005-05-04 13:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359757, 171923, 29148, '<td valign="top">I love your lighting. Would like to see it done with other tree forms.</td>', 'I love your lighting. Would like to see it done with other tree forms.', '2005-05-04 13:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359759, 173903, 34633, '<td valign="top">nice atmosphere, would have liked it better without the frame, it distracts from the mood of the picture</td>', 'nice atmosphere, would have liked it better without the frame, it distracts from the mood of the picture', '2005-05-04 13:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359761, 173397, 34633, '<td valign="top">nice take on late night, but could have been set up with more interesting lighting</td>', 'nice take on late night, but could have been set up with more interesting lighting', '2005-05-04 13:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359763, 173897, 31211, '<td valign="top">Well, this sure does stand out by its vibrant and splendid colors. Great subject and composition - both very appealing- The only thing I have to point out is that it seems to me it needs a slighlty rotation to the right. Otherwise, very well done.</td>', 'Well, this sure does stand out by its vibrant and splendid colors. Great subject and composition - both very appealing- The only thing I have to point out is that it seems to me it needs a slighlty rotation to the right. Otherwise, very well done.', '2005-05-04 13:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359764, 173786, 34633, '<td valign="top">nice shot, but you should carefully check your color balance</td>', 'nice shot, but you should carefully check your color balance', '2005-05-04 13:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359765, 172325, 29148, '<td valign="top">Great shot! I envisioned something like this but had nothing around. Too bad that passing car blocked the table of diners. It would have been slightly better, but I''ll bet it was busy there. A 10 for perfect exposure.</td>', 'Great shot! I envisioned something like this but had nothing around. Too bad that passing car blocked the table of diners. It would have been slightly better, but I''ll bet it was busy there. A 10 for perfect exposure.', '2005-05-04 13:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359766, 171919, 32608, '<td valign="top">good capture, if only focused a little better</td>', 'good capture, if only focused a little better', '2005-05-04 13:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1359767, 171666, 29148, '<td valign="top">Has somewhat of a 1950s appeal.</td>', 'Has somewhat of a 1950s appeal.', '2005-05-04 13:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
