(1360190, 172484, 24212, '<td valign="top">There''s a great mix of the static and the moving here. The title''s all but superfluous, as I can almost hear the cabby saying it.</td>', 'There''s a great mix of the static and the moving here. The title''s all but superfluous, as I can almost hear the cabby saying it.', '2005-05-04 15:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
