(1360350, 173791, 34228, '<td valign="top">There is nothing really interesting with this photo, nothing to give it a special look or effect.  the light to left takes the breath out of this shot.  But you have the tecknique, high F-stop, lo ISO and long exposure time so you are on the right track. ; )</td>', 'There is nothing really interesting with this photo, nothing to give it a special look or effect.  the light to left takes the breath out of this shot.  But you have the tecknique, high F-stop, lo ISO and long exposure time so you are on the right track. ; )', '2005-05-04 16:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1360354, 173820, 24454, '<td valign="top">Gasp!    This is stunning!      It seems I''ve seen this view in daylight in another challenge, and thought it couldn''t have gotten prettier then.   But this outdid it  :)    10</td>', 'Gasp!    This is stunning!      It seems I''ve seen this view in daylight in another challenge, and thought it couldn''t have gotten prettier then.   But this outdid it  :)    10', '2005-05-04 16:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
