(1360357, 172139, 24212, '<td valign="top">A lovely simple picture. As a side note, I think that the light ing looks like a Nick Park film. I keep expecting to see Wallace and Gromit.</td>', 'A lovely simple picture. As a side note, I think that the light ing looks like a Nick Park film. I keep expecting to see Wallace and Gromit.', '2005-05-04 16:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
