(1360363, 173552, 34228, '<td valign="top">Not much to say, nice photo.  Nobody likes waiting in a bus shelter and brings out the joy of siting in front of the monitor browsing dpchallenge ; )<br/>I would like to see higher F-stop to bring the signs in focus.</td>', 'Not much to say, nice photo.  Nobody likes waiting in a bus shelter and brings out the joy of siting in front of the monitor browsing dpchallenge ; )I would like to see higher F-stop to bring the signs in focus.', '2005-05-04 16:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
