(1360393, 173146, 24454, '<td valign="top">Breathtaking.   I almost think you lucky guys that live with these exotic scenery advantages should have to take a voting handicap to give the rest of us who live in boring unexotic places a chance  :)   (just kidding).   This is just so well done -- so sharp and vivid.   You couldn''t have done a better job!   10</td>', 'Breathtaking.   I almost think you lucky guys that live with these exotic scenery advantages should have to take a voting handicap to give the rest of us who live in boring unexotic places a chance  :)   (just kidding).   This is just so well done -- so sharp and vivid.   You couldn''t have done a better job!   10', '2005-05-04 16:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
