(1360427, 173488, 24454, '<td valign="top">Good job making your stars show up so well.    Mine never look like stars, just little noise specks on the picture.   These really look like stars in a night sky.</td>', 'Good job making your stars show up so well.    Mine never look like stars, just little noise specks on the picture.   These really look like stars in a night sky.', '2005-05-04 16:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
