(1360440, 173616, 24454, '<td valign="top">Our family has a cat like this one that is 19 years old!!!  And she is just as aloof and "in authority" as this one looks  :)   Nice shot of her at night  (sorry if it''s a him)  :)</td>', 'Our family has a cat like this one that is 19 years old!!!  And she is just as aloof and "in authority" as this one looks  :)   Nice shot of her at night  (sorry if it''s a him)  :)', '2005-05-04 16:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
