(1360578, 173649, 35513, '<td valign="top">There is a lot going on in this shot!  But I like it!  There are a couple of places where the light is almost too intense for my taste (the tree in the lower left, for example).  Very clear image though, and I like the trails of tail lights as the cars zoom by.  Well captured.  The only other thing that bothers me slightly is that the dome at the top left is cut off.  I think I would have ditched the tree at the bottom and gone for the top of the dome if possible.</td>', 'There is a lot going on in this shot!  But I like it!  There are a couple of places where the light is almost too intense for my taste (the tree in the lower left, for example).  Very clear image though, and I like the trails of tail lights as the cars zoom by.  Well captured.  The only other thing that bothers me slightly is that the dome at the top left is cut off.  I think I would have ditched the tree at the bottom and gone for the top of the dome if possible.', '2005-05-04 17:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1360579, 173439, 26464, '<td valign="top">this is simply awesome work. the catchlight on top of the subjects head helps make the photo as well. 9<br/></td>', 'this is simply awesome work. the catchlight on top of the subjects head helps make the photo as well. 9', '2005-05-04 17:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
