(1360610, 172776, 35513, '<td valign="top">I love the bridge in this shot!  I would love to know where this shot was taken....it looks like a beautiful place.  My only very minor gripe is that the plant in the lower left is a different color green that the ones farther up.  I assume that''s cause of lighting and I dont know enough PS yet to know if you could change that :-)  Very clear image though....lovely reflections on the water.</td>', 'I love the bridge in this shot!  I would love to know where this shot was taken....it looks like a beautiful place.  My only very minor gripe is that the plant in the lower left is a different color green that the ones farther up.  I assume that''s cause of lighting and I dont know enough PS yet to know if you could change that :-)  Very clear image though....lovely reflections on the water.', '2005-05-04 17:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
