(1360622, 172318, 35513, '<td valign="top">I LOVE the colors in this shot.  Very clear image.  The line of lights really leads my eye to all of the right places, and I like how the slow moving clouds streak across the sky.</td>', 'I LOVE the colors in this shot.  Very clear image.  The line of lights really leads my eye to all of the right places, and I like how the slow moving clouds streak across the sky.', '2005-05-04 17:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1360625, 173813, 25028, '<td valign="top">i think it''s great that you kept so much of the cobblestone in the foreground; it adds to the depth, makes the image more dramatic, and it keeps this strong diagonal of the curve that''s counterbalanced by the diagonals of the roof and lights.  i also like the fact that so many of the details in the image are distinguishable, but you stil convery the feeling of a deep, dark night.  very rich textures and shapes.</td>', 'i think it''s great that you kept so much of the cobblestone in the foreground; it adds to the depth, makes the image more dramatic, and it keeps this strong diagonal of the curve that''s counterbalanced by the diagonals of the roof and lights.  i also like the fact that so many of the details in the image are distinguishable, but you stil convery the feeling of a deep, dark night.  very rich textures and shapes.', '2005-05-04 17:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1360627, 173815, 37320, '<td valign="top">Good shot, but I think the car detracts from the "quietness" of the bridge</td>', 'Good shot, but I think the car detracts from the "quietness" of the bridge', '2005-05-04 17:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1360628, 172827, 327, '<td valign="top">I don''t see that this has any real impact. These cablins don''t look especially interesting and we don''t see the full cabin, just one 1/4 roof and one small roof. What is the focal point here? Now standing there in person I would suspect the feel is much different but it''s not showing up in the shot. I hope this is of help and that you know it''s not meant to be a slam of your shot.</td>', 'I don''t see that this has any real impact. These cablins don''t look especially interesting and we don''t see the full cabin, just one 1/4 roof and one small roof. What is the focal point here? Now standing there in person I would suspect the feel is much different but it''s not showing up in the shot. I hope this is of help and that you know it''s not meant to be a slam of your shot.', '2005-05-04 17:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1360630, 173205, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very clear image.  Good placement, good lighting.  Nice job!</td>', 'Very clear image.  Good placement, good lighting.  Nice job!', '2005-05-04 17:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
