(1361213, 173440, 20214, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. Nicely executed exposure. A 10 from me!</td>', 'Very nice shot. Nicely executed exposure. A 10 from me!', '2005-05-04 20:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361214, 173413, 31211, '<td valign="top">Very interestting subject. However, the composition is, I believe, a bit off: the trees appear to "grow" from the heads and the light at the right is way to close to the statue''s head (maybe you should have tried another angle). Also, the lights are a bit blown. Finally, i think you could have cropped that black thing at the right and the tiny light emerging from the left, in the sky area. Hope you don''t mind my saying these things, but that''s what comments are for. Hope this has helped a little. Good luck.</td>', 'Very interestting subject. However, the composition is, I believe, a bit off: the trees appear to "grow" from the heads and the light at the right is way to close to the statue''s head (maybe you should have tried another angle). Also, the lights are a bit blown. Finally, i think you could have cropped that black thing at the right and the tiny light emerging from the left, in the sky area. Hope you don''t mind my saying these things, but that''s what comments are for. Hope this has helped a little. Good luck.', '2005-05-04 20:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361216, 171945, 20214, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors and good exposure.</td>', 'Very nice colors and good exposure.', '2005-05-04 20:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361219, 172697, 20214, '<td valign="top">I didn''t realize that the moon was that bright at night!</td>', 'I didn''t realize that the moon was that bright at night!', '2005-05-04 20:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361221, 173447, 20214, '<td valign="top">Too many hot spots. Maybe a shorter exposure time would work better.</td>', 'Too many hot spots. Maybe a shorter exposure time would work better.', '2005-05-04 20:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361226, 171682, 20214, '<td valign="top">I don''t really care for the green cast here. The photo also tilts to the left, this can be straightened out in PS, and the street lights are to hot. I wonder what this photo would look like in B&amp;W. Keep shooting. Other than that I like the subject of the photo and how you have it off center.</td>', 'I don''t really care for the green cast here. The photo also tilts to the left, this can be straightened out in PS, and the street lights are to hot. I wonder what this photo would look like in B&W. Keep shooting. Other than that I like the subject of the photo and how you have it off center.', '2005-05-04 20:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361228, 173216, 31211, '<td valign="top">You have a nice shot, with a good compostiion. However, it has a too strong reddish tone (maybe reducing the sat and light on red channel would have helped). Also, I would have cropped a little on the left to get rid of most of the blue wall and the tiny lights in the dark area. ANyway, you''ve managed to capture the flow of the water in a superb way.</td>', 'You have a nice shot, with a good compostiion. However, it has a too strong reddish tone (maybe reducing the sat and light on red channel would have helped). Also, I would have cropped a little on the left to get rid of most of the blue wall and the tiny lights in the dark area. ANyway, you''ve managed to capture the flow of the water in a superb way.', '2005-05-04 20:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361231, 173852, 20214, '<td valign="top">Was this shot hand held? If so, use a tripod next time for much better results. The resteraunt sign is blurry.</td>', 'Was this shot hand held? If so, use a tripod next time for much better results. The resteraunt sign is blurry.', '2005-05-04 20:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
