(1361976, 173845, 327, '<td valign="top">What a clever set up. Neat idea. Congrats.</td>', 'What a clever set up. Neat idea. Congrats.', '2005-05-05 00:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361977, 173202, 34134, '<td valign="top">Nice, simple composition. I''d like a bit more contrast.</td>', 'Nice, simple composition. I''d like a bit more contrast.', '2005-05-05 00:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361978, 173256, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty shot. Must of been a still night. Love the water with these lights.</td>', 'Pretty shot. Must of been a still night. Love the water with these lights.', '2005-05-05 00:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361980, 173773, 327, '<td valign="top">You can just feel his/her dejection. Very nice. Congrats.</td>', 'You can just feel his/her dejection. Very nice. Congrats.', '2005-05-05 00:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361981, 173136, 34247, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of the logo.</td>', 'Nice shot of the logo.', '2005-05-05 00:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361982, 173917, 34134, '<td valign="top">Really sharp and well exposed.</td>', 'Really sharp and well exposed.', '2005-05-05 00:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361990, 173616, 34134, '<td valign="top">Very sharp and well exposed.</td>', 'Very sharp and well exposed.', '2005-05-05 00:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361994, 173669, 2560, '<td valign="top">needs a little light on the faces.</td>', 'needs a little light on the faces.', '2005-05-05 00:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1361995, 171682, 36604, '<td valign="top">Surreal, slanted, with overdone light flares, but strangely attractive regardless.  I particularly like the way the blue in the windows matches the sky.  The visible noise mars the image slightly.</td>', 'Surreal, slanted, with overdone light flares, but strangely attractive regardless.  I particularly like the way the blue in the windows matches the sky.  The visible noise mars the image slightly.', '2005-05-05 00:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362000, 172473, 36604, '<td valign="top">I see a sun in the sky, and no icebergs to indicate that you''re in the arctic circle, thus I must conclude that this was not taken late at night.</td>', 'I see a sun in the sky, and no icebergs to indicate that you''re in the arctic circle, thus I must conclude that this was not taken late at night.', '2005-05-05 00:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362004, 173745, 36604, '<td valign="top">This joke was funny the first time I saw it 20 years ago.  It''s gotten very old since then.</td>', 'This joke was funny the first time I saw it 20 years ago.  It''s gotten very old since then.', '2005-05-05 00:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362005, 173381, 36604, '<td valign="top">Ah, finally a use for modern art: spicing up an otherwise ordinary photograph!<br/> <br/>Interesting imagery, but somewhat soft.  Blown highlights are a little harsh.</td>', 'Ah, finally a use for modern art: spicing up an otherwise ordinary photograph! Interesting imagery, but somewhat soft.  Blown highlights are a little harsh.', '2005-05-05 01:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362007, 173477, 36604, '<td valign="top">The soft chainlink makes a nice contrast against the sharp car behind it, and the light source (and the color it provides) is remniscent of a small sun over a dead world, making the area look abandoned and lonely.  Very nice.  My only nit is the blown highlight on the reflection on the car, which mars the effect slightly.</td>', 'The soft chainlink makes a nice contrast against the sharp car behind it, and the light source (and the color it provides) is remniscent of a small sun over a dead world, making the area look abandoned and lonely.  Very nice.  My only nit is the blown highlight on the reflection on the car, which mars the effect slightly.', '2005-05-05 01:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362008, 173734, 36604, '<td valign="top">I like the shadows (and shades) on the walkway, but find the image slightly fuzzy.  The framing is good.</td>', 'I like the shadows (and shades) on the walkway, but find the image slightly fuzzy.  The framing is good.', '2005-05-05 01:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362012, 172406, 34390, '<td valign="top">It''s late but it''s not outside.</td>', 'It''s late but it''s not outside.', '2005-05-05 01:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362013, 173409, 36604, '<td valign="top">There seems to be a regularity of the noise in the clouds leaving streaking lines (was this taken, by chance, with a 20D?).  I''m partial to astronomy, however, so this gets significant personal bonus points from me for that.</td>', 'There seems to be a regularity of the noise in the clouds leaving streaking lines (was this taken, by chance, with a 20D?).  I''m partial to astronomy, however, so this gets significant personal bonus points from me for that.', '2005-05-05 01:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362014, 173869, 34390, '<td valign="top">I love the purple and green colors here. The reflection came out perfect.</td>', 'I love the purple and green colors here. The reflection came out perfect.', '2005-05-05 01:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362019, 173216, 34390, '<td valign="top">Really pretty.</td>', 'Really pretty.', '2005-05-05 01:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362020, 173202, 36604, '<td valign="top">A somewhat ordinary looking shot, marred by the blown highlights on the leaves.  For a shot where you''re going to convert to black and white anyway, you might try underexposing slightly, then dropping contrast and shadow values.</td>', 'A somewhat ordinary looking shot, marred by the blown highlights on the leaves.  For a shot where you''re going to convert to black and white anyway, you might try underexposing slightly, then dropping contrast and shadow values.', '2005-05-05 01:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362022, 172872, 34390, '<td valign="top">Great city scape.</td>', 'Great city scape.', '2005-05-05 01:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362023, 171659, 36604, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting effect, fits well with the sign on the right and the lone red dots in the upper left breaking up the negative space.</td>', 'Nice lighting effect, fits well with the sign on the right and the lone red dots in the upper left breaking up the negative space.', '2005-05-05 01:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362026, 173792, 36604, '<td valign="top">Haunting, and a nice variety of light colors in the distance.  One of the best so far.</td>', 'Haunting, and a nice variety of light colors in the distance.  One of the best so far.', '2005-05-05 01:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362028, 173895, 35709, '<td valign="top">The tower is not angled enough to make a statement, but enough to bother me.</td>', 'The tower is not angled enough to make a statement, but enough to bother me.', '2005-05-05 01:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362032, 173632, 34390, '<td valign="top">Terrific view! I like the way you centered that silver looking building.</td>', 'Terrific view! I like the way you centered that silver looking building.', '2005-05-05 01:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362033, 172783, 36604, '<td valign="top">Nice array of colors.  The building in the background is slightly soft, which is mildly distracting, but not bad.  If this was a tripod shot to begin with, I would have suggested bracketing apertures a bit to see if anything came out with everything in focus without causing abnormalities in the lighting.</td>', 'Nice array of colors.  The building in the background is slightly soft, which is mildly distracting, but not bad.  If this was a tripod shot to begin with, I would have suggested bracketing apertures a bit to see if anything came out with everything in focus without causing abnormalities in the lighting.', '2005-05-05 01:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362035, 171543, 34390, '<td valign="top">The trees in the right foreground really make the city stand out nicely.</td>', 'The trees in the right foreground really make the city stand out nicely.', '2005-05-05 01:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362038, 173104, 34390, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t look like outside.</td>', 'Doesn''t look like outside.', '2005-05-05 01:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362042, 172519, 34390, '<td valign="top">Very interesting building. I like how you captured the lone person standing there.</td>', 'Very interesting building. I like how you captured the lone person standing there.', '2005-05-05 01:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362044, 173558, 34390, '<td valign="top">Really nice. I love the color of the water.</td>', 'Really nice. I love the color of the water.', '2005-05-05 01:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362045, 173104, 35709, '<td valign="top">I don''t quite see what''s going on. Is it outside? Seems dark, so it might be at night,,,</td>', 'I don''t quite see what''s going on. Is it outside? Seems dark, so it might be at night,,,', '2005-05-05 01:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362046, 173820, 36762, '<td valign="top">wonderful shot.</td>', 'wonderful shot.', '2005-05-05 01:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362048, 173146, 36762, '<td valign="top">great shot.</td>', 'great shot.', '2005-05-05 01:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
