(1362081, 173496, 34390, '<td valign="top">The boats in the harbor all tucked in really add to the middle of the night feeling.</td>', 'The boats in the harbor all tucked in really add to the middle of the night feeling.', '2005-05-05 01:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362082, 173371, 36604, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what you''re using for a light source, but it makes the shot look like it was taken in late afternoon, not late night.</td>', 'I''m not sure what you''re using for a light source, but it makes the shot look like it was taken in late afternoon, not late night.', '2005-05-05 01:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362087, 173714, 36604, '<td valign="top">That is a nice effect.  I would have tried boosting the contrast very slightly, though.</td>', 'That is a nice effect.  I would have tried boosting the contrast very slightly, though.', '2005-05-05 01:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362092, 173569, 34390, '<td valign="top">Good angle on this. The colors are beautiful, too.</td>', 'Good angle on this. The colors are beautiful, too.', '2005-05-05 01:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362093, 172537, 36604, '<td valign="top">All the starburst flares seem gimmicky, and I might be jaded but I just don''t find time-lapse cars very interesting anymore.</td>', 'All the starburst flares seem gimmicky, and I might be jaded but I just don''t find time-lapse cars very interesting anymore.', '2005-05-05 01:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362094, 171919, 36604, '<td valign="top">Very out of focus, and the glare on the tree is very harsh.  There are nice colors on what I think is the lizard, though.</td>', 'Very out of focus, and the glare on the tree is very harsh.  There are nice colors on what I think is the lizard, though.', '2005-05-05 01:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362096, 172427, 34390, '<td valign="top">Love this shot. The tree there makes it seem like the tower isn''t as high, though. Too bad it wasn''t nearer the bottom of the photo.</td>', 'Love this shot. The tree there makes it seem like the tower isn''t as high, though. Too bad it wasn''t nearer the bottom of the photo.', '2005-05-05 01:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362097, 172521, 36604, '<td valign="top">Interesting color shift to provide a fantasy dark tower feel.  Nice.</td>', 'Interesting color shift to provide a fantasy dark tower feel.  Nice.', '2005-05-05 01:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362102, 173465, 34390, '<td valign="top">You did a nice job with the waterfall. Everything is nice and sharp. Beautiful lighting--great shot.</td>', 'You did a nice job with the waterfall. Everything is nice and sharp. Beautiful lighting--great shot.', '2005-05-05 01:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362103, 172378, 36604, '<td valign="top">You''re right, it is vaguely remniscent of a UFO. :)  The title makes the shot here, as it would be somewhat ordinary without that.  Scene seems slightly soft, but that might be from the resizing.  The UFO effect would have been better if it were extremely crisp, however.</td>', 'You''re right, it is vaguely remniscent of a UFO. :)  The title makes the shot here, as it would be somewhat ordinary without that.  Scene seems slightly soft, but that might be from the resizing.  The UFO effect would have been better if it were extremely crisp, however.', '2005-05-05 01:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362105, 173874, 34390, '<td valign="top">Very nice depth of field. I like it!</td>', 'Very nice depth of field. I like it!', '2005-05-05 01:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362106, 173399, 34390, '<td valign="top">Very nice city scene. The blues in the water are gorgeous.</td>', 'Very nice city scene. The blues in the water are gorgeous.', '2005-05-05 01:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362108, 173044, 36604, '<td valign="top">Cute capture, but marred by the blown highlights on the lights.  Also, try framing so that the shot is a little more to the left.  My eye wants to see it at about the 1/3 mark, and it seems more like 2/5.</td>', 'Cute capture, but marred by the blown highlights on the lights.  Also, try framing so that the shot is a little more to the left.  My eye wants to see it at about the 1/3 mark, and it seems more like 2/5.', '2005-05-05 01:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362109, 172809, 34390, '<td valign="top">I can''t see what this is supposed to be.</td>', 'I can''t see what this is supposed to be.', '2005-05-05 01:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362115, 173490, 34390, '<td valign="top">Beautiful mirror. The right side is a little darker, and makes it looks like the picture is slanted down on that side.  It''s just the way the lighting is.</td>', 'Beautiful mirror. The right side is a little darker, and makes it looks like the picture is slanted down on that side.  It''s just the way the lighting is.', '2005-05-05 01:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362120, 173608, 36604, '<td valign="top">The noise in the background is very irregular, making me think that you overused a noise reduction program somewhat.  A regular grain is less distracting than irregular patches.  Try lowering the power, or increasing the smoothness, though that has a tendency to blur the image.</td>', 'The noise in the background is very irregular, making me think that you overused a noise reduction program somewhat.  A regular grain is less distracting than irregular patches.  Try lowering the power, or increasing the smoothness, though that has a tendency to blur the image.', '2005-05-05 01:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362122, 172292, 36604, '<td valign="top">Haunting, with a nice blend of colors.</td>', 'Haunting, with a nice blend of colors.', '2005-05-05 01:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362127, 173343, 36604, '<td valign="top">A sunset doesn''t qualify as "late night" to me, unfortunately.  It''s pretty, but could probably use a slight contrast boost and the boats are slightly out of focus.</td>', 'A sunset doesn''t qualify as "late night" to me, unfortunately.  It''s pretty, but could probably use a slight contrast boost and the boats are slightly out of focus.', '2005-05-05 01:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362129, 173556, 36604, '<td valign="top">An interesting array of colors and shapes, but I have no idea what this is actually a picture of.  It looks like a colorized game of "Life" run amok.</td>', 'An interesting array of colors and shapes, but I have no idea what this is actually a picture of.  It looks like a colorized game of "Life" run amok.', '2005-05-05 01:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362131, 172863, 36604, '<td valign="top">The sky isn''t quite as dark as I''d like, and the noise makes it look like an ancient NASA shot, but I''m partial to astronomy pictures, so I''m giving a few free bonus points for that. :)</td>', 'The sky isn''t quite as dark as I''d like, and the noise makes it look like an ancient NASA shot, but I''m partial to astronomy pictures, so I''m giving a few free bonus points for that. :)', '2005-05-05 01:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362133, 173397, 36604, '<td valign="top">Unless you have unexpectedly lost your roof, this doesn''t qualify as "outdoors".</td>', 'Unless you have unexpectedly lost your roof, this doesn''t qualify as "outdoors".', '2005-05-05 01:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362138, 172969, 15511, '<td valign="top">Where are all the people?</td>', 'Where are all the people?', '2005-05-05 01:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362140, 173434, 36547, '<td valign="top">Can''t see it</td>', 'Can''t see it', '2005-05-05 01:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362143, 173796, 24613, '<td valign="top">It may have been better to crop out that light on the left, otherwise, it''s a very nice shot! 7</td>', 'It may have been better to crop out that light on the left, otherwise, it''s a very nice shot! 7', '2005-05-05 01:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362153, 171911, 36604, '<td valign="top">You''re probably going to get hammered for having too small a shot.  That doesn''t bother me quite as much as it does many, but with such a simple subject, having it centered doesn''t really work that well.  Try framing it so that it shows up either one third from the left or the right instead.  A contrast boost might also be in order, as the scene seems a little washed out.  The subject also doesn''t seem to be that compelling.</td>', 'You''re probably going to get hammered for having too small a shot.  That doesn''t bother me quite as much as it does many, but with such a simple subject, having it centered doesn''t really work that well.  Try framing it so that it shows up either one third from the left or the right instead.  A contrast boost might also be in order, as the scene seems a little washed out.  The subject also doesn''t seem to be that compelling.', '2005-05-05 01:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362155, 173397, 36654, '<td valign="top">challenge said outside late at night...</td>', 'challenge said outside late at night...', '2005-05-05 01:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362158, 173193, 36604, '<td valign="top">The noise is so bad that it almost looks like a special effect.  That actually almost helps the image, though, since it doesn''t seem all that interesting, otherwise.</td>', 'The noise is so bad that it almost looks like a special effect.  That actually almost helps the image, though, since it doesn''t seem all that interesting, otherwise.', '2005-05-05 01:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362161, 173434, 36604, '<td valign="top">You''re #2 so far that I''ve seen pull this old joke.  It was funny 20 years ago, but not today.</td>', 'You''re #2 so far that I''ve seen pull this old joke.  It was funny 20 years ago, but not today.', '2005-05-05 01:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362170, 171923, 36604, '<td valign="top">You''re probably going to get hammered for it being too small, but I think this is very beautiful.  I like the blend of colors in the sky.</td>', 'You''re probably going to get hammered for it being too small, but I think this is very beautiful.  I like the blend of colors in the sky.', '2005-05-05 02:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362174, 172546, 36604, '<td valign="top">Very pretty colors and a haunting feel.  It touches a soft spot in me because I also have memories of sitting alone on cold stone with only my guitar for company.  The image is marred by being slightly blurry, however.</td>', 'Very pretty colors and a haunting feel.  It touches a soft spot in me because I also have memories of sitting alone on cold stone with only my guitar for company.  The image is marred by being slightly blurry, however.', '2005-05-05 02:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362178, 173774, 36604, '<td valign="top">Very noisy, made particularly visible by the chroma noise, underexposed, and there doesn''t seem to be anything particularly interesting about the subject.  I recommend picking up Noise Ninja and bracketing your shots, standing closer, or getting a better flash.</td>', 'Very noisy, made particularly visible by the chroma noise, underexposed, and there doesn''t seem to be anything particularly interesting about the subject.  I recommend picking up Noise Ninja and bracketing your shots, standing closer, or getting a better flash.', '2005-05-05 02:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362180, 173599, 36604, '<td valign="top">This looks more like a painting than a photograph.  There''s such a thing as being too heavily processed.</td>', 'This looks more like a painting than a photograph.  There''s such a thing as being too heavily processed.', '2005-05-05 02:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362182, 173045, 36604, '<td valign="top">You''re probably going to get hammered for submitting something so small.  This doesn''t bother me as much as some, but it does make the details hard to pick out.  Highlights at the top of the fountain seem blown, and the color on the front stonework doesn''t seem to fit the image.</td>', 'You''re probably going to get hammered for submitting something so small.  This doesn''t bother me as much as some, but it does make the details hard to pick out.  Highlights at the top of the fountain seem blown, and the color on the front stonework doesn''t seem to fit the image.', '2005-05-05 02:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362183, 173161, 36604, '<td valign="top">Heh, the title makes the image this time.  You''re going to get absolutely hammered for it (pun intended), I suspect, but I like both the humor and the colors.</td>', 'Heh, the title makes the image this time.  You''re going to get absolutely hammered for it (pun intended), I suspect, but I like both the humor and the colors.', '2005-05-05 02:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362185, 173349, 36604, '<td valign="top">I like the reflections and the color contrast of the lone red bag.  The expression is also nice.</td>', 'I like the reflections and the color contrast of the lone red bag.  The expression is also nice.', '2005-05-05 02:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362186, 172473, 29474, '<td valign="top">It looks too much like a sunset picture.</td>', 'It looks too much like a sunset picture.', '2005-05-05 02:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362189, 173351, 35764, '<td valign="top">great lighting</td>', 'great lighting', '2005-05-05 02:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362190, 173193, 29474, '<td valign="top">Is the high noise level deliberate?</td>', 'Is the high noise level deliberate?', '2005-05-05 02:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362192, 173077, 36604, '<td valign="top">On the LCD, this was almost black on black.  On my CRT, it comes out just fine, complete with the slight leaf detail in the background which breaks up the negative space nicely.</td>', 'On the LCD, this was almost black on black.  On my CRT, it comes out just fine, complete with the slight leaf detail in the background which breaks up the negative space nicely.', '2005-05-05 02:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362193, 172473, 35764, '<td valign="top">awesome shot</td>', 'awesome shot', '2005-05-05 02:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362196, 173763, 29474, '<td valign="top">The tree and light on the left are a bit of a distraction, although they are what give the impression of ''night''.</td>', 'The tree and light on the left are a bit of a distraction, although they are what give the impression of ''night''.', '2005-05-05 02:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362198, 173729, 36604, '<td valign="top">Damn console gamers...  at least your hobby is getting you out of the house :P  (Not that I''m one to talk...)<br/> <br/>Interesting use of light and shadow, and the plant breaks up the background nicely.  Black and white works well here, as does the odd slant, but the image still doesn''t really grab my attention.</td>', 'Damn console gamers...  at least your hobby is getting you out of the house :P  (Not that I''m one to talk...) Interesting use of light and shadow, and the plant breaks up the background nicely.  Black and white works well here, as does the odd slant, but the image still doesn''t really grab my attention.', '2005-05-05 02:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362199, 172521, 37320, '<td valign="top">A pleasure to look at.</td>', 'A pleasure to look at.', '2005-05-05 02:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362200, 173262, 36604, '<td valign="top">The contest specified an outdoors shot, I''m afraid.  The color is nice, though.</td>', 'The contest specified an outdoors shot, I''m afraid.  The color is nice, though.', '2005-05-05 02:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362201, 173895, 29474, '<td valign="top">I would crop the empty space on both sides.</td>', 'I would crop the empty space on both sides.', '2005-05-05 02:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362203, 173897, 36604, '<td valign="top">Very nice array of colors.</td>', 'Very nice array of colors.', '2005-05-05 02:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362204, 173488, 37320, '<td valign="top">Most people don''t do stars well, but you''ve done a good job, thanks for giving me hope.</td>', 'Most people don''t do stars well, but you''ve done a good job, thanks for giving me hope.', '2005-05-05 02:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362205, 173456, 37302, '<td valign="top">very captivating and now I miss Laguna :(</td>', 'very captivating and now I miss Laguna :(', '2005-05-05 02:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362206, 173259, 36604, '<td valign="top">This seems washed out, and could use a good contrast boost.  Scene seems drab, though, with the exception of the colors at the lower right.</td>', 'This seems washed out, and could use a good contrast boost.  Scene seems drab, though, with the exception of the colors at the lower right.', '2005-05-05 02:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362208, 173634, 37302, '<td valign="top">very good idea for late night. fresh</td>', 'very good idea for late night. fresh', '2005-05-05 02:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362209, 173399, 29474, '<td valign="top">Great picture. Fractionally over-exposed? Maybe.</td>', 'Great picture. Fractionally over-exposed? Maybe.', '2005-05-05 02:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362212, 173745, 37302, '<td valign="top">is this the thick dark they mention in the bible?</td>', 'is this the thick dark they mention in the bible?', '2005-05-05 02:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362213, 173394, 37302, '<td valign="top">nice idea and action in it too :)</td>', 'nice idea and action in it too :)', '2005-05-05 02:28:06.000000', NULL, 1);
