(1362239, 173897, 29474, '<td valign="top">Seems to be tilted to the left. Presumably this was not deliberate.</td>', 'Seems to be tilted to the left. Presumably this was not deliberate.', '2005-05-05 02:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362240, 172423, 37302, '<td valign="top">very interesting ;)</td>', 'very interesting ;)', '2005-05-05 02:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362242, 173588, 37302, '<td valign="top">love it</td>', 'love it', '2005-05-05 02:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362243, 173771, 37302, '<td valign="top">womderful</td>', 'womderful', '2005-05-05 02:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362246, 171798, 37302, '<td valign="top">looks like an LA freeway ;) nice shot</td>', 'looks like an LA freeway ;) nice shot', '2005-05-05 02:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362249, 172602, 37320, '<td valign="top">If I had a nickel for every time after a night out this sight was that last I remember....</td>', 'If I had a nickel for every time after a night out this sight was that last I remember....', '2005-05-05 02:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362250, 173728, 37302, '<td valign="top">It doesn''t show your night shooting capabilities if you have to put a big light on it :(</td>', 'It doesn''t show your night shooting capabilities if you have to put a big light on it :(', '2005-05-05 02:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362253, 172697, 36604, '<td valign="top">A sunset is not late night.</td>', 'A sunset is not late night.', '2005-05-05 02:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362296, 173742, 29474, '<td valign="top">Wonderful. Now I wish I had got off my butt and taken some pictures of Cape Town at night.</td>', 'Wonderful. Now I wish I had got off my butt and taken some pictures of Cape Town at night.', '2005-05-05 03:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362297, 172318, 30392, '<td valign="top">This is very cool, I love the lights in the water and the clouds, but it''s not flat!!!</td>', 'This is very cool, I love the lights in the water and the clouds, but it''s not flat!!!', '2005-05-05 03:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362303, 173764, 28875, '<td valign="top">Like this shot, a lot of depth, content, this is also what I like to do in my photo''s, nice work.8</td>', 'Like this shot, a lot of depth, content, this is also what I like to do in my photo''s, nice work.8', '2005-05-05 03:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362312, 172546, 26526, '<td valign="top">Outstanding photograph that tells a story. Moody, but not too dark, very fine detail shown. I really like the lighting, colors. The fog, with glowing lights on the bridge showing through it, the water reflecting this, to the bricks of the pavement in front of the seated musician. Nice touch, sunglasses on at night. Excellent composition. Stellar focus for a night shot. I just can''t say enough about this photograph. 10!</td>', 'Outstanding photograph that tells a story. Moody, but not too dark, very fine detail shown. I really like the lighting, colors. The fog, with glowing lights on the bridge showing through it, the water reflecting this, to the bricks of the pavement in front of the seated musician. Nice touch, sunglasses on at night. Excellent composition. Stellar focus for a night shot. I just can''t say enough about this photograph. 10!', '2005-05-05 03:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362314, 173756, 28875, '<td valign="top">This photo has something, because of the light through the glass and the ceiling, there is a 3 D effect.<br/></td>', 'This photo has something, because of the light through the glass and the ceiling, there is a 3 D effect.', '2005-05-05 03:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362316, 173908, 26526, '<td valign="top">10! Stunning color use. The water is so smooth I can''t tell where the boats end and their reflection begins. Like the shadows, the large one looks like a big fish to me. How fitting. Excellent composition. Very well done!</td>', '10! Stunning color use. The water is so smooth I can''t tell where the boats end and their reflection begins. Like the shadows, the large one looks like a big fish to me. How fitting. Excellent composition. Very well done!', '2005-05-05 03:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362318, 173745, 29474, '<td valign="top">Yea right!</td>', 'Yea right!', '2005-05-05 03:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362320, 173666, 28801, '<td valign="top">Nice colours, excellent use of geometric shapes</td>', 'Nice colours, excellent use of geometric shapes', '2005-05-05 03:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362321, 172182, 28801, '<td valign="top">Quite spooky actually</td>', 'Quite spooky actually', '2005-05-05 03:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362322, 173471, 26526, '<td valign="top">Pink Floyd has returned! I don''t know why I said that, but it is what jumped out at me seeing this photograph. Just reminds me of that group, their music and their album covers. Love the dark sky and the pink smoke. Really cool colors, lighting, in the windows of the factory. Like the star bursts in the left corner. It is all so smooth..... so 10!</td>', 'Pink Floyd has returned! I don''t know why I said that, but it is what jumped out at me seeing this photograph. Just reminds me of that group, their music and their album covers. Love the dark sky and the pink smoke. Really cool colors, lighting, in the windows of the factory. Like the star bursts in the left corner. It is all so smooth..... so 10!', '2005-05-05 03:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362323, 173146, 26526, '<td valign="top">Stellar photograph. I like the colors, the golden reflection of the lighted domes in the water. Most of all I like how smooth this is, the blending of colors. Like the dark sky as a background. Nothing distracts from the subject. Excellent capture.</td>', 'Stellar photograph. I like the colors, the golden reflection of the lighted domes in the water. Most of all I like how smooth this is, the blending of colors. Like the dark sky as a background. Nothing distracts from the subject. Excellent capture.', '2005-05-05 04:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362324, 171945, 29537, '<td valign="top">nice composition, good colors, perhaps better with a deeper DOF</td>', 'nice composition, good colors, perhaps better with a deeper DOF', '2005-05-05 04:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362331, 173671, 29537, '<td valign="top">I like this warm atmosphere</td>', 'I like this warm atmosphere', '2005-05-05 04:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362334, 172385, 26526, '<td valign="top">Love this photograph. Like the sharp focus on the people in the car, with a blurring of the lights in the background. (Well, in front of them.) Has a surreal feeling to it. Even the title bends my mind. This photograph certainly jolts me out of how my mind expects a photograph to be laid out. 10!</td>', 'Love this photograph. Like the sharp focus on the people in the car, with a blurring of the lights in the background. (Well, in front of them.) Has a surreal feeling to it. Even the title bends my mind. This photograph certainly jolts me out of how my mind expects a photograph to be laid out. 10!', '2005-05-05 04:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362336, 173852, 29537, '<td valign="top">a suggestive shot, very well done</td>', 'a suggestive shot, very well done', '2005-05-05 04:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362342, 173869, 31307, '<td valign="top">It''s kind of hard to tell, but it looks like there''s a little bit of grain--particularly in the upper left corner...  Nice colors and saturation, though!</td>', 'It''s kind of hard to tell, but it looks like there''s a little bit of grain--particularly in the upper left corner...  Nice colors and saturation, though!', '2005-05-05 04:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362343, 172537, 31307, '<td valign="top">Pretty sweet!  I wonder if popping the the reds a little more might have improved it still?  Great job!</td>', 'Pretty sweet!  I wonder if popping the the reds a little more might have improved it still?  Great job!', '2005-05-05 04:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362344, 171923, 31307, '<td valign="top">This would have been a pretty decent shot!   I would have liked to see a larger resolution, though.</td>', 'This would have been a pretty decent shot!   I would have liked to see a larger resolution, though.', '2005-05-05 04:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362345, 173023, 26526, '<td valign="top">I like this photograph in b&amp;w. Excellent lighting and focus used. Centered in the shot works in this photograph. Very good night capture.</td>', 'I like this photograph in b&w. Excellent lighting and focus used. Centered in the shot works in this photograph. Very good night capture.', '2005-05-05 04:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362346, 173781, 31307, '<td valign="top">Nice!  I like how the lights kind of suggest icicles.  Very cool!</td>', 'Nice!  I like how the lights kind of suggest icicles.  Very cool!', '2005-05-05 04:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362347, 173105, 31307, '<td valign="top">Try a higher resolution.  A shot like this begs for a panorama, I think.</td>', 'Try a higher resolution.  A shot like this begs for a panorama, I think.', '2005-05-05 04:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362348, 172776, 26526, '<td valign="top">Nice colors. Like the reflection in the water.</td>', 'Nice colors. Like the reflection in the water.', '2005-05-05 04:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362351, 173597, 31307, '<td valign="top">It''s a little grainy.  Low light is such a pain, you know?  However, this is a gorgeous shot!  I really like how you added the rocks/hill in the foreground!  Well done!</td>', 'It''s a little grainy.  Low light is such a pain, you know?  However, this is a gorgeous shot!  I really like how you added the rocks/hill in the foreground!  Well done!', '2005-05-05 04:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362352, 172610, 31307, '<td valign="top">Breathtaking...I love the choice of B/W!</td>', 'Breathtaking...I love the choice of B/W!', '2005-05-05 04:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362354, 173572, 31307, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but I think a way to really improve it would be to keep the car in focus and have the rest blurry.</td>', 'Nice shot, but I think a way to really improve it would be to keep the car in focus and have the rest blurry.', '2005-05-05 04:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362356, 171666, 31307, '<td valign="top">Horizon''s just a tad crooked it seems.  Nice shot, though!</td>', 'Horizon''s just a tad crooked it seems.  Nice shot, though!', '2005-05-05 04:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362357, 173771, 26526, '<td valign="top">I like this photograph. Like the black and gray colors used. The many lighted windows add brightness to it. Good composition, pov, like the frame.</td>', 'I like this photograph. Like the black and gray colors used. The many lighted windows add brightness to it. Good composition, pov, like the frame.', '2005-05-05 04:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362358, 173496, 23458, '<td valign="top">Terrific exposure on this one - but I do have to say, I think the boats actually detract from this shot - still, its a strong entry. 7.</td>', 'Terrific exposure on this one - but I do have to say, I think the boats actually detract from this shot - still, its a strong entry. 7.', '2005-05-05 04:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362360, 173490, 31307, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  I can''t put my finger on it, but I think there''s one thing that kind of detracts from this shot.  Might it be contrast?  I don''t know, but it seems that if you could have somehow made the shadows pop a little more, then it would have really improved the shot.  I think that might be what is nagging at me.  Like I said, though, this is a great shot!</td>', 'Great shot!  I can''t put my finger on it, but I think there''s one thing that kind of detracts from this shot.  Might it be contrast?  I don''t know, but it seems that if you could have somehow made the shadows pop a little more, then it would have really improved the shot.  I think that might be what is nagging at me.  Like I said, though, this is a great shot!', '2005-05-05 04:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362362, 173465, 31307, '<td valign="top">Hey!  Not bad!  I have a waterfall kind of like this near me...you''ve inspired me!</td>', 'Hey!  Not bad!  I have a waterfall kind of like this near me...you''ve inspired me!', '2005-05-05 04:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362363, 173905, 26526, '<td valign="top">Unusual color in this photograph, but I like it. Almost looks like an old print or film negative to me.</td>', 'Unusual color in this photograph, but I like it. Almost looks like an old print or film negative to me.', '2005-05-05 04:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362364, 173771, 31307, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool!  I think B/W might have been a better choice..or perhaps just the reverse even.  Maybe a supersaturated look would have been really sweet looking!  Nice capture regardless!</td>', 'Pretty cool!  I think B/W might have been a better choice..or perhaps just the reverse even.  Maybe a supersaturated look would have been really sweet looking!  Nice capture regardless!', '2005-05-05 04:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362365, 171704, 28801, '<td valign="top">A bit on the dark side</td>', 'A bit on the dark side', '2005-05-05 04:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362366, 171809, 26526, '<td valign="top">I like the tone of this photograph. Excellent composition.</td>', 'I like the tone of this photograph. Excellent composition.', '2005-05-05 04:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362370, 173781, 28801, '<td valign="top">Very nice. The reflection really gives it a nice atmosphere</td>', 'Very nice. The reflection really gives it a nice atmosphere', '2005-05-05 05:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362372, 172318, 31307, '<td valign="top">This almost looks computer generated...It''s really...refined looking--that''s a compliment.  I think it''s a very neat sort of surreal effect.  Very cool!</td>', 'This almost looks computer generated...It''s really...refined looking--that''s a compliment.  I think it''s a very neat sort of surreal effect.  Very cool!', '2005-05-05 05:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362376, 173501, 28801, '<td valign="top">This image has a stark artistic feel to it. I think you cropped it just right. Great job!</td>', 'This image has a stark artistic feel to it. I think you cropped it just right. Great job!', '2005-05-05 05:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362381, 173905, 29474, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred this a little darker.</td>', 'I would have preferred this a little darker.', '2005-05-05 05:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362383, 173764, 26526, '<td valign="top">I like the mood of this photograph, dark, lonely, closed. Nice tone used to achieve that feeling. Rain on the glass explains the empty tables and  chairs. Soft focus gives it a mystical feeling.</td>', 'I like the mood of this photograph, dark, lonely, closed. Nice tone used to achieve that feeling. Rain on the glass explains the empty tables and  chairs. Soft focus gives it a mystical feeling.', '2005-05-05 05:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362384, 171919, 28801, '<td valign="top">Could have been bigger ... and sharper</td>', 'Could have been bigger ... and sharper', '2005-05-05 05:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362385, 173820, 28801, '<td valign="top">This black triangular object at the lower left hand corner detracts from what would otherwise have been an excellent shot. Lucky you living in beautiful SF.</td>', 'This black triangular object at the lower left hand corner detracts from what would otherwise have been an excellent shot. Lucky you living in beautiful SF.', '2005-05-05 05:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362387, 173452, 28801, '<td valign="top">nice effect, nice concept</td>', 'nice effect, nice concept', '2005-05-05 05:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362388, 173742, 28801, '<td valign="top">Nice city lights. Sharp image.</td>', 'Nice city lights. Sharp image.', '2005-05-05 05:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362390, 172431, 28801, '<td valign="top">I really miss those twin towers.</td>', 'I really miss those twin towers.', '2005-05-05 05:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362392, 172486, 28801, '<td valign="top">You captured the serenity of the landscape. Nice shot.</td>', 'You captured the serenity of the landscape. Nice shot.', '2005-05-05 05:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362394, 171682, 28801, '<td valign="top">I think that if it were possible to exclude the cars, the shot would have been improved.</td>', 'I think that if it were possible to exclude the cars, the shot would have been improved.', '2005-05-05 05:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362396, 172599, 29474, '<td valign="top">Slightly under-exposed for me. I would have liked to have seen more of the detail in the shadows.</td>', 'Slightly under-exposed for me. I would have liked to have seen more of the detail in the shadows.', '2005-05-05 05:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362398, 172121, 32108, '<td valign="top">leads the eye well</td>', 'leads the eye well', '2005-05-05 05:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362399, 171662, 32108, '<td valign="top">wonderful clarity</td>', 'wonderful clarity', '2005-05-05 05:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362400, 173564, 32108, '<td valign="top">excellent</td>', 'excellent', '2005-05-05 05:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362401, 173077, 32108, '<td valign="top">different</td>', 'different', '2005-05-05 05:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362403, 172765, 32108, '<td valign="top">great tones</td>', 'great tones', '2005-05-05 05:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362404, 173226, 32108, '<td valign="top">a bit soft on focus</td>', 'a bit soft on focus', '2005-05-05 05:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362405, 171904, 32108, '<td valign="top">great cropping</td>', 'great cropping', '2005-05-05 05:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362406, 173891, 32108, '<td valign="top">needs a little more fill</td>', 'needs a little more fill', '2005-05-05 05:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362407, 173712, 32108, '<td valign="top">nice tones</td>', 'nice tones', '2005-05-05 05:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362408, 172156, 32108, '<td valign="top">very clear &amp; well composed</td>', 'very clear & well composed', '2005-05-05 05:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362409, 171713, 32108, '<td valign="top">more contrast needed</td>', 'more contrast needed', '2005-05-05 05:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362410, 173585, 32108, '<td valign="top">nice warm glow</td>', 'nice warm glow', '2005-05-05 05:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362413, 173858, 28108, '<td valign="top">The trees look terrific, the light, colors and focus are great. The building looks weird, there''s a strange perspective. The light reflecting on the white are too harsh. The handicap parking sign is distracting, because of the color it stands out and is really not bringing anything to this scene.</td>', 'The trees look terrific, the light, colors and focus are great. The building looks weird, there''s a strange perspective. The light reflecting on the white are too harsh. The handicap parking sign is distracting, because of the color it stands out and is really not bringing anything to this scene.', '2005-05-05 05:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362415, 173148, 28108, '<td valign="top">The little light specs are distracting and would have been easy to remove. The ocject has nothing of interest (to me), no color variance, not much texture and no depth.</td>', 'The little light specs are distracting and would have been easy to remove. The ocject has nothing of interest (to me), no color variance, not much texture and no depth.', '2005-05-05 05:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362416, 173756, 28108, '<td valign="top">Ah! cool shot! But why turn the bottle with the label away? Why?</td>', 'Ah! cool shot! But why turn the bottle with the label away? Why?', '2005-05-05 05:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362417, 173745, 28108, '<td valign="top">That''s a dark spot on the globe...</td>', 'That''s a dark spot on the globe...', '2005-05-05 05:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362418, 172318, 8682, '<td valign="top">That´s a beatiful pic. I really like the effect of movement in the clouds. The reflections on the water are really great, too. Probably, the only thing I don´t like is the angle, I think another angle would be better, but just my opinion. Overall a good phot, so 8. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'That´s a beatiful pic. I really like the effect of movement in the clouds. The reflections on the water are really great, too. Probably, the only thing I don´t like is the angle, I think another angle would be better, but just my opinion. Overall a good phot, so 8. Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-05-05 05:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
