(1362573, 173913, 25095, '<td valign="top">bad blur, try and always use a tripod when shooting at night although if this guy is real I''m sure you didn''t have much time to get a shot off so good effort.  The flash has burned out his backside, night photography can be very difficult and not knowing what camera you use it is hard to offer help on how to avoid this sorry.</td>', 'bad blur, try and always use a tripod when shooting at night although if this guy is real I''m sure you didn''t have much time to get a shot off so good effort.  The flash has burned out his backside, night photography can be very difficult and not knowing what camera you use it is hard to offer help on how to avoid this sorry.', '2005-05-05 08:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362575, 173339, 25095, '<td valign="top">My first thought was Disney Land...I love the tones it has and how it peeks out above the tree line.  I wish the top two crosses could have been lite more but that was out of your control so no biggy.  Good shot and good luck</td>', 'My first thought was Disney Land...I love the tones it has and how it peeks out above the tree line.  I wish the top two crosses could have been lite more but that was out of your control so no biggy.  Good shot and good luck', '2005-05-05 08:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
