(1362602, 173796, 25095, '<td valign="top">cool old style church, wish that light to the left was either off or didn''t shine your way so much, it draws the eye right to it.  Maybe you can place something between you and it so it still illuminates the church but doesn''t hurt your image.  you may have been able to get a little longer exposure without it also.</td>', 'cool old style church, wish that light to the left was either off or didn''t shine your way so much, it draws the eye right to it.  Maybe you can place something between you and it so it still illuminates the church but doesn''t hurt your image.  you may have been able to get a little longer exposure without it also.', '2005-05-05 08:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362603, 172036, 8522, '<td valign="top">Composition is messy, but nice shade of blue.</td>', 'Composition is messy, but nice shade of blue.', '2005-05-05 08:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362605, 173649, 8522, '<td valign="top">Not overly struck by this shot... colour balance is too orange and composition doesn''t quite work for me.</td>', 'Not overly struck by this shot... colour balance is too orange and composition doesn''t quite work for me.', '2005-05-05 08:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362606, 173104, 25095, '<td valign="top">not sure if this is really outside at night or not.  Your technique gives it a feel of computer generated, would love to see this during the day with full light...seems like a cool building. good luck</td>', 'not sure if this is really outside at night or not.  Your technique gives it a feel of computer generated, would love to see this during the day with full light...seems like a cool building. good luck', '2005-05-05 08:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362609, 171722, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wonderful house, great silhouette of figure on horse... the composition of the 2 together is far too messy though.</td>', 'Wonderful house, great silhouette of figure on horse... the composition of the 2 together is far too messy though.', '2005-05-05 08:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362611, 172483, 8522, '<td valign="top">A shot with loads of potential, but I wish the composition at the bottom of the frame was clearer.</td>', 'A shot with loads of potential, but I wish the composition at the bottom of the frame was clearer.', '2005-05-05 08:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362613, 173216, 25095, '<td valign="top">nice long exposure but I was confused at its shape because of the blue/silverish thing on the left almost seemed like something was cut off weird.  The pipe or item in the right corner could be easily cloned out of a non-challenge photo but you should see if a different angle would get rid of that or can it be moved while you shoot. Good shot and good luck</td>', 'nice long exposure but I was confused at its shape because of the blue/silverish thing on the left almost seemed like something was cut off weird.  The pipe or item in the right corner could be easily cloned out of a non-challenge photo but you should see if a different angle would get rid of that or can it be moved while you shoot. Good shot and good luck', '2005-05-05 08:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362615, 172776, 8522, '<td valign="top">Composition cluttered, no clear point of focus. Bridge cuts photo in half, I''d have prefered rule of thirds. Some strange colours and oversaturation.</td>', 'Composition cluttered, no clear point of focus. Bridge cuts photo in half, I''d have prefered rule of thirds. Some strange colours and oversaturation.', '2005-05-05 08:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362616, 172121, 25095, '<td valign="top">hey this would work for triangles too.  Cool long exposure shot. you didn''t blow out your lights but captured what seems to be a large truck going across.  Good luck.</td>', 'hey this would work for triangles too.  Cool long exposure shot. you didn''t blow out your lights but captured what seems to be a large truck going across.  Good luck.', '2005-05-05 08:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362617, 172365, 8522, '<td valign="top">Lovely view, shame your foreground is sharper than the buildings which are too blurred. Not keen on your colour balance. Composition feels unbalanced.</td>', 'Lovely view, shame your foreground is sharper than the buildings which are too blurred. Not keen on your colour balance. Composition feels unbalanced.', '2005-05-05 08:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
