(1362621, 172969, 25095, '<td valign="top">lots of lights, seems you used a star filter(?) a nice effect but I almost feel like there were too many lights around for this filter...you''ve got them up the stairs on the left, down the street, in the thing above the building and even in the windows reflection.  Nice exposure and colors.  Good luck</td>', 'lots of lights, seems you used a star filter(?) a nice effect but I almost feel like there were too many lights around for this filter...you''ve got them up the stairs on the left, down the street, in the thing above the building and even in the windows reflection.  Nice exposure and colors.  Good luck', '2005-05-05 08:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1362622, 173572, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wow, I would REALLY have liked this shot though if the car had been sharp... I know this would have been hard to pull off though. Perhaps a really powerful flash and an understanding driver could have helped.</td>', 'Wow, I would REALLY have liked this shot though if the car had been sharp... I know this would have been hard to pull off though. Perhaps a really powerful flash and an understanding driver could have helped.', '2005-05-05 08:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
