(1363109, 173508, 36604, '<td valign="top">Very pretty colors in the sky, and a somewhat attractive skyline.  The sun makes me think that this isn''t very late at night, though.  Also, the skyline seems very slightly high on the image.<br/> <br/>Update: Okay, so it''s not a sun, but a gas flare.  The arrangement, particularly with the lights in the clouds behind it, make it look like a sunset scene, however, which still leaves me *feeling* like it doesn''t really fit the challenge, possibly because I can''t get over my first impression now.  A title change noting that it is not a sunset might have changed that feeling to a sense of wonder about what exactly is being looked at (e.g. "In Africa, This Is Not a Sunset").  The current title, by blending "today"/"tonight", actively encourages the misinterpretation as a sunset.</td>', 'Very pretty colors in the sky, and a somewhat attractive skyline.  The sun makes me think that this isn''t very late at night, though.  Also, the skyline seems very slightly high on the image. Update: Okay, so it''s not a sun, but a gas flare.  The arrangement, particularly with the lights in the clouds behind it, make it look like a sunset scene, however, which still leaves me *feeling* like it doesn''t really fit the challenge, possibly because I can''t get over my first impression now.  A title change noting that it is not a sunset might have changed that feeling to a sense of wonder about what exactly is being looked at (e.g. "In Africa, This Is Not a Sunset").  The current title, by blending "today"/"tonight", actively encourages the misinterpretation as a sunset.', '2005-05-05 12:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363113, 173451, 36604, '<td valign="top">This does not seem to have taken place outside, as the challenge required.  The noise/grain is actually fitting, but the lack of focus and shadow detail on the face hurts the image somewhat.  I would have liked to see more of the expression.</td>', 'This does not seem to have taken place outside, as the challenge required.  The noise/grain is actually fitting, but the lack of focus and shadow detail on the face hurts the image somewhat.  I would have liked to see more of the expression.', '2005-05-05 12:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363116, 173104, 36604, '<td valign="top">Oddly compelling, though the extra detail on the left seems to unbalance the image slightly.  The arches imply a ceiling as well, which would mean that this is not outdoors as the challenge requested.</td>', 'Oddly compelling, though the extra detail on the left seems to unbalance the image slightly.  The arches imply a ceiling as well, which would mean that this is not outdoors as the challenge requested.', '2005-05-05 12:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363118, 173262, 34687, '<td valign="top">ERR..what are you trying to say. i guess i am dumb...or am i....</td>', 'ERR..what are you trying to say. i guess i am dumb...or am i....', '2005-05-05 12:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363123, 173090, 36604, '<td valign="top">The best of the time-lapse effect shots that I''ve seen so far (and I''m almost done with voting), mostly because the inside view of the car adds context and takes away the gimmicky feel.  It tells a story, rather than just being a technical display of what moving light looks like.  A nit: there''s just enough detail on the radio that I want to make out what the text says, but it is just blurry enough that I can''t.  Overall, having the light there is a positive thing, as adding more black area would have unbalanced the shot, but I do wish that one aspect had been slightly sharper.  Oddly, I don''t have this need for clarity on the speedometer, possibly because it fits well just as geometric shapes, or doesn''t really have text to read.</td>', 'The best of the time-lapse effect shots that I''ve seen so far (and I''m almost done with voting), mostly because the inside view of the car adds context and takes away the gimmicky feel.  It tells a story, rather than just being a technical display of what moving light looks like.  A nit: there''s just enough detail on the radio that I want to make out what the text says, but it is just blurry enough that I can''t.  Overall, having the light there is a positive thing, as adding more black area would have unbalanced the shot, but I do wish that one aspect had been slightly sharper.  Oddly, I don''t have this need for clarity on the speedometer, possibly because it fits well just as geometric shapes, or doesn''t really have text to read.', '2005-05-05 12:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363125, 172519, 33732, '<td valign="top">Not quite dark.</td>', 'Not quite dark.', '2005-05-05 12:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363127, 173745, 20977, '<td valign="top">IF YOU LOOK CLOSE THE LENS COVER SAYS NIKKON</td>', 'IF YOU LOOK CLOSE THE LENS COVER SAYS NIKKON', '2005-05-05 12:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363128, 172602, 36604, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective and idea, marred by the blown highlights on the left which distract and glare harshly.  There is a nice blend of color here, and the blurriness at the edge (which I suspect others will complain about) serves to draw my eye down the path, which I like.</td>', 'Interesting perspective and idea, marred by the blown highlights on the left which distract and glare harshly.  There is a nice blend of color here, and the blurriness at the edge (which I suspect others will complain about) serves to draw my eye down the path, which I like.', '2005-05-05 12:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363129, 173146, 31533, '<td valign="top">Can''t go wrong with that subject.<br/>The crop is a bit too tight for my liking and the horizon is tilted.</td>', 'Can''t go wrong with that subject.The crop is a bit too tight for my liking and the horizon is tilted.', '2005-05-05 12:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363131, 172765, 31533, '<td valign="top">The horizon is not level.</td>', 'The horizon is not level.', '2005-05-05 12:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363133, 173045, 17511, '<td valign="top">I got dinged for too small a photo in the last challenge. I fear the same might happen to you.</td>', 'I got dinged for too small a photo in the last challenge. I fear the same might happen to you.', '2005-05-05 12:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
