(1363151, 173434, 19978, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the crop and the image could have used a little more contrast. However, the emotional appeal is definitely there. This is a great idea. Keep working at it.</td>', 'I don''t care for the crop and the image could have used a little more contrast. However, the emotional appeal is definitely there. This is a great idea. Keep working at it.', '2005-05-05 12:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
