(1363199, 173845, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nice star trails! How long was the exposure? Original and interesting. Only thing I would change is maybe the lighting on the clocks, mostly the bottom clock, since it feels like artificial light there, while the rest of the scene feels natural.</td>', 'Nice star trails! How long was the exposure? Original and interesting. Only thing I would change is maybe the lighting on the clocks, mostly the bottom clock, since it feels like artificial light there, while the rest of the scene feels natural.', '2005-05-05 13:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
