(1363221, 173912, 22748, '<td valign="top">Feels like something from the 1950s. Original and different than most of the entries. Might be nice if it was a tiny bit less noisy though.</td>', 'Feels like something from the 1950s. Original and different than most of the entries. Might be nice if it was a tiny bit less noisy though.', '2005-05-05 13:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
