(1363266, 172863, 33435, '<td valign="top">These types of star shots are tough to pull off in these challenges, especially against some of the other submissions.  I keep scrolling up and down to try and make some sense of the image, but it really doesn''t seem to have any appeal other than white dots on black space.  There also seems to be a tinge of blue around the edges of the stars, which makes it seem like blurry dots.  I wish I had more good things to say, but I''m having trouble.  I like your idea though, so maybe you''ll have better luck if you try the shot again.</td>', 'These types of star shots are tough to pull off in these challenges, especially against some of the other submissions.  I keep scrolling up and down to try and make some sense of the image, but it really doesn''t seem to have any appeal other than white dots on black space.  There also seems to be a tinge of blue around the edges of the stars, which makes it seem like blurry dots.  I wish I had more good things to say, but I''m having trouble.  I like your idea though, so maybe you''ll have better luck if you try the shot again.', '2005-05-05 13:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363267, 171661, 33732, '<td valign="top">I am glad you entered this.  I believe this photo serves a double benefit.  The quality of this is great!  Not overexposed for most of  the lights.  I would have liked the reflection to include the top of the church.</td>', 'I am glad you entered this.  I believe this photo serves a double benefit.  The quality of this is great!  Not overexposed for most of  the lights.  I would have liked the reflection to include the top of the church.', '2005-05-05 13:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363269, 173868, 33732, '<td valign="top">There are no people.  Seems like that would have added something.</td>', 'There are no people.  Seems like that would have added something.', '2005-05-05 13:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363272, 173339, 33732, '<td valign="top">The black framing is realistic.  I would expect more shadows.</td>', 'The black framing is realistic.  I would expect more shadows.', '2005-05-05 13:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363273, 172292, 20462, '<td valign="top">forboding, but underexposed.</td>', 'forboding, but underexposed.', '2005-05-05 13:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
