(1363350, 173638, 34390, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but it could have just as well have been taken at any time--it doesn''t seem to emphasize late night.</td>', 'Nice photo, but it could have just as well have been taken at any time--it doesn''t seem to emphasize late night.', '2005-05-05 14:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363351, 171682, 33435, '<td valign="top">The courthouse is a beautiful building and the color here is fantastic, but you could have captured those two elements without the cars.  They really take away from the shot.  Also, had you been closer to the building, you would have been further away from those very bright street lights, and would have ended up with even better lighting, and less or no lens flares.  Not sure if you used a lens hood, but if you didn''t, they really eliminate a lot of flares, and improve on the contrast of the photo.</td>', 'The courthouse is a beautiful building and the color here is fantastic, but you could have captured those two elements without the cars.  They really take away from the shot.  Also, had you been closer to the building, you would have been further away from those very bright street lights, and would have ended up with even better lighting, and less or no lens flares.  Not sure if you used a lens hood, but if you didn''t, they really eliminate a lot of flares, and improve on the contrast of the photo.', '2005-05-05 14:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363353, 173259, 34687, '<td valign="top">wwashed out it looks. no good become.</td>', 'wwashed out it looks. no good become.', '2005-05-05 14:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
