(1363359, 173497, 33435, '<td valign="top">If you would like a tip on improving contrast, set your aperature down (f8 to f13, etc), and give a much longer exposure time (10sec, 15sec, etc.)  It will clean up those lights that bleed all over your trains, and make a neater and more interesting image.image</td>', 'If you would like a tip on improving contrast, set your aperature down (f8 to f13, etc), and give a much longer exposure time (10sec, 15sec, etc.)  It will clean up those lights that bleed all over your trains, and make a neater and more interesting image.image', '2005-05-05 14:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363364, 173599, 33435, '<td valign="top">I think what really makes this shot is the moon.  I can only guess that you''re getting slammed in this challenge, but I respect the effort.  I''d be interested to know if this was done with a high iso setting, or with photoshop.  Nice glow around the trees by the way.</td>', 'I think what really makes this shot is the moon.  I can only guess that you''re getting slammed in this challenge, but I respect the effort.  I''d be interested to know if this was done with a high iso setting, or with photoshop.  Nice glow around the trees by the way.', '2005-05-05 14:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363366, 171666, 33435, '<td valign="top">I love the composition, but the lighting towards the bottom right has room for improvement.  Maybe a longer exposure would do the trick were you to re-take the shot.</td>', 'I love the composition, but the lighting towards the bottom right has room for improvement.  Maybe a longer exposure would do the trick were you to re-take the shot.', '2005-05-05 14:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
