(1363379, 173594, 33435, '<td valign="top">I wish I couold say something good here, but it looks like you saw the challenge and ran out to your back yard and took a snapshot of a tree with a flash.   It doesn''t appear that any time or effort went into composition, or at least an attempt in taking a good photo.  Now, I''m not trying to slam your shot, but when you submit a photo to a challenge, ask yourself if that shot is something worthy of a print hanging on a wall.  Know what I mean?  I don''t see this as something that would make a good print.</td>', 'I wish I couold say something good here, but it looks like you saw the challenge and ran out to your back yard and took a snapshot of a tree with a flash.   It doesn''t appear that any time or effort went into composition, or at least an attempt in taking a good photo.  Now, I''m not trying to slam your shot, but when you submit a photo to a challenge, ask yourself if that shot is something worthy of a print hanging on a wall.  Know what I mean?  I don''t see this as something that would make a good print.', '2005-05-05 14:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
