(1363423, 173763, 19010, '<td valign="top">I like it its simples shapes with lots of complex lines and details. My favorite part of this shot would have to be the lights. I realy enjoy the way the lights disect the building into a variaty of different shapes. I see a few things I dont care for inthis shot however. I don''t think I like the light on the bottm left. It keeps pulling my attention away from the building.  In the bottom quarter of the square building there is a dark line that looks like a tear in the building. I also would like to have seen the light that is starting to show in the sky a little brighter. But those are relitivly small flaws and some of them are just personal taste. Overall this is a great image "8"</td>', 'I like it its simples shapes with lots of complex lines and details. My favorite part of this shot would have to be the lights. I realy enjoy the way the lights disect the building into a variaty of different shapes. I see a few things I dont care for inthis shot however. I don''t think I like the light on the bottm left. It keeps pulling my attention away from the building.  In the bottom quarter of the square building there is a dark line that looks like a tear in the building. I also would like to have seen the light that is starting to show in the sky a little brighter. But those are relitivly small flaws and some of them are just personal taste. Overall this is a great image "8"', '2005-05-05 14:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
