(1363443, 173721, 19503, '<td valign="top">wow.. I don''t even know why I like this, but I do love it! The moving branches perhaps.. I have never seen anything like it, and still it looks so mundane in its own way, if it wasn''t for the modern cars, I would have guessed this photo was taken 40yrs ago, I think thats whats baffles me.. Good Job.. 8.</td>', 'wow.. I don''t even know why I like this, but I do love it! The moving branches perhaps.. I have never seen anything like it, and still it looks so mundane in its own way, if it wasn''t for the modern cars, I would have guessed this photo was taken 40yrs ago, I think thats whats baffles me.. Good Job.. 8.', '2005-05-05 14:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363445, 172776, 11467, '<td valign="top">Shame about the crane up there. Otherwise an outstanding shot</td>', 'Shame about the crane up there. Otherwise an outstanding shot', '2005-05-05 14:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363446, 171678, 5664, '<td valign="top">I am sure you meant well</td>', 'I am sure you meant well', '2005-05-05 14:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
