(1363449, 173077, 18705, '<td valign="top">Nice picture. I like the subject, there''s an obvious chemistry between these two and that clearly comes across. The lighting and exposure are good, but I''m not sure about the composition and I feel that there''s a bit too much empty space around the subject. Also, it''s a pity that we cannot see a bit more of the womans face. That said, it''s still one of my favourites from this challenge and I hope it does well.</td>', 'Nice picture. I like the subject, there''s an obvious chemistry between these two and that clearly comes across. The lighting and exposure are good, but I''m not sure about the composition and I feel that there''s a bit too much empty space around the subject. Also, it''s a pity that we cannot see a bit more of the womans face. That said, it''s still one of my favourites from this challenge and I hope it does well.', '2005-05-05 14:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363450, 173193, 5664, '<td valign="top">I like it</td>', 'I like it', '2005-05-05 14:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
