(1363461, 173193, 34134, '<td valign="top">Really grainy, but probably limited by your camera. If you use something like Neat Image it might help. Good luck. Bumping up.</td>', 'Really grainy, but probably limited by your camera. If you use something like Neat Image it might help. Good luck. Bumping up.', '2005-05-05 14:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363462, 173205, 5664, '<td valign="top">You did well</td>', 'You did well', '2005-05-05 14:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363464, 172872, 33435, '<td valign="top">Since a lot of DP users are so anal about negative space, I''m hoping that you didn''t crop this photo to please votors.  I''m getting slammed for not cropping on a cityscape shot with a similar composition.  However, when you took the shot, there was a foreground, and sky right?  When cityscapes are photographed, I believe it makes a more "natural" feel when the sky is left present.  Don''t be afraid to leave it in the shot.  Oh, and by the way, this is a fantastic capture.  A big 10!</td>', 'Since a lot of DP users are so anal about negative space, I''m hoping that you didn''t crop this photo to please votors.  I''m getting slammed for not cropping on a cityscape shot with a similar composition.  However, when you took the shot, there was a foreground, and sky right?  When cityscapes are photographed, I believe it makes a more "natural" feel when the sky is left present.  Don''t be afraid to leave it in the shot.  Oh, and by the way, this is a fantastic capture.  A big 10!', '2005-05-05 14:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363465, 173439, 19503, '<td valign="top">Feels like a JJ. <br/> <br/>Light.. shapes.. texture.. very cool. I just wonder since its late night where a light like this comes from. Street light? <br/> <br/>Really love this one, good job :)</td>', 'Feels like a JJ.  Light.. shapes.. texture.. very cool. I just wonder since its late night where a light like this comes from. Street light?  Really love this one, good job :)', '2005-05-05 14:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
