(1363468, 173916, 34134, '<td valign="top">Pictures this size don''t generally fare well. This would have been pretty good, but....<br/>Second pass: Bumping up. It was a good attempt. Really interesting. :)</td>', 'Pictures this size don''t generally fare well. This would have been pretty good, but....Second pass: Bumping up. It was a good attempt. Really interesting. :)', '2005-05-05 14:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
