(1363478, 172316, 31211, '<td valign="top">Very nice and clear, neat image. Maybe you could have included a little less water a little more sky, but it''s just my opinion. Anyway, great shot.9</td>', 'Very nice and clear, neat image. Maybe you could have included a little less water a little more sky, but it''s just my opinion. Anyway, great shot.9', '2005-05-05 14:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363485, 172610, 33435, '<td valign="top">Dreamers can find their way by moonlight, voters can find their way by moving the mouse to the right, until they see 10, and click.  Seriously, my favorite in the challenge.  Absolutely beautiful photo!  As a print, I''d like it better if the stars were cloned out, but I understand that they had to be left in for the challenge.  Thats just my opinion anyway, I''m sure many people liked the stars.</td>', 'Dreamers can find their way by moonlight, voters can find their way by moving the mouse to the right, until they see 10, and click.  Seriously, my favorite in the challenge.  Absolutely beautiful photo!  As a print, I''d like it better if the stars were cloned out, but I understand that they had to be left in for the challenge.  Thats just my opinion anyway, I''m sure many people liked the stars.', '2005-05-05 14:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363489, 173434, 35804, '<td valign="top">Black Angus I suppose? {{{giggles}}} A 10 for you... to negate the MANY 1''s you will get....and for being cheeky... {{{giggles}}}</td>', 'Black Angus I suppose? {{{giggles}}} A 10 for you... to negate the MANY 1''s you will get....and for being cheeky... {{{giggles}}}', '2005-05-05 14:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363493, 172484, 35804, '<td valign="top">I really love the vibrancy and movement in this picture, it has a really great energy about it, very nice.</td>', 'I really love the vibrancy and movement in this picture, it has a really great energy about it, very nice.', '2005-05-05 14:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363498, 172365, 35804, '<td valign="top">My absolute favorite skyline picture. I love how the foliage "frames" the city, the sky has a wonderful movement and softness to it, the warm tones are very appealing to me, very nice!</td>', 'My absolute favorite skyline picture. I love how the foliage "frames" the city, the sky has a wonderful movement and softness to it, the warm tones are very appealing to me, very nice!', '2005-05-05 15:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363499, 173632, 27789, '<td valign="top">i like the clouds, i''m just wondering if it would be better if your horizon line was a little higher</td>', 'i like the clouds, i''m just wondering if it would be better if your horizon line was a little higher', '2005-05-05 15:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363500, 173763, 32982, '<td valign="top">I like this AZRIELY <br/>Not only becouse its in ISRAEL good catch of the buildings<br/>i consider takeing it but was too lazy to dive there<br/>good job :-)</td>', 'I like this AZRIELY Not only becouse its in ISRAEL good catch of the buildingsi consider takeing it but was too lazy to dive theregood job :-)', '2005-05-05 15:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363501, 172139, 31211, '<td valign="top">Very nice image and subject. I only wish <br/>1- i could see the street''s name (mabye you could have tried a different angle)<br/>2- there was a little more space above the lamp, so i a little more of the wall.<br/>Neverthless, its a simple and pretty elegant shot, with right exposure. Good job 8</td>', 'Very nice image and subject. I only wish 1- i could see the street''s name (mabye you could have tried a different angle)2- there was a little more space above the lamp, so i a little more of the wall.Neverthless, its a simple and pretty elegant shot, with right exposure. Good job 8', '2005-05-05 15:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363505, 173781, 9089, '<td valign="top">If this doesn''t ribbon, I''m eating my hat.  Seriously, the best photo in the challenge in my humble opinion.  Location, reflections, symmetry, lights, perfect exposure, all add up to a blue ribbon.  Wish I was there.</td>', 'If this doesn''t ribbon, I''m eating my hat.  Seriously, the best photo in the challenge in my humble opinion.  Location, reflections, symmetry, lights, perfect exposure, all add up to a blue ribbon.  Wish I was there.', '2005-05-05 15:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363507, 173656, 34687, '<td valign="top">i hope you get maximum ones for this one.</td>', 'i hope you get maximum ones for this one.', '2005-05-05 15:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363508, 173894, 27789, '<td valign="top">i like the angle, would like to see it full of people but that probably wasn''t the point of the photograph, and it''s something out of your control anyway.</td>', 'i like the angle, would like to see it full of people but that probably wasn''t the point of the photograph, and it''s something out of your control anyway.', '2005-05-05 15:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363511, 172473, 9089, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing that''s the moon, and if it is, that is a fantastic shot.  I love the silhouette.  Good composition.  I would probably crop it below the clouds, as the distance that they are separated from the main subject causes them to distract the attention away from the ship and moon which are the focus of the picture.  Moon reflection on the water really adds to the picture.  Great shot, 9 from me.</td>', 'I''m guessing that''s the moon, and if it is, that is a fantastic shot.  I love the silhouette.  Good composition.  I would probably crop it below the clouds, as the distance that they are separated from the main subject causes them to distract the attention away from the ship and moon which are the focus of the picture.  Moon reflection on the water really adds to the picture.  Great shot, 9 from me.', '2005-05-05 15:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363512, 173159, 32982, '<td valign="top">Use A tripod nect time u''ll see the diffrence :-) could have been reall good one</td>', 'Use A tripod nect time u''ll see the diffrence :-) could have been reall good one', '2005-05-05 15:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363513, 173597, 9089, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  I''m guessing some kind of lights to illuminate the rocks up front, and being a basic challenge, I''m not going to detract from the really bad blue hot pixel on the rock in front.  Does seem to be a bit grainy in the sky and dark shadow of the mountain.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  I''m guessing some kind of lights to illuminate the rocks up front, and being a basic challenge, I''m not going to detract from the really bad blue hot pixel on the rock in front.  Does seem to be a bit grainy in the sky and dark shadow of the mountain.', '2005-05-05 15:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363517, 171909, 33435, '<td valign="top">interesting dark on dark shot</td>', 'interesting dark on dark shot', '2005-05-05 15:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363518, 173646, 34687, '<td valign="top">DUDE .RED EYE REDUCTION..please spare us...please!!!</td>', 'DUDE .RED EYE REDUCTION..please spare us...please!!!', '2005-05-05 15:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363520, 172385, 32982, '<td valign="top">wow how did u do it? they are so sharp and the lights blurd.<br/>good job</td>', 'wow how did u do it? they are so sharp and the lights blurd.good job', '2005-05-05 15:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363523, 173296, 31211, '<td valign="top">Very nice subject and a pretty good shot, overall. I have only 2 things to point out: i would have like to see a bit more of the sky, enabling me to see the whole monument, and a bit less of the foreground; <br/>and that light near the door is completely blown out, which is a turn off... I dont know how you could have got rid of it, once the rest of the image has just the right ilumination/exposure.<br/>Good job, anyway.</td>', 'Very nice subject and a pretty good shot, overall. I have only 2 things to point out: i would have like to see a bit more of the sky, enabling me to see the whole monument, and a bit less of the foreground; and that light near the door is completely blown out, which is a turn off... I dont know how you could have got rid of it, once the rest of the image has just the right ilumination/exposure.Good job, anyway.', '2005-05-05 15:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363525, 172431, 33435, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see a brightness-2/contrast +4 to +6, may make this beautiful image a little sharper.  nice photo.</td>', 'I''d like to see a brightness-2/contrast +4 to +6, may make this beautiful image a little sharper.  nice photo.', '2005-05-05 15:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363527, 173916, 33435, '<td valign="top">You need to work on re-sizing your photo.  There is plenty of help in the forums.</td>', 'You need to work on re-sizing your photo.  There is plenty of help in the forums.', '2005-05-05 15:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363529, 173146, 33435, '<td valign="top">so sharp, so silky.  I love this.</td>', 'so sharp, so silky.  I love this.', '2005-05-05 15:16:08.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1363531, 173745, 19978, '<td valign="top">Outstanding conceptual accomplishment. I applaud you for your vision. The technical details, however, are somewhat deficient. It''s very low contrast, especially on the right, and I think you could have gone for a tighter crop. The impact of your subject is diminished somewhat by the composition, and may have been stronger with a more centered approach. Love the border though.</td>', 'Outstanding conceptual accomplishment. I applaud you for your vision. The technical details, however, are somewhat deficient. It''s very low contrast, especially on the right, and I think you could have gone for a tighter crop. The impact of your subject is diminished somewhat by the composition, and may have been stronger with a more centered approach. Love the border though.', '2005-05-05 15:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363532, 172809, 35804, '<td valign="top">Not sure how the voting and commenting are going for this picture, but I really like. I usually don''t like picture "tilt" but it works for me here because there is no horizon....anyway...enough with the technical junk...This picture requires a bit of the viewer, a little imagination. When I look at this picture I see a beautiful piece of burgundy velvet illuminated by a lovely soft...warm...light source. I know it''s headlight and tail light reflections on water, the title tells me that, but I enjoy creating a "story" in my mind... an exquiste dress made of rich delicious velvet and a late night out...or perhaps they are theater curtains...?etc., etc.... Hope I''m making some sort of sense. ( and not boring you to death )This is just one of those pictures that gets my imagination spinning...cool.</td>', 'Not sure how the voting and commenting are going for this picture, but I really like. I usually don''t like picture "tilt" but it works for me here because there is no horizon....anyway...enough with the technical junk...This picture requires a bit of the viewer, a little imagination. When I look at this picture I see a beautiful piece of burgundy velvet illuminated by a lovely soft...warm...light source. I know it''s headlight and tail light reflections on water, the title tells me that, but I enjoy creating a "story" in my mind... an exquiste dress made of rich delicious velvet and a late night out...or perhaps they are theater curtains...?etc., etc.... Hope I''m making some sort of sense. ( and not boring you to death )This is just one of those pictures that gets my imagination spinning...cool.', '2005-05-05 15:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363534, 173645, 30208, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting.</td>', 'I like the lighting.', '2005-05-05 15:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363535, 172139, 32161, '<td valign="top">Nice and original. Great setting, must surely run adjacent to Baker Street....wheres Sherlock?</td>', 'Nice and original. Great setting, must surely run adjacent to Baker Street....wheres Sherlock?', '2005-05-05 15:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363536, 173430, 33435, '<td valign="top">This shot is great on so many levels.  Excellent capture of the Kimmel also.  Good use of corner cropping too.</td>', 'This shot is great on so many levels.  Excellent capture of the Kimmel also.  Good use of corner cropping too.', '2005-05-05 15:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363537, 171909, 31211, '<td valign="top">I think you have an amazing picture, very well composed, and with a nice subject. The only problem is that it is too dark... (thats how I see it). A higher exposure and maybe more constrast would have bumped this to a 9 or 10. Good job, anyway.</td>', 'I think you have an amazing picture, very well composed, and with a nice subject. The only problem is that it is too dark... (thats how I see it). A higher exposure and maybe more constrast would have bumped this to a 9 or 10. Good job, anyway.', '2005-05-05 15:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363538, 173217, 33435, '<td valign="top">The contrast could stand to be improved, but the picture is nice.</td>', 'The contrast could stand to be improved, but the picture is nice.', '2005-05-05 15:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363539, 173897, 30392, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors, shame it''s tilted to the left, that could have been easily fixed...</td>', 'Lovely colors, shame it''s tilted to the left, that could have been easily fixed...', '2005-05-05 15:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363548, 173745, 25752, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but there seems to be nothing there...</td>', 'I''m sorry, but there seems to be nothing there...', '2005-05-05 15:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363551, 173045, 31211, '<td valign="top">Why didnt you submit a larger image, when you can go up to 640 px?<br/>It seems to me you have a pretty nice shot, which could score a lot higher if it were a bit larger. Nice job, anyway. Like the lighting and the water flow.</td>', 'Why didnt you submit a larger image, when you can go up to 640 px?It seems to me you have a pretty nice shot, which could score a lot higher if it were a bit larger. Nice job, anyway. Like the lighting and the water flow.', '2005-05-05 15:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363552, 173434, 25752, '<td valign="top">Moooooved out of the shot perhaps? I''m sorry, but I can''t see anything.</td>', 'Moooooved out of the shot perhaps? I''m sorry, but I can''t see anything.', '2005-05-05 15:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363553, 173737, 32982, '<td valign="top">it is too brghit</td>', 'it is too brghit', '2005-05-05 15:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1363557, 171919, 25752, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but blurry.</td>', 'Interesting idea, but blurry.', '2005-05-05 15:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
