(1364087, 173921, 35169, '<td valign="top">Closer cropping would solve many of my issues with this image, light on left bottom and maybe its a bush on the right.  The top of the tree could use a little more light or exposure.  A very good effort,  some obstackles are very hard to overcome.</td>', 'Closer cropping would solve many of my issues with this image, light on left bottom and maybe its a bush on the right.  The top of the tree could use a little more light or exposure.  A very good effort,  some obstackles are very hard to overcome.', '2005-05-05 17:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
