(1364190, 171682, 35169, '<td valign="top">The right side of this photo adds nothing to the rest of the image which is interesting with unusual lighting.  The image (IMO) would be stronger cropped square, cutting it off right behind the foremost car.  Often the obstackles to a good photo are difficult to overcome,  such as flood lights, which you dramatized by the added sharpening.  I like it on the building, not on the lights or the cars.  A couple steps difference in angle (if possible) would have made a huge difference.</td>', 'The right side of this photo adds nothing to the rest of the image which is interesting with unusual lighting.  The image (IMO) would be stronger cropped square, cutting it off right behind the foremost car.  Often the obstackles to a good photo are difficult to overcome,  such as flood lights, which you dramatized by the added sharpening.  I like it on the building, not on the lights or the cars.  A couple steps difference in angle (if possible) would have made a huge difference.', '2005-05-05 18:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
