(1364647, 173656, 35513, '<td valign="top">This image is very pixelated.  I''m not sure if that''s a post processing effect or just due to the camera.  The colors in the photo are good, but I would have liked to see the detail of the shot more clearly.  Good positioning of the subject, and the colors of the flame really tie the shot together.</td>', 'This image is very pixelated.  I''m not sure if that''s a post processing effect or just due to the camera.  The colors in the photo are good, but I would have liked to see the detail of the shot more clearly.  Good positioning of the subject, and the colors of the flame really tie the shot together.', '2005-05-05 21:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1364649, 173494, 35513, '<td valign="top">This shot is a little too hazy for my own tastes.  I like how the trees on either side frame the picture, and I like the sky between, though I''m not sure why it''s reddish-orange.</td>', 'This shot is a little too hazy for my own tastes.  I like how the trees on either side frame the picture, and I like the sky between, though I''m not sure why it''s reddish-orange.', '2005-05-05 21:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
