(1364651, 173913, 35513, '<td valign="top">The subject of this photo is well centered, and I like the grass in front of the frog.  The lighting is very strong directly on the frog...not sure if you were using flashlight or just a flash, but it''s very bright.  The image also seems slightly blurry.</td>', 'The subject of this photo is well centered, and I like the grass in front of the frog.  The lighting is very strong directly on the frog...not sure if you were using flashlight or just a flash, but it''s very bright.  The image also seems slightly blurry.', '2005-05-05 21:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
