(1364658, 173287, 35513, '<td valign="top">Good capture of the fireworks!  Not sure if there''s anything that can be done about it, but there are parts of the sky (where the trees are) which are blacker than the rest.  If it were solid black I think you''d have a nice abstract shot.</td>', 'Good capture of the fireworks!  Not sure if there''s anything that can be done about it, but there are parts of the sky (where the trees are) which are blacker than the rest.  If it were solid black I think you''d have a nice abstract shot.', '2005-05-05 21:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1364661, 173734, 36956, '<td valign="top">the only thing that offsets me a little is the blurriness of the first lamp... the pathway looks great, and the tree in the background is a major plus, sometimes nothing can be done about a little blurr, i have that problem too... haha, nice shot</td>', 'the only thing that offsets me a little is the blurriness of the first lamp... the pathway looks great, and the tree in the background is a major plus, sometimes nothing can be done about a little blurr, i have that problem too... haha, nice shot', '2005-05-05 21:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1364663, 173599, 35513, '<td valign="top">To be honest, I find the effect used on this photo somewhat distracting.  But I do like the subject and it''s placement to the moon.  It''s reminiscent of Van Gohg.  But I think that for my own tastes I would have enjoyed seeing something less abstract.</td>', 'To be honest, I find the effect used on this photo somewhat distracting.  But I do like the subject and it''s placement to the moon.  It''s reminiscent of Van Gohg.  But I think that for my own tastes I would have enjoyed seeing something less abstract.', '2005-05-05 21:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1364664, 173714, 36956, '<td valign="top">omg, amazing! did you set a long shutter speed and focus on the north star? the tree and house stayed the same over the exposure and the stars moved? if so that is amazing, absolutely stunning? the tree isnt even blurry, must have been no wind, great shot, amazing idea, 10</td>', 'omg, amazing! did you set a long shutter speed and focus on the north star? the tree and house stayed the same over the exposure and the stars moved? if so that is amazing, absolutely stunning? the tree isnt even blurry, must have been no wind, great shot, amazing idea, 10', '2005-05-05 21:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1364667, 173105, 35513, '<td valign="top">Interesting view!  Definitely a late night shot.  And one that many people wouldn''t have thought of :-)</td>', 'Interesting view!  Definitely a late night shot.  And one that many people wouldn''t have thought of :-)', '2005-05-05 21:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
