(1364670, 173409, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very hard to capture this kind of shot!  I''m not sure if it''s just the clouds or something with the camera, but there are portions of the photo which look grainy.  Other than that, nice job.</td>', 'Very hard to capture this kind of shot!  I''m not sure if it''s just the clouds or something with the camera, but there are portions of the photo which look grainy.  Other than that, nice job.', '2005-05-05 21:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
