(1364811, 173146, 22748, '<td valign="top">Stunning. The lighting is great, and the reflections of the light on the water are beautiful. There''s a little noise in the sky that bugs me, and it feels like the horizon is off by a few degrees. Still, this is a very nice image.</td>', 'Stunning. The lighting is great, and the reflections of the light on the water are beautiful. There''s a little noise in the sky that bugs me, and it feels like the horizon is off by a few degrees. Still, this is a very nice image.', '2005-05-05 22:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1364813, 173779, 32108, '<td valign="top">great shot</td>', 'great shot', '2005-05-05 22:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1364819, 172407, 22748, '<td valign="top">Great idea, I like the shot a lot, except that it''s really got a lot of CCD noise and it feels like it needs more "pop", maybe a curves boost. Not too hot on the border. I''m giving it a good score because of the creativity, action, and sense of movement I get from it.</td>', 'Great idea, I like the shot a lot, except that it''s really got a lot of CCD noise and it feels like it needs more "pop", maybe a curves boost. Not too hot on the border. I''m giving it a good score because of the creativity, action, and sense of movement I get from it.', '2005-05-05 22:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1364822, 173732, 22748, '<td valign="top">Late night? Really?!</td>', 'Late night? Really?!', '2005-05-05 22:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1364825, 173873, 22748, '<td valign="top">A little too much CCD noise. Well balanced composition though, these centered shots are hard to get right. Points for that.</td>', 'A little too much CCD noise. Well balanced composition though, these centered shots are hard to get right. Points for that.', '2005-05-05 22:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1364830, 172322, 22748, '<td valign="top">Original. The stark contrast between the luminous-looking flowers and the pitch black background is bold and artistic. Some people will probably say "the lilies are overexposed!" but I think it''s the perfect exposure to get the luminous effect, if that''s what you''re going for.</td>', 'Original. The stark contrast between the luminous-looking flowers and the pitch black background is bold and artistic. Some people will probably say "the lilies are overexposed!" but I think it''s the perfect exposure to get the luminous effect, if that''s what you''re going for.', '2005-05-05 22:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1364835, 173374, 22748, '<td valign="top">Incredible! The sky is gorgeous. The city lights are beautiful, and the still water and reflections are stunning. I like the boat too, it adds another subject and shows its own pretty reflection. The only problem I see is all the hot pixels. There seem to be a lot of them. The border is tasteful. This is one of the best, even with the hot pixels.</td>', 'Incredible! The sky is gorgeous. The city lights are beautiful, and the still water and reflections are stunning. I like the boat too, it adds another subject and shows its own pretty reflection. The only problem I see is all the hot pixels. There seem to be a lot of them. The border is tasteful. This is one of the best, even with the hot pixels.', '2005-05-05 22:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1364840, 173400, 22748, '<td valign="top">Artistic. Nice textures in the clouds. Only thing I would suggest is that lining the top of the fence up with the horizon would make it feel more balanced.</td>', 'Artistic. Nice textures in the clouds. Only thing I would suggest is that lining the top of the fence up with the horizon would make it feel more balanced.', '2005-05-05 22:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1364843, 173830, 22748, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. I''ve seen this shot many times in photography books, it''s a classic night shot, but you did a good job with it here.</td>', 'Very pretty. I''ve seen this shot many times in photography books, it''s a classic night shot, but you did a good job with it here.', '2005-05-05 22:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1364844, 171911, 32754, '<td valign="top">I think you needed to make this picture larger to appreciate it.</td>', 'I think you needed to make this picture larger to appreciate it.', '2005-05-05 22:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1364847, 172316, 22748, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!! One of the best. What city is this? The detail and sharpness is awesome. The simple sky and empty water really let the city drive the image. Top ten!!</td>', 'Gorgeous!! One of the best. What city is this? The detail and sharpness is awesome. The simple sky and empty water really let the city drive the image. Top ten!!', '2005-05-05 22:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1364850, 173219, 22748, '<td valign="top">Well done. A pretty night shot. I like the falloff of light at the very bottom and very top edges.</td>', 'Well done. A pretty night shot. I like the falloff of light at the very bottom and very top edges.', '2005-05-05 22:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1364852, 173307, 22748, '<td valign="top">Kind of cool how you let the image border be part of the image itself. :)</td>', 'Kind of cool how you let the image border be part of the image itself. :)', '2005-05-05 22:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1364856, 172546, 22748, '<td valign="top">I like this shot. Only thing I would change is to have a little warmer, more indirect lighting on the foreground. It looks like on-camera flash was used, and it really makes things look flat and blah there. With a little more natural looking lighting this could be a winner.</td>', 'I like this shot. Only thing I would change is to have a little warmer, more indirect lighting on the foreground. It looks like on-camera flash was used, and it really makes things look flat and blah there. With a little more natural looking lighting this could be a winner.', '2005-05-05 22:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1364858, 173419, 22748, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous sky, nice reflections. A little too much noise though.</td>', 'Gorgeous sky, nice reflections. A little too much noise though.', '2005-05-05 22:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1364859, 173860, 22748, '<td valign="top">Oooh! Sparkles!! Very nice. I love how the smoke is spewing out into the sky, blurred by the long exposure.</td>', 'Oooh! Sparkles!! Very nice. I love how the smoke is spewing out into the sky, blurred by the long exposure.', '2005-05-05 22:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1364861, 172714, 22748, '<td valign="top">Wow, is the bridge really that color? Nice shot. The sky is well exposed as is the rest of the image. The foreground looks a little too orange, maybe a little WB tweaking would help.</td>', 'Wow, is the bridge really that color? Nice shot. The sky is well exposed as is the rest of the image. The foreground looks a little too orange, maybe a little WB tweaking would help.', '2005-05-05 22:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1364865, 173771, 22748, '<td valign="top">Awesome! I really like this one. The border is nice too, not too bold or bright, just enough.</td>', 'Awesome! I really like this one. The border is nice too, not too bold or bright, just enough.', '2005-05-05 22:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1364870, 172139, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nice. Interesting subject, good composition. I likey.</td>', 'Nice. Interesting subject, good composition. I likey.', '2005-05-05 22:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1364871, 173894, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nicely exposed. The light sources are blown out, but it''s ok, it makes them look luminous. The CCD noise level isn''t too bad either, it''s a pretty smooth image.</td>', 'Nicely exposed. The light sources are blown out, but it''s ok, it makes them look luminous. The CCD noise level isn''t too bad either, it''s a pretty smooth image.', '2005-05-05 22:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1364874, 172610, 22748, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous! Dreamy, artistic, simple. It feels like something from a midnight dream.</td>', 'Gorgeous! Dreamy, artistic, simple. It feels like something from a midnight dream.', '2005-05-05 22:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1364878, 173509, 22748, '<td valign="top">Cool effect. I like the bright colors. Good abstract with shapes and colors.</td>', 'Cool effect. I like the bright colors. Good abstract with shapes and colors.', '2005-05-05 22:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1364884, 171682, 22748, '<td valign="top">I love the courthouse, but to be honest, the cars detract from the image a bit. They distract from the subject, I guess, and don''t fit in with the ornate stone theme. Also there''s quite a bit of noise in the sky. But I really like the courthouse, did I say that? ;)</td>', 'I love the courthouse, but to be honest, the cars detract from the image a bit. They distract from the subject, I guess, and don''t fit in with the ornate stone theme. Also there''s quite a bit of noise in the sky. But I really like the courthouse, did I say that? ;)', '2005-05-05 22:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1364933, 173155, 36762, '<td valign="top">great shot</td>', 'great shot', '2005-05-05 23:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1364953, 173045, 35382, '<td valign="top">picture to small</td>', 'picture to small', '2005-05-05 23:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1364954, 172486, 8367, '<td valign="top">Nice tones and exposure. I can''t help but wish for a different view. The crane and dark portion in the lower left corner doesn''t help the composition in my opinion. Just leaving the dock and lights would be awesome. 6</td>', 'Nice tones and exposure. I can''t help but wish for a different view. The crane and dark portion in the lower left corner doesn''t help the composition in my opinion. Just leaving the dock and lights would be awesome. 6', '2005-05-05 23:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
