(1364995, 172322, 29904, '<td valign="top">Nice, again.  Again, over exposed, or rather turn down the contrast some.  the centers of the flowers are too hot and lacking detail.   Beautiful forms and placement. 7</td>', 'Nice, again.  Again, over exposed, or rather turn down the contrast some.  the centers of the flowers are too hot and lacking detail.   Beautiful forms and placement. 7', '2005-05-05 23:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
