(1365043, 173921, 29904, '<td valign="top">Needs a little better focus and the light on the lower left is distracting.  Perhaps a tighter crop would help?  Otherwise nice color and dof.</td>', 'Needs a little better focus and the light on the lower left is distracting.  Perhaps a tighter crop would help?  Otherwise nice color and dof.', '2005-05-05 23:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
