(1365109, 173371, 33947, '<td valign="top">The open gate makes this shot really intriguing, and the warm highlights on the gate are extremely nice. Good mood shot. It''s got a little "haunted mansion" about it. Very sharp</td>', 'The open gate makes this shot really intriguing, and the warm highlights on the gate are extremely nice. Good mood shot. It''s got a little "haunted mansion" about it. Very sharp', '2005-05-05 23:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
