(1367672, 173910, 22748, '<td valign="top">I like the framing of the scene with the foliage.  I don''t know what the title means though. Nice reflections on the water.</td>', 'I like the framing of the scene with the foliage.  I don''t know what the title means though. Nice reflections on the water.', '2005-05-06 16:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
