(1368679, 172316, 5286, '<td valign="top">The detail and sharpness in this picture are just amazing. And the darkness and colors make it one of the most ''late'' night pictures in this challenge... I hope you do really well with this. 10.</td>', 'The detail and sharpness in this picture are just amazing. And the darkness and colors make it one of the most ''late'' night pictures in this challenge... I hope you do really well with this. 10.', '2005-05-07 02:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
