(1369798, 173911, 26466, '<td valign="top">Fails to be interesting. My eye is led to the tree at the center of the picture, but I can''t help to wonder why I should be looking at that.</td>', 'Fails to be interesting. My eye is led to the tree at the center of the picture, but I can''t help to wonder why I should be looking at that.', '2005-05-07 15:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369800, 173922, 26466, '<td valign="top">Nice picture. I would have tried getting closer for a more dramatic angle. I don''t think it''s necessary or that interesting to get the whole building in frame.</td>', 'Nice picture. I would have tried getting closer for a more dramatic angle. I don''t think it''s necessary or that interesting to get the whole building in frame.', '2005-05-07 15:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
