(1369816, 173859, 26466, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors, but the compositon isn''t interesting, and the fact that the image is slightly tilted to the left bothers me a little bit when I''m looking at it. The tilting can be easily fixed in post, of course. But I think if I had taken the picture I would have tried to position myself closer (not trying to capture the whole fountain) and get some of the tallest buildings filling up the background. I think that would make the picture more dramatic.<br/>That being said, I should admit that I don''t know if the terrain would allow me to do that, since it''s so dark and can''t really tell what the geography is like, so these are only suggestions.</td>', 'I really like the colors, but the compositon isn''t interesting, and the fact that the image is slightly tilted to the left bothers me a little bit when I''m looking at it. The tilting can be easily fixed in post, of course. But I think if I had taken the picture I would have tried to position myself closer (not trying to capture the whole fountain) and get some of the tallest buildings filling up the background. I think that would make the picture more dramatic.That being said, I should admit that I don''t know if the terrain would allow me to do that, since it''s so dark and can''t really tell what the geography is like, so these are only suggestions.', '2005-05-07 15:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369817, 173669, 26466, '<td valign="top">Interesting and moody, but I''m not sure what''s meant to be achieved by the motion blurred faces.</td>', 'Interesting and moody, but I''m not sure what''s meant to be achieved by the motion blurred faces.', '2005-05-07 15:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369823, 173511, 26466, '<td valign="top">Really rendering of the light, but strange composition. Lots of dead space at the top. I feel like it could be improved by cropping.</td>', 'Really rendering of the light, but strange composition. Lots of dead space at the top. I feel like it could be improved by cropping.', '2005-05-07 15:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
