(1369834, 173439, 26466, '<td valign="top">I really like it. Although I think it could have been improved by positioning the camera so that the street traced more of a diagonal from corner to corner. That in my opinion would make for a more interesting journey for the eye along the leading lines of the images.</td>', 'I really like it. Although I think it could have been improved by positioning the camera so that the street traced more of a diagonal from corner to corner. That in my opinion would make for a more interesting journey for the eye along the leading lines of the images.', '2005-05-07 15:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1369840, 172076, 26466, '<td valign="top">Cool, but it would have been more interesting if a darker background had been achieved by waiting until a later time or by setting the exposure time lower.</td>', 'Cool, but it would have been more interesting if a darker background had been achieved by waiting until a later time or by setting the exposure time lower.', '2005-05-07 15:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
