(1370141, 173090, 28882, '<td valign="top">how did you do that?   It seems that the outside lights traveled quite a bit and therefore indicates a long exposure but your interior dash lights seem pretty clear to be in a moving vehicle for a long exposure.  hmm,  I''d be interested to see your notes on this one.  Nice. shot.</td>', 'how did you do that?   It seems that the outside lights traveled quite a bit and therefore indicates a long exposure but your interior dash lights seem pretty clear to be in a moving vehicle for a long exposure.  hmm,  I''d be interested to see your notes on this one.  Nice. shot.', '2005-05-07 19:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
