(1370575, 173090, 36762, '<td valign="top">interesting shot. I like the effects you get with the lights. It makes you feel like you are in the car.</td>', 'interesting shot. I like the effects you get with the lights. It makes you feel like you are in the car.', '2005-05-08 00:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
