(1370602, 172367, 36914, '<td valign="top">Nice vivid color could be a little more centered.  Perhaps centered  on the butterfly,<br/>bringing in the yellow flower on the right into the picture and cropping out the top yellow light.  Still very vivid colors nicely focused. <br/></td>', 'Nice vivid color could be a little more centered.  Perhaps centered  on the butterfly,bringing in the yellow flower on the right into the picture and cropping out the top yellow light.  Still very vivid colors nicely focused. ', '2005-05-08 01:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
