(1370796, 173638, 29269, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. Things that could have made it better for me:<br/>- the backlight has green hue, and creates some overly hot areas at the model''s hair ends.<br/>- there are two lines across the model thighs/shins, that should have been cloned out.<br/>- there is a branch with some leaves at the right edge of the photo about 40% from the top which steals attention, that could have been cloned as well.<br/> <br/>Otherwise, probably a top-50 photo. 6.</td>', 'Nice photo. Things that could have made it better for me:- the backlight has green hue, and creates some overly hot areas at the model''s hair ends.- there are two lines across the model thighs/shins, that should have been cloned out.- there is a branch with some leaves at the right edge of the photo about 40% from the top which steals attention, that could have been cloned as well. Otherwise, probably a top-50 photo. 6.', '2005-05-08 03:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370813, 173916, 29566, '<td valign="top">What a great potential this photo has... Too bad it''s so small. I guess it''s either a crop from a much bigger photo, too bad.</td>', 'What a great potential this photo has... Too bad it''s so small. I guess it''s either a crop from a much bigger photo, too bad.', '2005-05-08 04:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370869, 172606, 27845, '<td valign="top">I''d have included a bit more of the ground and less of the sky. Looks interesting, I like the houses in the background. 6.</td>', 'I''d have included a bit more of the ground and less of the sky. Looks interesting, I like the houses in the background. 6.', '2005-05-08 07:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370871, 173852, 27845, '<td valign="top">Hey, that face really pops out! I like the colours and the movement in your shot. There seems to be a problem with the focus on the trafiic lights. That''s strange, because the spikes actually suggest that you used a high aperture.<br/>I don''t like the small glowing tower-thing in the upper right hand corner. It''s not connected to the rest of the image and distracts from the interesting areas. 7.</td>', 'Hey, that face really pops out! I like the colours and the movement in your shot. There seems to be a problem with the focus on the trafiic lights. That''s strange, because the spikes actually suggest that you used a high aperture.I don''t like the small glowing tower-thing in the upper right hand corner. It''s not connected to the rest of the image and distracts from the interesting areas. 7.', '2005-05-08 07:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370872, 172484, 27845, '<td valign="top">Lovely. You did well with the lighting conditions, the car is neat and sharp and still has that nice motion blur and  the light trails. Looks a bt overexposed in some areas, your picture could be darker overall. 9.</td>', 'Lovely. You did well with the lighting conditions, the car is neat and sharp and still has that nice motion blur and  the light trails. Looks a bt overexposed in some areas, your picture could be darker overall. 9.', '2005-05-08 07:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370874, 173455, 27845, '<td valign="top">You have a focus problem here. Let your camera focus as long as your subject is well lit, with a flashlight for example, then switch your light source off and shoot. Some more text in the diary would have been nice. Showing a person writing in the diary would have been even better. 4.</td>', 'You have a focus problem here. Let your camera focus as long as your subject is well lit, with a flashlight for example, then switch your light source off and shoot. Some more text in the diary would have been nice. Showing a person writing in the diary would have been even better. 4.', '2005-05-08 07:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370875, 173284, 27845, '<td valign="top">That''s a nice place to be. I like the people, some of them stand out clearly, others are blurred. Nice mixture.<br/>Your picture came out a bit too bright. Use levels to get rid of the washed-out colours. You also have a tilt in your image. If it was intentional, then I don''t really see how it adds to the image. If not, just rotate it in your graphics software. 6.</td>', 'That''s a nice place to be. I like the people, some of them stand out clearly, others are blurred. Nice mixture.Your picture came out a bit too bright. Use levels to get rid of the washed-out colours. You also have a tilt in your image. If it was intentional, then I don''t really see how it adds to the image. If not, just rotate it in your graphics software. 6.', '2005-05-08 07:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1370876, 171678, 27845, '<td valign="top">Interesting approach to the challenge. If you want to enhance the quality of your shot, you should use levels or contrast to make the black parts darker. They looks a bit washed out. 5.</td>', 'Interesting approach to the challenge. If you want to enhance the quality of your shot, you should use levels or contrast to make the black parts darker. They looks a bit washed out. 5.', '2005-05-08 07:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
