(1371921, 173597, 36528, '<td valign="top">Nice image. I feel the exposure on the rocks in the foreground is slightly too high in comparison to the background, but the mountains look great in moonlight. Well done. 7 (Í''m a hard marker!)</td>', 'Nice image. I feel the exposure on the rocks in the foreground is slightly too high in comparison to the background, but the mountains look great in moonlight. Well done. 7 (Í''m a hard marker!)', '2005-05-08 22:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
