(1371932, 173471, 22537, '<td valign="top">This is technically excellent.  Crisp and interesting.  The long exposure was a great choice and necessary of course.  Good luck!</td>', 'This is technically excellent.  Crisp and interesting.  The long exposure was a great choice and necessary of course.  Good luck!', '2005-05-08 22:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371933, 172486, 22537, '<td valign="top">This shot is like silk.  Beautiful lighting and overall composition.  Good luck!</td>', 'This shot is like silk.  Beautiful lighting and overall composition.  Good luck!', '2005-05-08 22:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371941, 173146, 36528, '<td valign="top">Ahh... My home Sydney! You get my vote on nostelgia alone! Can never see enough of the Opera House...</td>', 'Ahh... My home Sydney! You get my vote on nostelgia alone! Can never see enough of the Opera House...', '2005-05-08 22:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371985, 172473, 34373, '<td valign="top">i guess you''ve already had plenty of people comment on the fact that this is not a night shot, so I''ll just say that aside from that, this is a PHENOMENAL picture!  I love it!</td>', 'i guess you''ve already had plenty of people comment on the fact that this is not a night shot, so I''ll just say that aside from that, this is a PHENOMENAL picture!  I love it!', '2005-05-08 22:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1371990, 172182, 36528, '<td valign="top">I think that cropping the right hand portion of the frame would have enhanced this shot. A square format would also have helped I think. Overall a nice shot, good tones for the subject, and good exposure.</td>', 'I think that cropping the right hand portion of the frame would have enhanced this shot. A square format would also have helped I think. Overall a nice shot, good tones for the subject, and good exposure.', '2005-05-08 22:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1372003, 172318, 36528, '<td valign="top">Very classy... Well done. I like the colours and the tones - the tilt to the image gives good dynamic feel and I think it works for this image. 9</td>', 'Very classy... Well done. I like the colours and the tones - the tilt to the image gives good dynamic feel and I think it works for this image. 9', '2005-05-08 23:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1372007, 171911, 33725, '<td valign="top">//dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=196768<br/>//dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=88342<br/>//dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=26</td>', '//dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&FORUM_THREAD_ID=196768//dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&FORUM_THREAD_ID=88342//dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=26', '2005-05-08 23:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1372009, 173897, 36528, '<td valign="top">Great colours and good exposure. Given there is no sense of pattern I think it could have been enhanced by a clear subject. I know it was probably unavoidable, but I do find the bright light distracting in such a prominant postion in the frame - but nevertheless you have achieved a good result. Well done.</td>', 'Great colours and good exposure. Given there is no sense of pattern I think it could have been enhanced by a clear subject. I know it was probably unavoidable, but I do find the bright light distracting in such a prominant postion in the frame - but nevertheless you have achieved a good result. Well done.', '2005-05-08 23:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1372012, 173434, 30454, '<td valign="top">Is this a joke? I don''t see anything here???</td>', 'Is this a joke? I don''t see anything here???', '2005-05-08 23:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1372030, 173202, 34103, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done, great mood setting. An 8 score</td>', 'Very nicely done, great mood setting. An 8 score', '2005-05-08 23:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1372040, 173146, 34134, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Horizon is a bit tilted. Great exposure and sharpness. Love the water. <br/>Second pass: Bumping up.</td>', 'Very nice. Horizon is a bit tilted. Great exposure and sharpness. Love the water. Second pass: Bumping up.', '2005-05-08 23:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
