(1372510, 173349, 35513, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this shot a lot.  The lines of the bus terminal look really cool.  I wish it was perhaps a bit tighter crop on the person waiting for the bus so that she could be more clearly in focus...but that''s a minor gripe.  Nice shot!</td>', 'I like the composition of this shot a lot.  The lines of the bus terminal look really cool.  I wish it was perhaps a bit tighter crop on the person waiting for the bus so that she could be more clearly in focus...but that''s a minor gripe.  Nice shot!', '2005-05-09 03:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1372516, 173439, 35513, '<td valign="top">I like all of the dark in this shot.  The texture of the pavement is nice and the lighting leads the eye straight to the shillouette...it''s an almost Hitchcock kind of shot.  Very nicely done.</td>', 'I like all of the dark in this shot.  The texture of the pavement is nice and the lighting leads the eye straight to the shillouette...it''s an almost Hitchcock kind of shot.  Very nicely done.', '2005-05-09 03:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
