(1374638, 172385, 30861, '<td valign="top">Damn, that''s a stunnign shot, wildly original. At least to my eyes. I wonder how the others will vote it, I really do, but it gets a top-tier score from me, parking at 6 right now while I evaluate entire challenge. It will go up, I am sure, at least to an 8. Nice job!</td>', 'Damn, that''s a stunnign shot, wildly original. At least to my eyes. I wonder how the others will vote it, I really do, but it gets a top-tier score from me, parking at 6 right now while I evaluate entire challenge. It will go up, I am sure, at least to an 8. Nice job!', '2005-05-10 02:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374641, 173430, 30861, '<td valign="top">WOWZA... more comment later, parkign at 6 for now. Oof, got back to it. I was struggling with how well this very fine image fits into the "late night" aspect of the challenge. It''s my desire to reward people who managed to catch the "feeling" of late night. This does it for me, regardless. But I was an architectural photographer, so I wanted to be fair, not be biased towards it for that reaosn alone. But I keep getting that tsark, early-morning, sterile-light sense from it that I knwo so well. so you get the BUMP.</td>', 'WOWZA... more comment later, parkign at 6 for now. Oof, got back to it. I was struggling with how well this very fine image fits into the "late night" aspect of the challenge. It''s my desire to reward people who managed to catch the "feeling" of late night. This does it for me, regardless. But I was an architectural photographer, so I wanted to be fair, not be biased towards it for that reaosn alone. But I keep getting that tsark, early-morning, sterile-light sense from it that I knwo so well. so you get the BUMP.', '2005-05-10 02:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
