(1374829, 173373, 30018, '<td valign="top">Wow, I haven''t been there in 20 years, and it looks exactly the same.  I''ve got to get back to my ''Home Town''.  Nice image.  Love the colors.  &lt;6&gt;</td>', 'Wow, I haven''t been there in 20 years, and it looks exactly the same.  I''ve got to get back to my ''Home Town''.  Nice image.  Love the colors.  <6>', '2005-05-10 07:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374831, 173446, 30018, '<td valign="top">Very nice image...reminds me a lot of the Korean Monument in DC at night.  I took pictures of that last year, and they turned out very ghostly.  Extremely eerie.  This is a nice image as well.  The face looks as if it has no soul.  Empty.  Great image, one of my favorites in this challenge.  &lt;9&gt;</td>', 'Very nice image...reminds me a lot of the Korean Monument in DC at night.  I took pictures of that last year, and they turned out very ghostly.  Extremely eerie.  This is a nice image as well.  The face looks as if it has no soul.  Empty.  Great image, one of my favorites in this challenge.  <9>', '2005-05-10 07:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374832, 172697, 30018, '<td valign="top">This really isn''t looking like "Late Night" to me.</td>', 'This really isn''t looking like "Late Night" to me.', '2005-05-10 07:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374835, 172584, 30018, '<td valign="top">This is awesome!  Very nicely done, in very low light.  &lt;9&gt;</td>', 'This is awesome!  Very nicely done, in very low light.  <9>', '2005-05-10 07:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374836, 171884, 30018, '<td valign="top">Very pretty image, with wonderful colors and interesting lines throughout the image. &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'Very pretty image, with wonderful colors and interesting lines throughout the image. <8>', '2005-05-10 07:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374850, 172076, 27482, '<td valign="top">What an odd pattern in the wheel itself, close to the center.  Looks like some kind of morse code or something.  Anyway, not quite sure what it is but it blows this shot up to totally new dimensions and I gave it a 10, the only other 10 I gave in the challenge, excellent find.  If the pattern hadn´t been there it would just have been another "ferris wheel" shot and I would probably have given it a 6-7.  Good composition too and I like the slight movement of the people in front, I think you hit the spot here with exposure time.</td>', 'What an odd pattern in the wheel itself, close to the center.  Looks like some kind of morse code or something.  Anyway, not quite sure what it is but it blows this shot up to totally new dimensions and I gave it a 10, the only other 10 I gave in the challenge, excellent find.  If the pattern hadn´t been there it would just have been another "ferris wheel" shot and I would probably have given it a 6-7.  Good composition too and I like the slight movement of the people in front, I think you hit the spot here with exposure time.', '2005-05-10 08:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374880, 172559, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not a bad Idea but this image really needs some contrast boost, it seems severly flat.  Also, I can´t help but wonder if this hadn´t been more interesting in colour, those nighttime colours can be quite nice but that´s always just a personal taste so ignore me if you dissagree.  Anyway, the composition is pretty good and if you had increased the contrast somehow (curves for example) it could have been a good shot but as it is I find it quite mediocre and gave it a 5.</td>', 'Not a bad Idea but this image really needs some contrast boost, it seems severly flat.  Also, I can´t help but wonder if this hadn´t been more interesting in colour, those nighttime colours can be quite nice but that´s always just a personal taste so ignore me if you dissagree.  Anyway, the composition is pretty good and if you had increased the contrast somehow (curves for example) it could have been a good shot but as it is I find it quite mediocre and gave it a 5.', '2005-05-10 08:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374881, 173870, 33535, '<td valign="top">nice skyline.want to see more of the reflections in the water</td>', 'nice skyline.want to see more of the reflections in the water', '2005-05-10 08:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374882, 173756, 27482, '<td valign="top">Pretty good shot, love the clarity and sharpness and the colours and this could probably be in a commercial and it would make me want to buy that beer.  Still not brilliant though but I gave it an 8.</td>', 'Pretty good shot, love the clarity and sharpness and the colours and this could probably be in a commercial and it would make me want to buy that beer.  Still not brilliant though but I gave it an 8.', '2005-05-10 08:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374885, 171904, 33535, '<td valign="top">nice long exposure shot.would have cropped more on the right</td>', 'nice long exposure shot.would have cropped more on the right', '2005-05-10 08:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374888, 173295, 33535, '<td valign="top">looks like did not use a stativ</td>', 'looks like did not use a stativ', '2005-05-10 08:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
