(1375256, 172139, 15982, '<td valign="top">I like the repeating patterns here, howeverI think another point of view - like from the side of the building to give more leading lines would have made this a more intersting shot. The sign is blocked by the lamp and is distracting. The exposure is good, although it could have been sharpened and contrasty a little more to bring out the texture in the bricks and window frames better. My humble opinion... 5</td>', 'I like the repeating patterns here, howeverI think another point of view - like from the side of the building to give more leading lines would have made this a more intersting shot. The sign is blocked by the lamp and is distracting. The exposure is good, although it could have been sharpened and contrasty a little more to bring out the texture in the bricks and window frames better. My humble opinion... 5', '2005-05-10 11:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1375261, 172855, 27789, '<td valign="top">good reflection, wish i could see the entire reflection of the steeple in the water, or a lot less of it</td>', 'good reflection, wish i could see the entire reflection of the steeple in the water, or a lot less of it', '2005-05-10 11:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1375262, 172776, 27789, '<td valign="top">lovely tones, would be great if you could have done a little spot editing to control some of the highlights, also i''m wondering if cropping the left off a little wouldn''t have helped, i do really like the reflection in the water though</td>', 'lovely tones, would be great if you could have done a little spot editing to control some of the highlights, also i''m wondering if cropping the left off a little wouldn''t have helped, i do really like the reflection in the water though', '2005-05-10 11:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1375264, 173564, 15982, '<td valign="top">I would love to see this without the sign, but what an amazing picture! Great leading lines and interesting subject. The green tint is ok, but I think I may have liked this better as black and white - not sure though. Either way, wonderful picture! 8</td>', 'I would love to see this without the sign, but what an amazing picture! Great leading lines and interesting subject. The green tint is ok, but I think I may have liked this better as black and white - not sure though. Either way, wonderful picture! 8', '2005-05-10 11:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1375266, 173714, 27789, '<td valign="top">i really want to try this, just wondering if you could have gotten the sky a little blacker with levels or curves</td>', 'i really want to try this, just wondering if you could have gotten the sky a little blacker with levels or curves', '2005-05-10 11:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1375268, 172139, 27789, '<td valign="top">nice shot, so many in this challenge have trouble controlling lamp post light, but this one does a great job of not making it washed out.  i''m interested to see what you did in post to this one.</td>', 'nice shot, so many in this challenge have trouble controlling lamp post light, but this one does a great job of not making it washed out.  i''m interested to see what you did in post to this one.', '2005-05-10 11:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
