(1375310, 172182, 37382, '<td valign="top">I would have rated this higher had the angle of the skyline been straight - I find that the picture drops to the right which is distracting.  I like the colour and the mood of the subjects though.</td>', 'I would have rated this higher had the angle of the skyline been straight - I find that the picture drops to the right which is distracting.  I like the colour and the mood of the subjects though.', '2005-05-10 12:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1375312, 173226, 37149, '<td valign="top">The clarity of this image is very poor. I just feel like we are missing a lot of details. The light on the left and right sides are very blown out. Sorry but I just feel the execution of this photo is quite poor. Night photography is tough, keep trying!</td>', 'The clarity of this image is very poor. I just feel like we are missing a lot of details. The light on the left and right sides are very blown out. Sorry but I just feel the execution of this photo is quite poor. Night photography is tough, keep trying!', '2005-05-10 12:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
