(1375324, 171705, 15982, '<td valign="top">This would be so much better to look at if it was the full 640 pixels. I''m sure you are hearing about that enough though. But this is a wonderful picture in my opinion. I think the sky could have used a little bit of a curves or levels adjustment to make the color stand out a little more vividly, but other than that and size, it is a great picture and easy to look at. Good luck! 7</td>', 'This would be so much better to look at if it was the full 640 pixels. I''m sure you are hearing about that enough though. But this is a wonderful picture in my opinion. I think the sky could have used a little bit of a curves or levels adjustment to make the color stand out a little more vividly, but other than that and size, it is a great picture and easy to look at. Good luck! 7', '2005-05-10 12:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
