(1375402, 173226, 30817, '<td valign="top">Did you notice this is out of focus when you submitted it? It is also missing a visual platform or foundation to the photo.  While the subject is an impressive building, it seems to be floating in the frame.  Some kind of foreground silouhette, eg tree branch, high grass, even a person off to the side, would have given the shot depth and "place."</td>', 'Did you notice this is out of focus when you submitted it? It is also missing a visual platform or foundation to the photo.  While the subject is an impressive building, it seems to be floating in the frame.  Some kind of foreground silouhette, eg tree branch, high grass, even a person off to the side, would have given the shot depth and "place."', '2005-05-10 13:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1375409, 171919, 30817, '<td valign="top">Did you notice this is out of focus?  You probably rushed the shot so the subject would not get away.  But in rushing, you neglected a prime rule, make sure focus is where you want it.</td>', 'Did you notice this is out of focus?  You probably rushed the shot so the subject would not get away.  But in rushing, you neglected a prime rule, make sure focus is where you want it.', '2005-05-10 13:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
