(1375677, 173745, 27845, '<td valign="top">I think that big bulk of a man is really distracting from the main point of focus. Also, your image seems to be completely overexposed! The composition is good though, I''ve never seen such a harmonic balance in a picture.<br/>5 (for the idea).</td>', 'I think that big bulk of a man is really distracting from the main point of focus. Also, your image seems to be completely overexposed! The composition is good though, I''ve never seen such a harmonic balance in a picture.5 (for the idea).', '2005-05-10 15:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1375683, 173905, 33435, '<td valign="top">interesting.  this is a digital image?  I like the look, but it seems like this was a scanned photo print.  If not, and that was the look you were going for...good job.  Overall, I like the shot a lot.  When the challenge is done, you should airbrush some highlights into the lamp that isn''t on.  That may add perfection.</td>', 'interesting.  this is a digital image?  I like the look, but it seems like this was a scanned photo print.  If not, and that was the look you were going for...good job.  Overall, I like the shot a lot.  When the challenge is done, you should airbrush some highlights into the lamp that isn''t on.  That may add perfection.', '2005-05-10 15:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1375685, 173903, 27845, '<td valign="top">That border is horrible and ruins your otherwise excellent image for me. 8.</td>', 'That border is horrible and ruins your otherwise excellent image for me. 8.', '2005-05-10 15:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1375689, 172365, 33435, '<td valign="top">Isn''t is such a shame when you have the most beautiful cityscape, and you can''t get a clear shot because of some branches?  Unfortunately, they ruin what is an absolutely stunning background.</td>', 'Isn''t is such a shame when you have the most beautiful cityscape, and you can''t get a clear shot because of some branches?  Unfortunately, they ruin what is an absolutely stunning background.', '2005-05-10 15:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1375692, 173439, 27845, '<td valign="top">Very impressive. I wonder why you called it nuit américaine? There''s nothing here that would remind me of America. I think it''s abstract enough not to be bound to any specific place. 10.</td>', 'Very impressive. I wonder why you called it nuit américaine? There''s nothing here that would remind me of America. I think it''s abstract enough not to be bound to any specific place. 10.', '2005-05-10 15:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1375694, 172519, 33435, '<td valign="top">Definitely one of the most interesting shots in the challenge.  Great Job.</td>', 'Definitely one of the most interesting shots in the challenge.  Great Job.', '2005-05-10 15:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1375697, 173163, 33435, '<td valign="top">I don''t really get late night from this.</td>', 'I don''t really get late night from this.', '2005-05-10 15:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1375701, 173434, 33435, '<td valign="top">huh?</td>', 'huh?', '2005-05-10 15:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1375702, 172378, 33435, '<td valign="top">funny title, and good shot.  I think some contrast adjustments might bring out the color a bit more.</td>', 'funny title, and good shot.  I think some contrast adjustments might bring out the color a bit more.', '2005-05-10 15:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1375703, 173564, 29904, '<td valign="top">The lights on the bridge are really hot.  My guess is that you had your apperature wide open.  Closing is down and doing a longer exposure to compensate, would turn all light sources into star shapes.  You can get the simple six-pointed stars this way.  The sharper, more complex ones are from a filter. <br/>There is also a greenish tint I find unatractive.  Just MHO.  Hope that helps  :)</td>', 'The lights on the bridge are really hot.  My guess is that you had your apperature wide open.  Closing is down and doing a longer exposure to compensate, would turn all light sources into star shapes.  You can get the simple six-pointed stars this way.  The sharper, more complex ones are from a filter. There is also a greenish tint I find unatractive.  Just MHO.  Hope that helps  :)', '2005-05-10 15:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1375709, 172325, 33435, '<td valign="top">Good shot of Geno''s.  It makes me want some of their cheese fries.  Tell me the one tall guy that works there real late at night doesn''t remind you of Lurch from the Addam''s Family.</td>', 'Good shot of Geno''s.  It makes me want some of their cheese fries.  Tell me the one tall guy that works there real late at night doesn''t remind you of Lurch from the Addam''s Family.', '2005-05-10 15:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1375711, 173638, 37243, '<td valign="top">Nice pic but extra points for having such a nice subject</td>', 'Nice pic but extra points for having such a nice subject', '2005-05-10 15:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1375717, 173346, 25111, '<td valign="top">This is good. The black and white freshens up the old idea of a long exposured highway. I don''t like how the lightpost in the center is cut, but that''s only a minor flaw.</td>', 'This is good. The black and white freshens up the old idea of a long exposured highway. I don''t like how the lightpost in the center is cut, but that''s only a minor flaw.', '2005-05-10 15:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
