(1376483, 173786, 33736, '<td valign="top">This feels too harsh for the ageless look of the scene.  This should have looked as though it would be the perfect walkway for lovers.  However, the flare of the lights has removed all sense of romance.</td>', 'This feels too harsh for the ageless look of the scene.  This should have looked as though it would be the perfect walkway for lovers.  However, the flare of the lights has removed all sense of romance.', '2005-05-10 21:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
