(1376850, 173146, 34763, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to beat a good pic of the Opera House. Super job. I lived there while it was being built. Great to bring back good memories with such a beautiful photo.</td>', 'It''s hard to beat a good pic of the Opera House. Super job. I lived there while it was being built. Great to bring back good memories with such a beautiful photo.', '2005-05-11 01:07:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(1376851, 173090, 32041, '<td valign="top">I am sooo appreciative of all of the positive comments.  Thank you all very much for the feedback.  I can tell you that the competition, encouragement, resources and help on this site has helped me to start to take better pictues.<br/> <br/>Thank you.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-05-11 00:54:34.</i></td>', 'I am sooo appreciative of all of the positive comments.  Thank you all very much for the feedback.  I can tell you that the competition, encouragement, resources and help on this site has helped me to start to take better pictues. Thank you.', '2005-05-11 01:07:29.000000', '2005-05-11 01:54:34.000000', 0),
