(1376969, 173399, 15811, '<td valign="top">Don''t you just HATE those stupid banners they hang up?  I mean that is like a landmark for the city!<br/> <br/>CONGRATS!!!!!<br/> <br/>You captured the beauty of the bridge much more than myself.  Great shot, Alan!<br/> <br/>edit: and might I add -- quite a scary vantage point that late at night!!!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-05-11 00:26:20.</i></td>', 'Don''t you just HATE those stupid banners they hang up?  I mean that is like a landmark for the city! CONGRATS!!!!! You captured the beauty of the bridge much more than myself.  Great shot, Alan! edit: and might I add -- quite a scary vantage point that late at night!!!', '2005-05-11 01:25:33.000000', '2005-05-11 01:26:20.000000', 0),
