(1376983, 173746, 36604, '<td valign="top">Whee, an image that got nearly uniformly positive comments, and tanked. :)<br/> <br/>Oh well.  I knew this wasn''t the most compelling of my images, but I thought the wood texture and shadows, both off the lamp and off the leaves, would bring it up some.<br/> <br/>I had an alternate shot that emphasized the green shadows, but suffered from a few minor but visible technical flaws that I expected would get it hammered even worse, so I went with the cleaner, but less interesting shot.  I guess it wasn''t interesting enough.  I''ll try to write up a post-mortem a bit faster than my last one.</td>', 'Whee, an image that got nearly uniformly positive comments, and tanked. :) Oh well.  I knew this wasn''t the most compelling of my images, but I thought the wood texture and shadows, both off the lamp and off the leaves, would bring it up some. I had an alternate shot that emphasized the green shadows, but suffered from a few minor but visible technical flaws that I expected would get it hammered even worse, so I went with the cleaner, but less interesting shot.  I guess it wasn''t interesting enough.  I''ll try to write up a post-mortem a bit faster than my last one.', '2005-05-11 01:27:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(1376985, 173472, 12243, '<td valign="top">stunning! congrats</td>', 'stunning! congrats', '2005-05-11 01:27:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(1376990, 172610, 24976, '<td valign="top">congrats your first ribbon on your first challenge!<br/> <br/>now the hardest part is winning the second :-)<br/>wonderful image!</td>', 'congrats your first ribbon on your first challenge! now the hardest part is winning the second :-)wonderful image!', '2005-05-11 01:29:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(1376996, 173903, 8367, '<td valign="top">Great emotive capture. Nice work!</td>', 'Great emotive capture. Nice work!', '2005-05-11 01:31:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(1377002, 172385, 28742, '<td valign="top">Can''t wait to see you post the details of the setup! This was very well done. Congrats on a personal best!</td>', 'Can''t wait to see you post the details of the setup! This was very well done. Congrats on a personal best!', '2005-05-11 01:32:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(1377025, 173230, 36547, '<td valign="top">I realise the light source was a mistake - and it was in fact a candle and not a light bulb as many thought. The exposure of 8sec turned it into a mini sun.</td>', 'I realise the light source was a mistake - and it was in fact a candle and not a light bulb as many thought. The exposure of 8sec turned it into a mini sun.', '2005-05-11 01:37:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(1377033, 173860, 29269, '<td valign="top">This was one of my picks for a ribbon (9). Reading other comments, I hope they did not lower their score because they thought that you were using filters... I had a couple of long exposure outtakes with f/22 - f/32 and I know that you can get this effect without filters. Moreover, I haven''t seen star filters with 14 rays.<br/>This photo, other than being technically sound, also had a strong message, which is the reason I bumped it UP.<br/> <br/>Good luck in the future challenges.</td>', 'This was one of my picks for a ribbon (9). Reading other comments, I hope they did not lower their score because they thought that you were using filters... I had a couple of long exposure outtakes with f/22 - f/32 and I know that you can get this effect without filters. Moreover, I haven''t seen star filters with 14 rays.This photo, other than being technically sound, also had a strong message, which is the reason I bumped it UP. Good luck in the future challenges.', '2005-05-11 01:39:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(1377036, 173472, 23203, '<td valign="top">Congratulations! <br/>Both 2005 Goals (Ribbon, 7.0) achieved.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Congratulations! Both 2005 Goals (Ribbon, 7.0) achieved. ', '2005-05-11 01:40:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(1377044, 173399, 23203, '<td valign="top">Congratulations! I knew it was a winner!<br/></td>', 'Congratulations! I knew it was a winner!', '2005-05-11 01:42:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(1377049, 173399, 20249, '<td valign="top">Congratulation!!!  I love the colors and the details (sharpness) of the pic.</td>', 'Congratulation!!!  I love the colors and the details (sharpness) of the pic.', '2005-05-11 01:42:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(1377053, 171661, 20249, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for the comments and suggestions.  I have more shots of the memorial on my website.</td>', 'Thanks everyone for the comments and suggestions.  I have more shots of the memorial on my website.', '2005-05-11 01:44:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(1377059, 173400, 36604, '<td valign="top">This was one of my favorites of the challenge.  You''ll show up in my Underdogs list. :)<br/> <br/>My scoring:<br/> <br/>Base: 5 - Meets challenge<br/>Technical (-2 to +1): +0 - No significant flaws, but nothing spectacular, either<br/>Subject Interest (-1 to +2): +2 - Very nice colors on the clouds, and a nice sheen and color on the fence<br/>Emotion (+0 to +2): +2 - The haunting effect of being fenced away from beauty really struck at me.<br/>Personal (-1 to +1): +0 - No effect from personal bias.<br/> <br/>Additional notes:<br/> <br/>I think the effect would have been enhanced if the fence were pulled up to the upper third of the photo instead of the lower third to give a more complete feel of imprisonment, and I''d be interested to see a side-by-side comparison with a shot where the fence was defocused somewhat, to give the impression of staring past it at the moon.  The angle of the fence didn''t bother me, as it did some other commenters.<br/> <br/>Better luck next time.</td>', 'This was one of my favorites of the challenge.  You''ll show up in my Underdogs list. :) My scoring: Base: 5 - Meets challengeTechnical (-2 to +1): +0 - No significant flaws, but nothing spectacular, eitherSubject Interest (-1 to +2): +2 - Very nice colors on the clouds, and a nice sheen and color on the fenceEmotion (+0 to +2): +2 - The haunting effect of being fenced away from beauty really struck at me.Personal (-1 to +1): +0 - No effect from personal bias. Additional notes: I think the effect would have been enhanced if the fence were pulled up to the upper third of the photo instead of the lower third to give a more complete feel of imprisonment, and I''d be interested to see a side-by-side comparison with a shot where the fence was defocused somewhat, to give the impression of staring past it at the moon.  The angle of the fence didn''t bother me, as it did some other commenters. Better luck next time.', '2005-05-11 01:46:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(1377084, 172519, 19436, '<td valign="top">This should have gotten first. This one looks a lot better.<br/>You got robbed. Nice Work.</td>', 'This should have gotten first. This one looks a lot better.You got robbed. Nice Work.', '2005-05-11 01:52:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(1377088, 173917, 36604, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Zed Pobre:</b></div><hr/><i> Woody!  The only problem with using him in challenge shots is that you''re immediately identifiable. :)</i></td></tr></table> <br/>Or not...  looks like there''s more than one person taking Woody shots. :)<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by Zed Pobre: Woody!  The only problem with using him in challenge shots is that you''re immediately identifiable. :) Or not...  looks like there''s more than one person taking Woody shots. :)', '2005-05-11 01:54:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(1377119, 173648, 19708, '<td valign="top">Thanks all.<br/>The comments &amp; favs are what made it for me, as well as the 27th placing<br/>in a challenge so heavily dominated by all the "good" hardware.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-05-12 00:55:24.</i></td>', 'Thanks all.The comments & favs are what made it for me, as well as the 27th placingin a challenge so heavily dominated by all the "good" hardware.', '2005-05-11 02:03:11.000000', '2005-05-12 01:55:24.000000', 0),
