(1377147, 173634, 93, '<td valign="top">wow, nice shot!  I didn''t vote on this challenge, but I might have helped your score out if I had. <br/> <br/>You don''t have your lenses added yet? You should do that.</td>', 'wow, nice shot!  I didn''t vote on this challenge, but I might have helped your score out if I had.  You don''t have your lenses added yet? You should do that.', '2005-05-11 02:12:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(1377158, 173648, 27845, '<td valign="top">Congrats Brad, I was looking for your image during the challenge but wouldn''t have thought it was this one. I like the exceptional composition. You proved that you can still produce outstanding pictures with your "old" camera, even in difficult situations.</td>', 'Congrats Brad, I was looking for your image during the challenge but wouldn''t have thought it was this one. I like the exceptional composition. You proved that you can still produce outstanding pictures with your "old" camera, even in difficult situations.', '2005-05-11 02:14:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(1377218, 173908, 31133, '<td valign="top">This was one of only a couple tens I gave for this challenge - I can''t believe this shot didn''t score higher. Really good job!</td>', 'This was one of only a couple tens I gave for this challenge - I can''t believe this shot didn''t score higher. Really good job!', '2005-05-11 02:31:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(1377231, 173599, 1031, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a nice variety of comments! I knew a lot of people would hate this, but it''s nice to see a sprinkling of the others as well.<br/> <br/>While agree this was <i><b>highly</b></i> processed, I''m not sure it''s really over-processed, considering what I was starting with:<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=176746" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/1031/thumb/176746.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/1031/thumb/176746.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/1031/thumb/176746.jpg"/></a> <br/>Re-sized original capture.<br/> <br/>The editing steps are listed in the Photographer''s Comments area above.</td>', 'Wow, what a nice variety of comments! I knew a lot of people would hate this, but it''s nice to see a sprinkling of the others as well. While agree this was highly processed, I''m not sure it''s really over-processed, considering what I was starting with:  Re-sized original capture. The editing steps are listed in the Photographer''s Comments area above.', '2005-05-11 02:37:32.000000', NULL, 0),
