(1377275, 173374, 19552, '<td valign="top">To all those commenting on the sharpness of the picture, I implore you to pay attention to the globe (the SUBJECT) and tell me what part of that they find soft-focused. <br/> <br/></td>', 'To all those commenting on the sharpness of the picture, I implore you to pay attention to the globe (the SUBJECT) and tell me what part of that they find soft-focused.  ', '2005-05-11 03:14:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(1377310, 173399, 18450, '<td valign="top">This is so lovely! Congrats Alan on your well deserved blue.</td>', 'This is so lovely! Congrats Alan on your well deserved blue.', '2005-05-11 03:47:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(1377311, 173409, 881, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments!  It honestly did not occur to me at the time that people would think of a meteor or a comet.  Silly me!  It was a 10-second exposure on a Canon EOS 20D, with a wide enough angle that the stars did not begin to streak.  The high level of apparent grain, despite an original ISO of 400, was due to some drastic curves to bring out the relatively dark clouds; I was limited by the dynamic range because I was trying not to blow out the highlights of the Iridium flare.  Thus, the effective ISO was probably more like 3200.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments!  It honestly did not occur to me at the time that people would think of a meteor or a comet.  Silly me!  It was a 10-second exposure on a Canon EOS 20D, with a wide enough angle that the stars did not begin to streak.  The high level of apparent grain, despite an original ISO of 400, was due to some drastic curves to bring out the relatively dark clouds; I was limited by the dynamic range because I was trying not to blow out the highlights of the Iridium flare.  Thus, the effective ISO was probably more like 3200.', '2005-05-11 03:47:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(1377322, 173903, 18080, '<td valign="top">No justice!<br/> <br/>This shot should have ribboned.<br/> <br/>One of the best of this comp.<br/> <br/>Well done.</td>', 'No justice! This shot should have ribboned. One of the best of this comp. Well done.', '2005-05-11 03:57:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(1377337, 173399, 2022, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot, congratulations on a well deserved ribbon !</td>', 'Awesome shot, congratulations on a well deserved ribbon !', '2005-05-11 04:27:24.000000', NULL, 0),
