(1377505, 172742, 20066, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what people around here call late night but I call it late night when sunrise is at four something.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I don''t know what people around here call late night but I call it late night when sunrise is at four something. ', '2005-05-11 07:20:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(1377506, 173217, 8522, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by BobsterLobster:</b></div><hr/><i> I''ve seen this on the South Bank... not sure what you''ve brought to this though. Composition doesn''t feel particularly imaginative. Across the river, there''s so much you could have included in an imaginative way. And the Eye! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I did receive your pm after I left this comment, which should really have appeared here after the challenge. One of these days I''m going to change my preferences to anonymous commenting... Anyway, I didn''t mean you should have taken a photo of something else, but that IMO you should have INCLUDED something else in this shot. You''ve taken a photo of something many of us at DPC have seen and composed it dead centre. What do YOU think raises this shot above a snapshot?</td>', 'Originally posted by BobsterLobster: I''ve seen this on the South Bank... not sure what you''ve brought to this though. Composition doesn''t feel particularly imaginative. Across the river, there''s so much you could have included in an imaginative way. And the Eye!   I did receive your pm after I left this comment, which should really have appeared here after the challenge. One of these days I''m going to change my preferences to anonymous commenting... Anyway, I didn''t mean you should have taken a photo of something else, but that IMO you should have INCLUDED something else in this shot. You''ve taken a photo of something many of us at DPC have seen and composed it dead centre. What do YOU think raises this shot above a snapshot?', '2005-05-11 07:21:06.000000', NULL, 0),
