(1377731, 173738, 32848, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments.  To answer some of your queries.  This picture is taken using the spotlights that illuminate the monument.  Unfortunately it is rather harsh in certain areas and less so in others making it difficult to get a good, even exposure.  With regard to the composition, I did try and get some branches into the shot by moving around to the right, but they don''t show up too well.  I now wish I had taken from some more angles, but took most shots from a similar angle, just playing with exposure.<br/> <br/>The monument is in a street near Gloucester Cathedral marking the spot where the poor bishop was toasted!</td>', 'Thanks for the comments.  To answer some of your queries.  This picture is taken using the spotlights that illuminate the monument.  Unfortunately it is rather harsh in certain areas and less so in others making it difficult to get a good, even exposure.  With regard to the composition, I did try and get some branches into the shot by moving around to the right, but they don''t show up too well.  I now wish I had taken from some more angles, but took most shots from a similar angle, just playing with exposure. The monument is in a street near Gloucester Cathedral marking the spot where the poor bishop was toasted!', '2005-05-11 09:49:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(1377735, 173597, 24073, '<td valign="top">Utah is absolutely stunning, and I wish one day to move back.  Aside from that fantastic shot, and between us I wished it would of took the blue, instead of the same old bridges I new there would be a ton of.</td>', 'Utah is absolutely stunning, and I wish one day to move back.  Aside from that fantastic shot, and between us I wished it would of took the blue, instead of the same old bridges I new there would be a ton of.', '2005-05-11 09:50:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(1377747, 173912, 16739, '<td valign="top">great shot , should have scored higher</td>', 'great shot , should have scored higher', '2005-05-11 09:55:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(1377750, 172365, 24073, '<td valign="top">Ok, i really wasnt going to post a congrats, because I figured you got that already, but the post preceding mine says that the branches are a demise to the photo, and I just wanted to say that I disagree utterly, the branches are a spectacular addition to the photo, and well captured.  Congrats, my favorite!</td>', 'Ok, i really wasnt going to post a congrats, because I figured you got that already, but the post preceding mine says that the branches are a demise to the photo, and I just wanted to say that I disagree utterly, the branches are a spectacular addition to the photo, and well captured.  Congrats, my favorite!', '2005-05-11 09:56:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(1377759, 173887, 27636, '<td valign="top">Thanx all... this picture actually did much better than I had hoped...  Many of you who commented mentioned the "tilting horizon line"  Unfortunately, the horizon is actually very straight.  There is a pool in front of the egg, and I didn''t take the picture looking straight on.  Hence the apperance of tilt.  Oh, well, I didn''t realize at the time that that was how it looked.<br/>p.s.  The Egg is a convention center in down-town Albany, NY - on the plaza.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-05-11 09:00:24.</i></td>', 'Thanx all... this picture actually did much better than I had hoped...  Many of you who commented mentioned the "tilting horizon line"  Unfortunately, the horizon is actually very straight.  There is a pool in front of the egg, and I didn''t take the picture looking straight on.  Hence the apperance of tilt.  Oh, well, I didn''t realize at the time that that was how it looked.p.s.  The Egg is a convention center in down-town Albany, NY - on the plaza.', '2005-05-11 09:59:29.000000', '2005-05-11 10:00:24.000000', 0),
(1377761, 172318, 24073, '<td valign="top">very happy photo, gives me a feeling of vacation, margaritas, dancing, and romance.  If you can you throw all that together and capture it in a photo, you did so here, for me anyway.  Good, good!</td>', 'very happy photo, gives me a feeling of vacation, margaritas, dancing, and romance.  If you can you throw all that together and capture it in a photo, you did so here, for me anyway.  Good, good!', '2005-05-11 10:00:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(1377790, 172610, 6870, '<td valign="top">Super work! This is very well conceived and executed. Congratulations!</td>', 'Super work! This is very well conceived and executed. Congratulations!', '2005-05-11 10:21:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(1377794, 172697, 34997, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the compliments :D <br/> <br/>As this is my first submission here I''m fairly pleased with the outcome, didn´t know what to expect. Maybe some of you rated it lower than usual because it wasnt a late night shot in your opinion?<br/> <br/>There is nothing odd about a land just because the suns still up late at night ;) I took this picture between 21:00 and 22:00. I think a picture from the same time from most other parts of the world would qualify as a late night photo.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-05-11 12:07:43.</i></td>', 'Thanks for the compliments :D  As this is my first submission here I''m fairly pleased with the outcome, didn´t know what to expect. Maybe some of you rated it lower than usual because it wasnt a late night shot in your opinion? There is nothing odd about a land just because the suns still up late at night ;) I took this picture between 21:00 and 22:00. I think a picture from the same time from most other parts of the world would qualify as a late night photo.', '2005-05-11 10:24:28.000000', '2005-05-11 13:07:43.000000', 0),
(1377832, 173439, 8522, '<td valign="top">You learn a new thing everyday. I was scared to try this technique in case the DPC mob arrived to burn my house down once they discovered I''d ''cheated'', but you seem okay!</td>', 'You learn a new thing everyday. I was scared to try this technique in case the DPC mob arrived to burn my house down once they discovered I''d ''cheated'', but you seem okay!', '2005-05-11 10:34:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(1377837, 173397, 36981, '<td valign="top">Mea culpa, mea culpa.  My first challenge, and hopefully there''s nowhere to go but up.  Yes, I hadn''t noticed that it had to be outside (lesson learned: read the full description), and I got the time on the clock completely wrong (lesson learned: pay attention to details), and I agree that the phone was really dirty (it''s clean now!).<br/> <br/>Many many thanks to all commentators, and particularly those who liked it - you made my day!</td>', 'Mea culpa, mea culpa.  My first challenge, and hopefully there''s nowhere to go but up.  Yes, I hadn''t noticed that it had to be outside (lesson learned: read the full description), and I got the time on the clock completely wrong (lesson learned: pay attention to details), and I agree that the phone was really dirty (it''s clean now!). Many many thanks to all commentators, and particularly those who liked it - you made my day!', '2005-05-11 10:35:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(1377852, 173217, 36606, '<td valign="top">Bobster,<br/> <br/>Yeah you are right. It was just a snapshot really. It was my first post on DP and felt a little annoyed at your post. But yes, certainly is just a snapshot(never to be repeated) my new tirangle one is quite a bit better. <br/> <br/>cheers,<br/> <br/>Alexsaberi</td>', 'Bobster, Yeah you are right. It was just a snapshot really. It was my first post on DP and felt a little annoyed at your post. But yes, certainly is just a snapshot(never to be repeated) my new tirangle one is quite a bit better.  cheers, Alexsaberi', '2005-05-11 10:38:23.000000', NULL, 0),
