(1377911, 173434, 25095, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what is funnier, that you didn''t finish last or that there are so many that really thought there was a cow there and didn''t see it.  I''m hoping they are joking but most of them really seem like they sincerely think there is a cow there that you messed up shooting.  Good job.</td>', 'I don''t know what is funnier, that you didn''t finish last or that there are so many that really thought there was a cow there and didn''t see it.  I''m hoping they are joking but most of them really seem like they sincerely think there is a cow there that you messed up shooting.  Good job.', '2005-05-11 10:48:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(1377923, 173259, 30817, '<td valign="top">I attempted to create a feeling of deep in the night.  To those who asked what was the focus point, it is those two people you see in the oddly lit windows. Neither could sleep and both got back out of bed, perhaps got on the computer and who knows; may have contacted each other in a chatroom, not guessing they live across the empty, sleeping street from one another.  A big city has a lot of stories.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-05-15 10:32:50.</i></td>', 'I attempted to create a feeling of deep in the night.  To those who asked what was the focus point, it is those two people you see in the oddly lit windows. Neither could sleep and both got back out of bed, perhaps got on the computer and who knows; may have contacted each other in a chatroom, not guessing they live across the empty, sleeping street from one another.  A big city has a lot of stories.', '2005-05-11 10:50:18.000000', '2005-05-15 11:32:50.000000', 0),
(1377958, 173436, 28276, '<td valign="top">well everyone, thanks for all the useful comments.  since this was done without much thought or planning, i never thought the flash would be such a distraction.  (actually, i rather liked the effect of having the flash in the shot, but oh well)<br/> <br/>next time, i''ll have to put a little more time into a idea...</td>', 'well everyone, thanks for all the useful comments.  since this was done without much thought or planning, i never thought the flash would be such a distraction.  (actually, i rather liked the effect of having the flash in the shot, but oh well) next time, i''ll have to put a little more time into a idea...', '2005-05-11 10:55:53.000000', NULL, 0),
