(1378157, 173779, 32572, '<td valign="top">LOVED this shot!  Gave it our only 10!  Not only is it a great photo, but it also completely captured the feel of "LATE" night, as opposed to just "night."  Which SO many entries did not.  You should have placed higher, man.  You were robbed! :-)</td>', 'LOVED this shot!  Gave it our only 10!  Not only is it a great photo, but it also completely captured the feel of "LATE" night, as opposed to just "night."  Which SO many entries did not.  You should have placed higher, man.  You were robbed! :-)', '2005-05-11 11:44:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(1378192, 173722, 28875, '<td valign="top">Thanks for comments, the photo was taken at around 1am with tripod, I tried it in B/W, but it did not do it for me, the stong colour cast is from a street light.<br/>Someone mentioned in their comments about the legs looking healthy? The thing is, the photo was taken in the old railway station  in Berlin Grunewld, which is now a memorial, jews where transported in wagens to camps like Auschwitz over 50,000 from this one station alone, the people where of course  healthy before  they got on the trains and arrived at the camps.<br/>But overall I don''t think the photo is quite strong enough for the seriousness of the horror of the Holocaust.<br/>I tried.<br/>Thanks again, for critique.</td>', 'Thanks for comments, the photo was taken at around 1am with tripod, I tried it in B/W, but it did not do it for me, the stong colour cast is from a street light.Someone mentioned in their comments about the legs looking healthy? The thing is, the photo was taken in the old railway station  in Berlin Grunewld, which is now a memorial, jews where transported in wagens to camps like Auschwitz over 50,000 from this one station alone, the people where of course  healthy before  they got on the trains and arrived at the camps.But overall I don''t think the photo is quite strong enough for the seriousness of the horror of the Holocaust.I tried.Thanks again, for critique.', '2005-05-11 11:59:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(1378247, 173472, 31931, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the ribbon!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-05-11 11:14:00.</i></td>', 'Congratulations on the ribbon!', '2005-05-11 12:12:26.000000', '2005-05-11 12:14:00.000000', 0),
