(1378432, 173779, 34247, '<td valign="top">It''s shots like this that makes me wonder how some people can give it a 1, 2 or 3, or even 4. I understand subjectivity, but I think people who gave shots like this (and I emphasize that phrasing) low scores perhaps need to get their subjectivity filter examined. Going on my favorites. Thanks.</td>', 'It''s shots like this that makes me wonder how some people can give it a 1, 2 or 3, or even 4. I understand subjectivity, but I think people who gave shots like this (and I emphasize that phrasing) low scores perhaps need to get their subjectivity filter examined. Going on my favorites. Thanks.', '2005-05-11 12:53:18.000000', NULL, 0),
