(1378505, 172365, 10124, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by sacredspirit:</b></div><hr/><i> Ok, i really wasnt going to post a congrats, because I figured you got that already, but the post preceding mine says that the branches are a demise to the photo, and I just wanted to say that I disagree utterly, the branches are a spectacular addition to the photo, and well captured.  Congrats, my favorite! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for the compliment! And I obviously agree with you. :)</td>', 'Originally posted by sacredspirit: Ok, i really wasnt going to post a congrats, because I figured you got that already, but the post preceding mine says that the branches are a demise to the photo, and I just wanted to say that I disagree utterly, the branches are a spectacular addition to the photo, and well captured.  Congrats, my favorite!   Thanks for the compliment! And I obviously agree with you. :)', '2005-05-11 13:19:24.000000', NULL, 0),
