(1378863, 172742, 20066, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Tom_Robbrecht:</b></div><hr/><i> Darn, what a shame you didn''t place higher.<br/>Four something is early morning I guess. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Well, if IO''m not sleeping at four something the reason is most likely I''ve not gone to sleep yet.  It is rather unlikely I did wake up so early.<br/> <br/>But what surpise me is that most of the pictures in this challenge did not at all represent LATE night as I understand it.  The majority of pictures are just some middle night shots.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-05-11 19:14:27.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Tom_Robbrecht: Darn, what a shame you didn''t place higher.Four something is early morning I guess.  Well, if IO''m not sleeping at four something the reason is most likely I''ve not gone to sleep yet.  It is rather unlikely I did wake up so early. But what surpise me is that most of the pictures in this challenge did not at all represent LATE night as I understand it.  The majority of pictures are just some middle night shots.', '2005-05-11 14:47:08.000000', '2005-05-11 20:14:27.000000', 0),
