(1379053, 173845, 29904, '<td valign="top">This shot caught my eye just from the thumbnail.  I really like it and gave it one of few 10s. After reading other''s coments, I must agree that the tree branches are a little too busy and the trunk a little too prominent.  However the star trails are fabulous and the time shown on the clocks (good choice - 3) is creative and striking - for those who really understand what they are looking at. They add movement to such a still art-form.  <br/>You have so few shots on your portfolio, but all are creative and great.  You obviously enjoy shooting long exposure shots.  I am envious of your Canon SLR :)  Hope to see more of your work soon!</td>', 'This shot caught my eye just from the thumbnail.  I really like it and gave it one of few 10s. After reading other''s coments, I must agree that the tree branches are a little too busy and the trunk a little too prominent.  However the star trails are fabulous and the time shown on the clocks (good choice - 3) is creative and striking - for those who really understand what they are looking at. They add movement to such a still art-form.  You have so few shots on your portfolio, but all are creative and great.  You obviously enjoy shooting long exposure shots.  I am envious of your Canon SLR :)  Hope to see more of your work soon!', '2005-05-11 15:47:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(1379079, 173860, 29904, '<td valign="top">Well I learned something here.  I did not know you could get such stars without a filter.  Of course it helps to have such a huge f stop range...<br/>Really nice!  gave you a 9.</td>', 'Well I learned something here.  I did not know you could get such stars without a filter.  Of course it helps to have such a huge f stop range...Really nice!  gave you a 9.', '2005-05-11 15:53:11.000000', NULL, 0),
