(1379277, 172519, 332, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the great comments. Got some "It''s not realy late night". Some people probably just thought the pictures should be taken at night. I took this late night. Took it around 23:15 or something like that. And it matters if you take the picture in Iceland where the sun sets much later than in souther parts of the world :)<br/> <br/>I would have liked to clean out the sensor dirt on the left like some of you pointed out. But being a open challenge that is not allowed.<br/> <br/>Here is a cleaner version of the shot. I would like to have submitted it like this:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=176912" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/332/thumb/176912.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/332/thumb/176912.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/332/thumb/176912.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Thanks for all the great comments. Got some "It''s not realy late night". Some people probably just thought the pictures should be taken at night. I took this late night. Took it around 23:15 or something like that. And it matters if you take the picture in Iceland where the sun sets much later than in souther parts of the world :) I would have liked to clean out the sensor dirt on the left like some of you pointed out. But being a open challenge that is not allowed. Here is a cleaner version of the shot. I would like to have submitted it like this:', '2005-05-11 16:46:15.000000', NULL, 0),
