(1380414, 173596, 12252, '<td valign="top">For those who wondered, yes, this is outside a museum complex in Balboa Park, San Diego, California. The greenish hue is from street lamps outside the field of view on the right. It never even occured to me that people would question whether this was outside or at night. I understand now why they did but when I entered it simply didn''t cross my mind.</td>', 'For those who wondered, yes, this is outside a museum complex in Balboa Park, San Diego, California. The greenish hue is from street lamps outside the field of view on the right. It never even occured to me that people would question whether this was outside or at night. I understand now why they did but when I entered it simply didn''t cross my mind.', '2005-05-12 02:18:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(1380462, 172610, 17613, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the red. Once more a simple, uncluttered image wins an award. Most has already been said but it is well deserved.<br/> <br/>Apart from the image, your description in English was almost as enchanting as the picture. My favourite part "the foam sprankled my filter" <b>WONDERFUL</b>. In future, when the rain or the sea  interrupts my photography I will remember being "sprankled" and won''t feel so annoyed.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-05-12 02:17:32.</i></td>', 'Congratulations on the red. Once more a simple, uncluttered image wins an award. Most has already been said but it is well deserved. Apart from the image, your description in English was almost as enchanting as the picture. My favourite part "the foam sprankled my filter" WONDERFUL. In future, when the rain or the sea  interrupts my photography I will remember being "sprankled" and won''t feel so annoyed.', '2005-05-12 03:16:18.000000', '2005-05-12 03:17:32.000000', 0),
