(1380838, 173781, 34228, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for your support, It really means a lot to me! : )  I´m like most of you for sure, deeply in love with this great hobby - photography.  It´s funny how something like photography can change your view of life.<br/>When I made this shot, it was starting to rain a litle bit and midninght was only fiew minutes away.  I was surprised how well it turned out and outshined all previous late night photos I had shot.<br/> <br/>Thank you all again,  cheers  ; )<br/>eyjo</td>', 'Thank you all for your support, It really means a lot to me! : )  I´m like most of you for sure, deeply in love with this great hobby - photography.  It´s funny how something like photography can change your view of life.When I made this shot, it was starting to rain a litle bit and midninght was only fiew minutes away.  I was surprised how well it turned out and outshined all previous late night photos I had shot. Thank you all again,  cheers  ; )eyjo', '2005-05-12 10:29:19.000000', NULL, 0),
