(1383482, 173434, 31738, '<td valign="top">This picture proved to me that the voting on this site is totally fixed. This photo actually received 12 "10" votes. Now that tells you something is definitely wrong. Was this some sort of joke just to see what comments or votes you get out of it? LOL. Funny very funny.<br/> <br/></td>', 'This picture proved to me that the voting on this site is totally fixed. This photo actually received 12 "10" votes. Now that tells you something is definitely wrong. Was this some sort of joke just to see what comments or votes you get out of it? LOL. Funny very funny. ', '2005-05-13 11:24:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(1383911, 173257, 31533, '<td valign="top">I would like to thank everybody for voting and commenting on my picture. This one broke my personal record.<br/>I still can''t understand how I missed the car on the left when I cropped the picture.<br/> <br/>I don''t know the city of Bruges all that well and I did no research at all before going, this was one of those ''in the spur of the moment'' shots<br/>Though the picture looks tranquil, the city certainly wasn''t. <br/>Bruges has a big fair in May, it was a warm evening and the streets were filled with tourists. I heard more English spoken than Flemish that night.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-05-17 02:17:15.</i></td>', 'I would like to thank everybody for voting and commenting on my picture. This one broke my personal record.I still can''t understand how I missed the car on the left when I cropped the picture. I don''t know the city of Bruges all that well and I did no research at all before going, this was one of those ''in the spur of the moment'' shotsThough the picture looks tranquil, the city certainly wasn''t. Bruges has a big fair in May, it was a warm evening and the streets were filled with tourists. I heard more English spoken than Flemish that night.', '2005-05-13 14:57:57.000000', '2005-05-17 03:17:15.000000', 0),
