 level established: //www.mir.com.my/rb/photography/hardwares/classics/eos/EF-lenses/index.htm  which acts as an extension to the Canon EOS-1N site that is about to be finished soon:  //www.mir.com.my/rb/photography/hardwares/classics/eos/EOS-1n/index.htm  The earlier completed project on Canon was FD series bodies:  //www.mir.com.my/rb/photography/companies/canon/fdresources/fdlenses/index.htm  SORRY for intruding if this request has offended you. Please revert if possible because if this is not acceptable to yoy, I may have to look around again, haha... Lastly, thanks for your time attending this mail. Hope you have a good day to follow. I can be contacted via my personal Email: leofoo@mir.com.my', '2006-05-14 03:38:31.000000', NULL, 0),
