(2622734, 173436, 55738, '<td valign="top">I think I would have liked it more if you have covered the flash so that the camera didn''t see it.  Try it again with a black card or fabric or something covering it.  I think that will give it an even eerier feel.  Especially if you also wear black pants!  But it''s a cool idea none the less!</td>', 'I think I would have liked it more if you have covered the flash so that the camera didn''t see it.  Try it again with a black card or fabric or something covering it.  I think that will give it an even eerier feel.  Especially if you also wear black pants!  But it''s a cool idea none the less!', '2006-07-14 16:07:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(2930789, 173779, 23484, '<td valign="top">You really got a raw deal on this shot.  This shot is absolutely<br/>supurb. The lighting and the smoke really add the live atmosphere effect to this.  Great shot.</td>', 'You really got a raw deal on this shot.  This shot is absolutelysupurb. The lighting and the smoke really add the live atmosphere effect to this.  Great shot.', '2006-10-15 20:38:43.000000', NULL, 0),
