(3944220, 172367, 69008, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea, and it makes excellent color images too. <br/>1 stop less exposure would make the colors more saturated and reduce the brightness of the light bulbs. <br/>Beautiful just like it is.</td>', 'This is a great idea, and it makes excellent color images too. 1 stop less exposure would make the colors more saturated and reduce the brightness of the light bulbs. Beautiful just like it is.', '2007-07-28 01:33:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4078536, 172546, 24666, '<td valign="top">I think the soft focus on your subject adds to the tranquility of the image, to me it says the world is quiet and so am I, at peace in me.</td>', 'I think the soft focus on your subject adds to the tranquility of the image, to me it says the world is quiet and so am I, at peace in me.', '2007-09-10 16:46:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4315995, 173296, 63269, '<td valign="top">Shooting in the dark is hard, but if there had been any way to get rid of the grain, that would have helped this image. Perhaps a tripod and an even longer long exposure would have allowed you to lower the ISO and eliminate the grain. Also, the colors could use some slight adjustments perhaps... but maybe that''s just me. :) I really like the whole idea here though, and the composition and point of view is superb!</td>', 'Shooting in the dark is hard, but if there had been any way to get rid of the grain, that would have helped this image. Perhaps a tripod and an even longer long exposure would have allowed you to lower the ISO and eliminate the grain. Also, the colors could use some slight adjustments perhaps... but maybe that''s just me. :) I really like the whole idea here though, and the composition and point of view is superb!', '2007-12-15 13:20:13.000000', NULL, 0),
